 with margaritas and other cocktails. The restaurant has both indoor and outdoor seating and offers WiFi. The business has a friendly and welcoming atmosphere, with a casual vibe and a skilled staff. Reviews from customers indicate that the food is delicious and service is excellent, with one reviewer mentioning that their bartender, Adam, was particularly friendly and knowledgeable. However, one reviewer noted that the flavors were lacking in their meal. Overall, Los Arroyos appears to be a reliable option for those looking for authentic Mexican cuisine in the area.", "role": "training", "sealed_prompt_sha256": "sha256:f0d9d9c7d694e34fafe2e877c84e7855225bfb917676bfebc91b7b3f9ecf188e", "sealed_prompt_token_count": 827, "sentence_count": 3, "sentence_version": "carnot-utf8-sentence-v1", "source_group_id": "group-02626627ab4a9917f71c0b9b", "source_sha256": "sha256:a0477b40ed2b3af858bd54ce681d9ce354c3f70c7915517e1ea665b27b4ef250", "source_text": "{\"address\":\"5764 Calle Real\",\"attributes\":{\"Ambience\":{\"casual\":true,\"classy\":null,\"divey\":false,\"hipster\":null,\"intimate\":false,\"romantic\":null,\"touristy\":null,\"trendy\":null,\"upscale\":null},\"BusinessParking\":{\"garage\":false,\"lot\":true,\"street\":false,\"valet\":false,\"validated\":false},\"Music\":null,\"OutdoorSeating\":true,\"RestaurantsGoodForGroups\":null,\"RestaurantsReservations\":true,\"RestaurantsTakeOut\":true,\"WiFi\":\"no\"},\"business_stars\":3.5,\"categories\":\"Restaurants, Mexican, Breakfast & Brunch\",\"city\":\"Goleta\",\"hours\":{\"Friday\":\"11:0-21:0\",\"Monday\":\"11:0-21:0\",\"Saturday\":\"10:0-21:0\",\"Sunday\":\"10:0-21:0\",\"Thursday\":\"11:0-21:0\",\"Tuesday\":\"11:0-21:0\",\"Wednesday\":\"11:0-21:0\"},\"name\":\"Los Arroyos Mexican Restaurant & Take Out\",\"review_info\":[{\"review_date\":\"2022-01-15 22:19:36\",\"review_stars\":5.0,\"review_text\":\"We had a great time here last night! The burritos were splendid and the generous side of chips did not go unnoticed. Ad