ing that their bartender, Adam, was particularly friendly and knowledgeable. However, one reviewer noted that the flavors were lacking in their meal. Overall, Los Arroyos appears to be a reliable option for those looking for authentic Mexican cuisine in the area.", "role": "training", "sealed_prompt_sha256": "sha256:e21e8a99f5bdc1ef1d4c6b07aca1a90898ad527b2071fdded773553fab06f4d9", "sealed_prompt_token_count": 827, "sentence_count": 3, "sentence_version": "carnot-utf8-sentence-v1", "source_group_id": "group-02626627ab4a9917f71c0b9b", "source_sha256": "sha256:a0477b40ed2b3af858bd54ce681d9ce354c3f70c7915517e1ea665b27b4ef250", "source_text": "{\"address\":\"5764 Calle Real\",\"attributes\":{\"Ambience\":{\"casual\":true,\"classy\":null,\"divey\":false,\"hipster\":null,\"intimate\":false,\"romantic\":null,\"touristy\":null,\"trendy\":null,\"upscale\":null},\"BusinessParking\":{\"garage\":false,\"lot\":true,\"street\":false,\"valet\":false,\"validated\":false},\"Music\":null,\"OutdoorSeating\":true,\"RestaurantsGoodForGroups\":null,\"RestaurantsReservations\":true,\"RestaurantsTakeOut\":true,\"WiFi\":\"no\"},\"business_stars\":3.5,\"categories\":\"Restaurants, Mexican, Breakfast & Brunch\",\"city\":\"Goleta\",\"hours\":{\"Friday\":\"11:0-21:0\",\"Monday\":\"11:0-21:0\",\"Saturday\":\"10:0-21:0\",\"Sunday\":\"10:0-21:0\",\"Thursday\":\"11:0-21:0\",\"Tuesday\":\"11:0-21:0\",\"Wednesday\":\"11:0-21:0\"},\"name\":\"Los Arroyos Mexican Restaurant & Take Out\",\"review_info\":[{\"review_date\":\"2022-01-15 22:19:36\",\"review_stars\":5.0,\"review_text\":\"We had a great time here last night! The burritos were splendid and the generous side of chips did not go unnoticed. Adam was our bartender, he was skilled and fun to talk too. He's Italian, so naturally I had to ask him 'if he liked Sebastian Maniscalco?' He said, \\\"Yes!\\\" (And that is when I decided that Adam and Los Arroyos were getting a 5-star review). Adam made sure we received all of our take-out orders and remembe