e,\"RestaurantsGoodForGroups\":null,\"RestaurantsReservations\":true,\"RestaurantsTakeOut\":true,\"WiFi\":\"no\"},\"business_stars\":3.5,\"categories\":\"Restaurants, Mexican, Breakfast & Brunch\",\"city\":\"Goleta\",\"hours\":{\"Friday\":\"11:0-21:0\",\"Monday\":\"11:0-21:0\",\"Saturday\":\"10:0-21:0\",\"Sunday\":\"10:0-21:0\",\"Thursday\":\"11:0-21:0\",\"Tuesday\":\"11:0-21:0\",\"Wednesday\":\"11:0-21:0\"},\"name\":\"Los Arroyos Mexican Restaurant & Take Out\",\"review_info\":[{\"review_date\":\"2022-01-15 22:19:36\",\"review_stars\":5.0,\"review_text\":\"We had a great time here last night! The burritos were splendid and the generous side of chips did not go unnoticed. Adam was our bartender, he was skilled and fun to talk too. He's Italian, so naturally I had to ask him 'if he liked Sebastian Maniscalco?' He said, \\\"Yes!\\\" (And that is when I decided that Adam and Los Arroyos were getting a 5-star review). Adam made sure we received all of our take-out orders and remembered our drink modifications. Angel was equally up to par and made a great margarita recommendation. Take care guys, we'll see you soon!\"},{\"review_date\":\"2022-01-03 00:37:47\",\"review_stars\":2.0,\"review_text\":\"Doesn't have any flavor. Tastes gross half way thru eating it. Was a Take out delivery, wouldn't order again\"},{\"review_date\":\"2021-12-27 02:16:02\",\"review_stars\":5.0,\"review_text\":\"My favorite place to eat!!! The tacos are so good! And I can practically DRINK the green salsa!!!  So good. First place I go to when I'm back in SB\"}],\"state\":\"CA\"}", "source_version": {"corpus": "ragtruth", "license": "MIT", "release_revision": "c103204b9ce28d6bbad859304bf30de72b8ed8fe"}, "state_reset": true, "token_boundary_receipts": {" A": true, " B": true}, "tokenize_s": 0.0015460449994861847, "tokenizer_identity": {"bos_token_id": "248044", "eos_token_id": "248046", "metadata_model": "gpt2", "representation": "embedded_gguf"}, "window_index": 2, "window_sha256": "sha256:b377b668