ering a range of American (New), sandwich, pizza, and Mexican cuisine. The dining commons has specific operating hours, opening from 21:0 to 0:30 on Monday to Thursday, and from 17:0 to 20:0 on Friday, Saturday, and Sunday.\n\nCustomers have left mixed reviews about De La Guerra Dining Commons. One customer expressed dissatisfaction, mentioning long lines and subpar food, except for the hard-boiled eggs. Another customer, however, had a more positive experience, describing the dining commons as clean with a variety of options. They appreciated the quality of food compared to other campus dining halls and praised the kind staff. They also mentioned the premium views of Isla Vista and the UCSB community.\n\nAnother customer highlighted the expansive variety of food options at De La Guerra Dining Commons. They mentioned burgers being available for breakfast, lunch, and dinner but noted that they were sometimes undercooked or even frozen. They also mentioned experiencing diarrhea from the Mexican food. However, they enjoyed the wide variety of meat options, particularly the fish cakes.\n\nOverall, De La Guerra Dining Commons has a rating of 3.0 stars. The provided reviews highlight both positive and negative aspects of the dining experience, allowing potential customers to make an informed decision.", "role": "training", "sealed_prompt_sha256": "sha256:49fb22a2ea8385764f86d2ff16fc74129b17c444fc2e8481998eb041a84da968", "sealed_prompt_token_count": 946, "sentence_count": 6, "sentence_version": "carnot-utf8-sentence-v1", "source_group_id": "group-05f22381724a0914a4f0ca7b", "source_sha256": "sha256:4ec8ee623c891bedaa72806036797f67588ad8c49ff8b4d0844f5356a1d391c0", "source_text": "{\"address\":\"1501 Residential Services\",\"attributes\":{\"Ambience\":{\"casual\":null,\"classy\":false,\"divey\":false,\"hipster\":false,\"intimate\":false,\"romantic\":null,\"touristy\":null,\"trendy\":null,\"upscale\":false},\"BusinessParking\":null,\"Music\":null,\"OutdoorSeating\":true,\"Res