 email account. (On most versions of Outlook Express, there will be a My Accounts tab, or a similarly-named option in the Mail menu.) Locate and click on the Servers tab. Find the box labelled SMTP..Here, you will enter the name of the outgoing server Verizon uses.ouble-click on the option leading to your email account. (On most versions of Outlook Express, there will be a My Accounts tab, or a similarly-named option in the Mail menu.) Locate and click on the Servers tab. Find the box labelled SMTP.. Here, you will enter the name of the outgoing server Verizon uses.\\n\\n\",\"question\":\"how to set up an email account on verizon\"}", "source_version": {"corpus": "ragtruth", "license": "MIT", "release_revision": "c103204b9ce28d6bbad859304bf30de72b8ed8fe"}, "state_reset": true, "token_boundary_receipts": {" A": true, " B": true}, "tokenize_s": 0.001298791000408528, "tokenizer_identity": {"bos_token_id": "248044", "eos_token_id": "248046", "metadata_model": "gpt2", "representation": "embedded_gguf"}, "window_index": 0, "window_sha256": "sha256:f0043c621632937c84fd90cee93a5f149252d4efa230d39352730be8d46ebbf9", "window_version": "carnot-balanced-contiguous-v1"}, {"actual_last_evaluated_position": 801, "archived_pilot_reuse": false, "arm": "focused_window", "attempted": true, "byte_end": 806, "byte_start": 428, "call_id": "sha256:f2597efda04cb76b642814b8", "disposition": "complete", "eligible": true, "error": null, "generated_tokens": 0, "gold_label": null, "group_id": "group-08d0af9e22507507b0ae67b6", "kv_state_id": "reset-epoch-035", "label_to_option_id": {" A": "supported", " B": "contains_unsupported"}, "log_odds_contains_unsupported": 1.2182483673095703, "marked_response": "To set up an email account on Verizon using Microsoft Outlook, follow these steps:\n\n1. Open Microsoft Outlook and go to the \"Change/View\" menu.\n2. Double-click on the email account you want to configure to access the settings screen.\n3. Check the \"My Server Requires Authentication\" box.\n