279, 3008, 6043, 314, 8790, 3791, 2077, 3761, 78890, 11, 864, 369, 2361, 913, 314, 3012, 33980, 52870, 1172, 279, 8790, 3791, 2077, 2902, 13, 561, 3008, 6043, 314, 411, 52870, 2830, 2438, 2022, 11, 52385, 11, 466, 40613, 3663, 506, 279, 2660, 314, 24277, 11, 321, 975, 3102, 3008, 6043, 1680, 430, 15532, 2346, 466, 62532, 1172, 279, 6574, 421, 628, 381, 3753, 321, 6273, 13, 733, 8581, 4886, 11, 781, 1189, 1325, 14399, 310, 3921, 13, 271, 55025, 198, 32, 25, 7021, 1892, 561, 2400, 1965, 369, 7021, 539, 279, 16713, 2450, 13, 198, 33, 25, 5435, 4748, 17675, 1892, 561, 1965, 5435, 39072, 2144, 13, 271, 5423, 1132, 279, 2904, 2306, 13, 198, 15666, 25], "raw_logits_by_display_label": {" A": 17.833036422729492, " B": 16.012739181518555}, "raw_logits_by_option_id": {"contains_unsupported": 16.012739181518555, "supported": 17.833036422729492}, "readout_s": 5.9871999837923795e-05, "request_id": "sha256:e27dee1b425977b62a047c1e", "requested_score_position": 552, "response_sha256": "sha256:6ef4c03f1fc8ac9cd724584fbe6062cefec7e9c0022b4997bbfc8e6c3baf0eb3", "response_text": "Based on the given passages, it is mentioned that the Restylane family of products has some restrictions on their usage. In passage 1, the product should not be used by individuals with severe allergies, allergy to lidocaine or gram-positive bacterial proteins used to make hyaluronic acid, or those who are prone to bleeding or have been diagnosed with a bleeding disorder. Passage 2 mentions that Restylane Lyft is approved for cheek augmentation, correction of age-related midface contour deficiencies in patients over the age of 21, and treatment of moderate to severe facial wrinkles and folds like nasolabial folds. However, passage 3 provides a detailed explanation of the side effects of Restylane Defyne, which is another type of wrinkle filler under the Restylane family. The side effects of this filler include redness, swelling, or bruising at the site of injection, and other possible side effects such as nodules or bumps under the skin that can be seen and felt. In rare cases, they may require surgery to remove.", "role": "training", "sealed_prompt_sha256": "sha256:5de159dd2fea2afb3bfb6c0bc60eb4c25cc5ea7400eecca1af6893d8f8497baa", "sealed_prompt_token_count": 553, "sentence_count": null, "sentence_version": null, "source_group_id": "group-0eea728263b0feff7547e8a2", "source_sha256": "sha256:6a271fe797b4b29020db93849fb821764d7c26392b51ee7043d6cdc210968dea", "source_text": "{\"passages\":\"passage 1:You should not use products within the Restylane family if: 1  You have severe allergies with a history of severe reactions (anaphylaxis) 2  You are allergic to lidocaine or to any of the gram-positive bacterial proteins used to make hyaluronic acid. 3  You are prone to bleeding or have been diagnosed with a bleeding disorder.\\n\\npassage 2:Natural-looking volume. and definition for your cheeks. Restylane\u00ae Lyft is approved by the FDA for cheek augmentation. and the correction of age-related midface contour deficiencies in. patients over the age of 21. This is in addition to treating. moderate to severe facial wrinkles and folds, such as nasolabial folds. (smile lines).\\n\\npassage 3:Restylane Defyne; Synthetic Wrinkle Fillers. This smaller category of wrinkle fillers includes lab-made substances that are not related to anything found naturally in the skin. All the fillers in this group have similar side effects, such as redness, swelling, or bruising at the site of the injection. Other side effects include nodules or bumps under the skin that can be seen and felt and that, in rare instances, may require surgery to remove.\\n\\n\",\"question\":\"restylane fillers side effects\"}", "source_version": {"corpus": "ragtruth", "license": "MIT", "release_revision": "c103204b9ce28d6bbad859304bf30de72b8ed8fe"}, "state_reset": true, "token_boundary_receipts": {" A": true, " B": true}, "tokenize_s": 0.0021858979998796713, "tokenizer_identity": {"bos_token_id": "248044", "eos_token_i