trings for every gig. Do not change your strings only if they break. You need to change all of the strings on your guitar at the same time on a regular basis.ou should change your strings at least every 2 or 3 months, but this can vary so much from player to player. Professionals will change strings for every gig. Do not change your strings only if they break. You need to change all of the strings on your guitar at the same time on a regular basis.\\n\\n\",\"question\":\"how often should i change guitar strings\"}", "source_version": {"corpus": "ragtruth", "license": "MIT", "release_revision": "c103204b9ce28d6bbad859304bf30de72b8ed8fe"}, "state_reset": true, "token_boundary_receipts": {" A": true, " B": true}, "tokenize_s": 0.0015026940000097966, "tokenizer_identity": {"bos_token_id": "248044", "eos_token_id": "248046", "metadata_model": "gpt2", "representation": "embedded_gguf"}, "window_index": 0, "window_sha256": "sha256:efc684d5b934a8958e7c0ca563fa14113e8375fe524c589623c2af24f87a3b6c", "window_version": "carnot-balanced-contiguous-v1"}, {"actual_last_evaluated_position": 704, "archived_pilot_reuse": false, "arm": "focused_window", "attempted": true, "byte_end": 437, "byte_start": 194, "call_id": "sha256:c76b96bb8c457d3a661080a1", "disposition": "complete", "eligible": true, "error": null, "generated_tokens": 0, "gold_label": null, "group_id": "group-13c464d7b92ea3181af1c00a", "kv_state_id": "reset-epoch-103", "label_to_option_id": {" A": "supported", " B": "contains_unsupported"}, "log_odds_contains_unsupported": -0.5699844360351561, "marked_response": "Based on the given passages, here's the answer to the question:\n\nAccording to the passages, it is recommended to change guitar strings every 2 to 3 weeks if you play 2-3 hours a day, every day. <<CARNOT_FOCUS_START:194:437>>If you play 30 minutes to an hour every day, you should change your strings every 4 to 6 weeks. If you play every once in a while, you should change your strings at least 3 times a year. Pro