s, but this can vary so much from player to player. Professionals will change strings for every gig. Do not change your strings only if they break. You need to change all of the strings on your guitar at the same time on a regular basis.\\n\\n\",\"question\":\"how often should i change guitar strings\"}", "source_version": {"corpus": "ragtruth", "license": "MIT", "release_revision": "c103204b9ce28d6bbad859304bf30de72b8ed8fe"}, "state_reset": true, "token_boundary_receipts": {" A": true, " B": true}, "tokenize_s": 0.0012118869999540038, "tokenizer_identity": {"bos_token_id": "248044", "eos_token_id": "248046", "metadata_model": "gpt2", "representation": "embedded_gguf"}, "window_index": 2, "window_sha256": "sha256:0d9220a8d35d33fa054db72def8fb589c86259f97e23a2902e1b61c24eae7d55", "window_version": "carnot-balanced-contiguous-v1"}, {"actual_last_evaluated_position": 682, "archived_pilot_reuse": false, "arm": "whole_response", "attempted": true, "byte_end": null, "byte_start": null, "call_id": "sha256:9239e1325ada94b3351f3201", "disposition": "complete", "eligible": true, "error": null, "generated_tokens": 0, "gold_label": null, "group_id": "group-13c464d7b92ea3181af1c00a", "kv_state_id": "reset-epoch-105", "label_to_option_id": {" A": "contains_unsupported", " B": "supported"}, "log_odds_contains_unsupported": 0.19185256958007812, "marked_response": null, "model_sha256": "sha256:7e78da5d7e3ae28d178121f58646953305f3e5bd3cb46f4a75584e8b6c6fe169", "native_option_token_ids": {" A": 357, " B": 417}, "normalization": "two_option_softmax_float64", "option_order": ["contains_unsupported", "supported"], "order_remapping": {" A": "contains_unsupported", " B": "supported"}, "prefill_s": 0.8195452919999298, "probabilities_by_option_id": {"contains_unsupported": 0.5478165653026053, "supported": 0.4521834346973948}, "prompt_sha256": "sha256:a36b0678b55f3578b1ac3c6bfadbdf19b4ed1db101e24f3f6ea71e970b8d3635", "prompt_token_count": 683, "prompt_token_ids": [1890, 1386, 1761, 364, 279, 