burger, Gary had a tuna melt.  The food was average diner food.  Not bad, not fantastic. \\n\\nGary knew I was sad that it wasn't a 1940's diner and he pointed out a sign that said Independently Operated. That made me feel a little better.\"},{\"review_date\":\"2008-07-24 21:58:55\",\"review_stars\":4.0,\"review_text\":\"It's a diner.  Come for a burger, fries, and a shake.  Food isn't too greasy and it's always satisfying.  The place is clean and service isn't bad.  Kind of expensive, but my stomach doesn't complain.\"}],\"state\":\"CA\"}", "source_version": {"corpus": "ragtruth", "license": "MIT", "release_revision": "c103204b9ce28d6bbad859304bf30de72b8ed8fe"}, "state_reset": true, "token_boundary_receipts": {" A": true, " B": true}, "tokenize_s": 0.001672633000453061, "tokenizer_identity": {"bos_token_id": "248044", "eos_token_id": "248046", "metadata_model": "gpt2", "representation": "embedded_gguf"}, "window_index": 2, "window_sha256": "sha256:2d221a6b65bcacc514033a9fcd79dbe48fa06e7ad9adf7eb179c66cc071b0bc3", "window_version": "carnot-balanced-contiguous-v1"}, {"actual_last_evaluated_position": 677, "archived_pilot_reuse": false, "arm": "whole_response", "attempted": true, "byte_end": null, "byte_start": null, "call_id": "sha256:fd90dfb4c972c306f80a3ba6", "disposition": "complete", "eligible": true, "error": null, "generated_tokens": 0, "gold_label": null, "group_id": "group-17f05526309dde98a764c76e", "kv_state_id": "reset-epoch-141", "label_to_option_id": {" A": "supported", " B": "contains_unsupported"}, "log_odds_contains_unsupported": -1.9733257293701172, "marked_response": null, "model_sha256": "sha256:7e78da5d7e3ae28d178121f58646953305f3e5bd3cb46f4a75584e8b6c6fe169", "native_option_token_ids": {" A": 357, " B": 417}, "normalization": "two_option_softmax_float64", "option_order": ["supported", "contains_unsupported"], "order_remapping": {" A": "supported", " B": "contains_unsupported"}, "prefill_s": 0.820836744999724, "probabilities_by_option_id": {"contai