nse_sha256": "sha256:ee049fa71968c02de85a074b85e75588bd471ccdc8a61a16fb5a8c82a26eceff", "response_text": "Spiritland Bistro is a local restaurant located at 230 E Victoria St in Santa Barbara, CA. The restaurant offers a wide variety of cuisines including Vegetarian, French, Vegan, Seafood, Asian Fusion, Gluten-Free, and American (New). It has received an average rating of 4.0 stars from customers.\n\nThe restaurant is open from 5:30 PM to 9:00 PM on Tuesday to Thursday, and from 5:30 PM to 10:00 PM on Friday and Saturday. On Sundays, it is open from 5:30 PM to 9:00 PM. The availability of outdoor seating and the option for takeout are provided. The restaurant also accepts reservations.\n\nCustomers have praised Spiritland Bistro for its vegan options. One customer mentioned that it was one of the best vegan meals they had ever had, highlighting the restaurant's imagination and the quality of the four-course meal. However, another customer felt underwhelmed by the ambience and thought the food was only okay for the price.\n\nIt is important to note that one customer mentioned that the restaurant is currently closed until further notice.", "role": "training", "sealed_prompt_sha256": "sha256:2358faa3171b372a16223577996bdd5777d47918024dac5bd5c6bca5031837d5", "sealed_prompt_token_count": 999, "sentence_count": 3, "sentence_version": "carnot-utf8-sentence-v1", "source_group_id": "group-183bd5835625c984d7421225", "source_sha256": "sha256:b525a747c3fd7b328ec0d10f511f215bcb10bf25fa2200ccf38305e975cad318", "source_text": "{\"address\":\"230 E Victoria St\",\"attributes\":{\"Ambience\":{\"casual\":false,\"classy\":false,\"divey\":false,\"hipster\":false,\"intimate\":false,\"romantic\":false,\"touristy\":false,\"trendy\":false,\"upscale\":false},\"BusinessParking\":{\"garage\":false,\"lot\":false,\"street\":true,\"valet\":false,\"validated\":false},\"Music\":null,\"OutdoorSeating\":true,\"RestaurantsGoodForGroups\":false,\"RestaurantsReservations\":true,\"RestaurantsTakeOut\":