w that i'm planning it... they're gone. so sad.\\n\\nwish places like this stayed open.... this and pure luck in silverlake... COME BACK PLEASE!\"},{\"review_date\":\"2012-03-01 05:20:25\",\"review_stars\":2.0,\"review_text\":\"we'd been wanting to try this place for awhile... but when we finally did - underwhelmed.  the ambience would not have been so bad were there some music or lower lighting, but couldn't help but think, \\\"i'm in a small room with 20 other people we don't know\\\".  the food itself was ok, but not a special night out.  for $10 bucks a plate i would have gone back, but for $20 i'll go elsewhere.\"},{\"review_date\":\"2011-12-31 16:54:19\",\"review_stars\":4.0,\"review_text\":\"I called to make reservations for new years eve- this place is closed until further notice FYI. Not sure when they are planning to re-open.\"}],\"state\":\"CA\"}", "source_version": {"corpus": "ragtruth", "license": "MIT", "release_revision": "c103204b9ce28d6bbad859304bf30de72b8ed8fe"}, "state_reset": true, "token_boundary_receipts": {" A": true, " B": true}, "tokenize_s": 0.0017909360003613983, "tokenizer_identity": {"bos_token_id": "248044", "eos_token_id": "248046", "metadata_model": "gpt2", "representation": "embedded_gguf"}, "window_index": 2, "window_sha256": "sha256:65853be27b1e33b673f01008bbe7f944618c9b0a1b8e584abf3820fa1fa7b7f3", "window_version": "carnot-balanced-contiguous-v1"}, {"actual_last_evaluated_position": 726, "archived_pilot_reuse": false, "arm": "whole_response", "attempted": true, "byte_end": null, "byte_start": null, "call_id": "sha256:88eeba74388e9bd26137292f", "disposition": "complete", "eligible": true, "error": null, "generated_tokens": 0, "gold_label": null, "group_id": "group-1f09ea96c68d54b0418296f3", "kv_state_id": "reset-epoch-157", "label_to_option_id": {" A": "supported", " B": "contains_unsupported"}, "log_odds_contains_unsupported": 1.5905199050903318, "marked_response": null, "model_sha256": "sha256:7e78da5d7e3ae28d178121f58646953305f3