es were too cheap and the food was super yum!! Highly recommend\"},{\"review_date\":\"2021-05-23 20:45:23\",\"review_stars\":5.0,\"review_text\":\"Absolutely the best crispy tacos in Santa Barbara! Can't recommend this place enough!! Get over here and order!\"}],\"state\":\"CA\"}", "source_version": {"corpus": "ragtruth", "license": "MIT", "release_revision": "c103204b9ce28d6bbad859304bf30de72b8ed8fe"}, "state_reset": true, "token_boundary_receipts": {" A": true, " B": true}, "tokenize_s": 0.0013625709998450475, "tokenizer_identity": {"bos_token_id": "248044", "eos_token_id": "248046", "metadata_model": "gpt2", "representation": "embedded_gguf"}, "window_index": 2, "window_sha256": "sha256:0ccc274821be48a93cceef8272dd14af30b4b708dbfabfe8eefc3614084d0d26", "window_version": "carnot-balanced-contiguous-v1"}, {"actual_last_evaluated_position": 1433, "archived_pilot_reuse": false, "arm": "whole_response", "attempted": true, "byte_end": null, "byte_start": null, "call_id": "sha256:4a75d52072a36d7aee4ecbe3", "disposition": "complete", "eligible": true, "error": null, "generated_tokens": 0, "gold_label": null, "group_id": "group-21ebbab2fd8d4937d826f6a1", "kv_state_id": "reset-epoch-165", "label_to_option_id": {" A": "supported", " B": "contains_unsupported"}, "log_odds_contains_unsupported": -0.41181945800781256, "marked_response": null, "model_sha256": "sha256:7e78da5d7e3ae28d178121f58646953305f3e5bd3cb46f4a75584e8b6c6fe169", "native_option_token_ids": {" A": 357, " B": 417}, "normalization": "two_option_softmax_float64", "option_order": ["supported", "contains_unsupported"], "order_remapping": {" A": "supported", " B": "contains_unsupported"}, "prefill_s": 1.7126017560003675, "probabilities_by_option_id": {"contains_unsupported": 0.39847592959995304, "supported": 0.6015240704000469}, "prompt_sha256": "sha256:953458ce57d5241069f10a986eff84fc6dfb67e5290569ce7762f1918f9e7b5c", "prompt_token_count": 1434, "prompt_token_ids": [1890, 1386, 1761, 364, 279, 4434, 1965, 1608, 11