 plant.\\n\\n\",\"question\":\"how do you care for orchids\"}", "source_version": {"corpus": "ragtruth", "license": "MIT", "release_revision": "c103204b9ce28d6bbad859304bf30de72b8ed8fe"}, "state_reset": true, "token_boundary_receipts": {" A": true, " B": true}, "tokenize_s": 0.000915830999474565, "tokenizer_identity": {"bos_token_id": "248044", "eos_token_id": "248046", "metadata_model": "gpt2", "representation": "embedded_gguf"}, "window_index": null, "window_sha256": null, "window_version": null}, {"actual_last_evaluated_position": 453, "archived_pilot_reuse": false, "arm": "focused_window", "attempted": true, "byte_end": 75, "byte_start": 0, "call_id": "sha256:4006ae9ec500929884e6d13e", "disposition": "complete", "eligible": true, "error": null, "generated_tokens": 0, "gold_label": null, "group_id": "group-248a7df10603824e8169f9c1", "kv_state_id": "reset-epoch-194", "label_to_option_id": {" A": "contains_unsupported", " B": "supported"}, "log_odds_contains_unsupported": 0.5939950942993165, "marked_response": "<<CARNOT_FOCUS_START:0:75>>Sure! Here's a brief answer to the question \"How do you care for orchids?\" <<CARNOT_FOCUS_END>>based on the given passages:\n\nTo care for orchids, provide them with bright light but no direct sun, water them thoroughly once or twice a week, and make sure the water drains completely out of the pot. You can also fertilize them when they are growing, and provide gentle air circulation for the plant. Additionally, after the flowers drop, you can cut the flower spike back to a node or remove it entirely to encourage new blooms to emerge.", "model_sha256": "sha256:7e78da5d7e3ae28d178121f58646953305f3e5bd3cb46f4a75584e8b6c6fe169", "native_option_token_ids": {" A": 357, " B": 417}, "normalization": "two_option_softmax_float64", "option_order": ["contains_unsupported", "supported"], "order_remapping": {" A": "contains_unsupported", " B": "supported"}, "prefill_s": 0.5601264099996115, "probabilities_by_option_id": {"contains_unsupported":