675, 1892, 561, 1965, 5435, 39072, 2144, 13, 271, 5423, 1132, 279, 2904, 2306, 13, 198, 15666, 25], "raw_logits_by_display_label": {" A": 13.523612022399902, " B": 15.287141799926758}, "raw_logits_by_option_id": {"contains_unsupported": 15.287141799926758, "supported": 13.523612022399902}, "readout_s": 3.608800034271553e-05, "request_id": "sha256:254beb858731d07794f2cf54", "requested_score_position": 805, "response_sha256": "sha256:075dd5a7367dd9d4cc6d14fd6d536491d1672ff9183110af66297b872bc694d1", "response_text": "D'Angelo's Bakery is a local business located at 25 W Gutierrez St in Santa Barbara, CA. It is a bakery that also serves breakfast and brunch, offering a variety of pastries and coffee. The bakery has received positive customer reviews, with an average rating of 3.5 stars. \n\nCustomers have praised the bakery for its amazing coffee and pastries, describing them as \"out of this world.\" They have also mentioned the friendly and attentive staff, particularly highlighting JP, the Brazilian server, and Alex, the manager, who ensured that they had a great time. The reviewers expressed their excitement to return to D'Angelo's Bakery and appreciated the business for hiring such amazing people who made their coffee experience wonderful.\n\nThe bakery provides a pleasant atmosphere with outdoor seating, allowing customers to enjoy their breakfast with a view of California's Riviera. The establishment does not offer reservations but does have takeout options available. It does not provide WiFi, but customers have mentioned the nice ambiance and friendly atmosphere.\n\nOverall, D'Angelo's Bakery is a highly recommended local business in Santa Barbara, providing delicious pastries, coffee, and a pleasant dining experience.", "role": "training", "sealed_prompt_sha256": "sha256:06e89faf2769195b77c01871c2ef977f16dc2c1602a98a4ea7219d9ebca72346", "sealed_prompt_token_count": 806, "sentence_count": 2, "sentence_version": "carnot-utf8-sentence-v1", "source_group_id": "gro