 frames. Add the inner cover (or Vivaldi cover) and sugar syrup. Add the hive top and reduce the hive entrance to 1 inch. You can increase to no more than 3 inches in a few weeks.\\n\\npassage 3:Step By Step: 1  As soon as you get the NUC to your apiary, place in its permanent location with the entrance at the same place as the entrance to the hive will be. 2  Remove the block to the NUC entrance and wait at least 24 hours. The bees will orient to the new location. Move the NUC to the side of the hive location and replace it with the empty nest box. Gently smoke the entrance to the NUC. Remove the top of the nuc and spritz the bees with a light sugar syrup.\\n\\n\",\"question\":\"how to install a nuc of bees\"}", "source_version": {"corpus": "ragtruth", "license": "MIT", "release_revision": "c103204b9ce28d6bbad859304bf30de72b8ed8fe"}, "state_reset": true, "token_boundary_receipts": {" A": true, " B": true}, "tokenize_s": 0.0016613729994787718, "tokenizer_identity": {"bos_token_id": "248044", "eos_token_id": "248046", "metadata_model": "gpt2", "representation": "embedded_gguf"}, "window_index": 1, "window_sha256": "sha256:18325373887083638326e92e523b7c61496b77f48a932d6eaad37ecf7abe87c7", "window_version": "carnot-balanced-contiguous-v1"}, {"actual_last_evaluated_position": 525, "archived_pilot_reuse": false, "arm": "focused_window", "attempted": true, "byte_end": 605, "byte_start": 394, "call_id": "sha256:3b630a10a4db0cc649c98bae", "disposition": "complete", "eligible": true, "error": null, "generated_tokens": 0, "gold_label": null, "group_id": "group-2aca45b006e5706cfbc2db3a", "kv_state_id": "reset-epoch-240", "label_to_option_id": {" A": "supported", " B": "contains_unsupported"}, "log_odds_contains_unsupported": 0.732457160949707, "marked_response": "Based on the given passages, here are the steps to install a nuc of bees:\n\n1. Place the nuc in its permanent location with the entrance at the same place as the entrance to the hive will be.\n2. Remove the block to 