12  gutsy. 13  immodest. 14  impudent. 15  insolent. 16  nervy. 17  pert. 18  presumptuous. 19  rude. 20  sassy. 21  saucy. 22  shameless. 23  smart. 24  smart-alecky. 25  spunky.\\n\\npassage 3:Cheeky is a word used by english people like myself. 1. it is a word used to describe someone who does something or says something sort of disrespectful and sometimes rude, but says it in a cunning way. 2. can also be used in a more serious way i.e if you found out that one of your friends has been talking behind your back, you might say that she is a cheeky bitch.\\n\\n\",\"question\":\"define cheeky synonym\"}", "source_version": {"corpus": "ragtruth", "license": "MIT", "release_revision": "c103204b9ce28d6bbad859304bf30de72b8ed8fe"}, "state_reset": true, "token_boundary_receipts": {" A": true, " B": true}, "tokenize_s": 0.001443273000404588, "tokenizer_identity": {"bos_token_id": "248044", "eos_token_id": "248046", "metadata_model": "gpt2", "representation": "embedded_gguf"}, "window_index": null, "window_sha256": null, "window_version": null}, {"actual_last_evaluated_position": 543, "archived_pilot_reuse": false, "arm": "focused_window", "attempted": true, "byte_end": 287, "byte_start": 0, "call_id": "sha256:7b088901f01599cad573def7", "disposition": "complete", "eligible": true, "error": null, "generated_tokens": 0, "gold_label": null, "group_id": "group-31be376bafe9d6c77102cbcf", "kv_state_id": "reset-epoch-292", "label_to_option_id": {" A": "contains_unsupported", " B": "supported"}, "log_odds_contains_unsupported": -1.032822608947754, "marked_response": "<<CARNOT_FOCUS_START:0:287>>Synonyms for the word \"cheeky\" include audacious, disrespectful, forward, fresh, impertinent, impudent, insolent, insulting, pert, sassy, saucy, brazen, assuming, barefaced, brash, brassy, confident, gritty, gutsy, immodest, nervy, presumptuous, rude, shameless, smart, and smart-alecky.<<CARNOT_FOCUS_END>>", "model_sha256": "sha256:7e78da5d7e3ae28d178121f58646953305f3e5bd3cb46f4a75584e8b6c