away. Hand dry your Le Creuset cast iron grill pan with a dish towel to prevent rust.\\n\\npassage 2:Tackle difficult food stains on your Le Creuset grill pan by soaking it before washing. Cover your grill pan with warm water only, no soap, and allow the grill pan to remain submerged in the water for 15 minutes to loosen stuck-on food particles. Remove your Le Creuset grill pan from the water. Pour 1 tsp. mild hand dish-washing detergent in your kitchen sink and fill the sink with hot water.\\n\\npassage 3:These are videos on YouTube that also show how to clean the Le Creuset cookware (put in browser address bar: how to clean enamel cookware Le Creuset YouTube -- or paste the links below into your browser address bar):\\n\\n\",\"question\":\"how to clean le creuset grill pan\"}", "source_version": {"corpus": "ragtruth", "license": "MIT", "release_revision": "c103204b9ce28d6bbad859304bf30de72b8ed8fe"}, "state_reset": true, "token_boundary_receipts": {" A": true, " B": true}, "tokenize_s": 0.00130366099983803, "tokenizer_identity": {"bos_token_id": "248044", "eos_token_id": "248046", "metadata_model": "gpt2", "representation": "embedded_gguf"}, "window_index": null, "window_sha256": null, "window_version": null}, {"actual_last_evaluated_position": 438, "archived_pilot_reuse": false, "arm": "focused_window", "attempted": true, "byte_end": 219, "byte_start": 0, "call_id": "sha256:70f80714ee53dcc05030c565", "disposition": "complete", "eligible": true, "error": null, "generated_tokens": 0, "gold_label": null, "group_id": "group-3665767d031ad9633e59af83", "kv_state_id": "reset-epoch-302", "label_to_option_id": {" A": "supported", " B": "contains_unsupported"}, "log_odds_contains_unsupported": -3.4775333404541016, "marked_response": "<<CARNOT_FOCUS_START:0:219>>To clean a Le Creuset grill pan, firstly tackle difficult food stains by soaking the pan in warm water, without soap, for 15 minutes to loosen stuck-on food particles. After removing the pan from the water, pour 1 ts