fter eating it the verdict is really great. Omelette was spot on. The Banh mi was great, could of used a little more flavor and filling. Bread was delicious. Cranberries on the gobbler were extremely tart and made my mouth dance after the savory turkey bacon in my omelette. Then all that was left to try was the tuna. Fresh and basic. Better late then never was the arrival of sourdough toast with butter. AWESOME. We enjoyed our lunch and time together.\"},{\"review_date\":\"2017-11-26 21:23:27\",\"review_stars\":5.0,\"review_text\":\"I love this place. I can always count on fresh, quality food. Service is excellent and friendly.\"}],\"state\":\"CA\"}", "source_version": {"corpus": "ragtruth", "license": "MIT", "release_revision": "c103204b9ce28d6bbad859304bf30de72b8ed8fe"}, "state_reset": true, "token_boundary_receipts": {" A": true, " B": true}, "tokenize_s": 0.0015714440005467623, "tokenizer_identity": {"bos_token_id": "248044", "eos_token_id": "248046", "metadata_model": "gpt2", "representation": "embedded_gguf"}, "window_index": 2, "window_sha256": "sha256:235fa7c36a63be7328b79609a8f4278624316301d1727d1cc7ada3edef751fde", "window_version": "carnot-balanced-contiguous-v1"}, {"actual_last_evaluated_position": 965, "archived_pilot_reuse": false, "arm": "whole_response", "attempted": true, "byte_end": null, "byte_start": null, "call_id": "sha256:b69dd01d44240da168668820", "disposition": "complete", "eligible": true, "error": null, "generated_tokens": 0, "gold_label": null, "group_id": "group-3aa8956c1d85e255eeed18e3", "kv_state_id": "reset-epoch-333", "label_to_option_id": {" A": "supported", " B": "contains_unsupported"}, "log_odds_contains_unsupported": 3.3771800994873047, "marked_response": null, "model_sha256": "sha256:7e78da5d7e3ae28d178121f58646953305f3e5bd3cb46f4a75584e8b6c6fe169", "native_option_token_ids": {" A": 357, " B": 417}, "normalization": "two_option_softmax_float64", "option_order": ["supported", "contains_unsupported"], "order_remapping": {" A": "s