s a flavoring agent in food and personal care products such as candies, root beer, chewing gums, smokeless tobacco, mouth fresheners, mouthwash, toothpaste, and oral care products.\n\nIt is important to note that the passages do not provide any clinical data or scientific evidence to support the effectiveness of wintergreen essential oil for any medical condition. It is recommended to use it sparingly and dilute it with fractionated coconut oil to minimize skin sensitivity. Additionally, a little amount of wintergreen essential oil can go a long way, so it's best to start with small amounts and gradually increase as needed.", "role": "training", "sealed_prompt_sha256": "sha256:635a446d71f6f6b590c718713252a87e2142a8cf4a7396c4b2653fa2ab1cf357", "sealed_prompt_token_count": 506, "sentence_count": 1, "sentence_version": "carnot-utf8-sentence-v1", "source_group_id": "group-3b67d3bfc240d517bf7d7c15", "source_sha256": "sha256:2328c6adbf75a4904a8c882bc1a7db375801b6f6a6c7be883138f8902dd3df2c", "source_text": "{\"passages\":\"passage 1:Wintergreen has a warming effect when applied to skin and is excellent to use as a soothing massage. A little goes a long way, so use sparingly and dilute with Fractionated Coconut Oil to minimize any skin sensitivity. For a soothing bath, add 1\u20132 drops of Wintergreen essential oil to warm bath water.\\n\\npassage 2:Common Name(s): Wintergreen , teaberry , checkerberry , gaultheria oil , boxberry , deerberry , mountain tea , Canada tea , partridgeberry. In addition to being used as a flavoring, wintergreen and its oil have been used in topical analgesic and rubefacient preparations for the treatment of muscular and rheumatic pain. However, research reveals no clinical data regarding the use of wintergreen for any condition.\\n\\npassage 3:Wintergreen essential oil improves logical thinking and stimulates mental power. Apart from all these natural benefits, this oil is used as a flavoring agent in candies, root beer, chewing gums, smokeless tobacco, mouth fresheners, mouthwash like Listerine, in toothpastes and certain other oral care products.\\n\\n\",\"question\":\"wintergreen essential oil uses benefits\"}", "source_version": {"corpus": "ragtruth", "license": "MIT", "release_revision": "c103204b9ce28d6bbad859304bf30de72b8ed8fe"}, "state_reset": true, "token_boundary_receipts": {" A": true, " B": true}, "tokenize_s": 0.001203261999762617, "tokenizer_identity": {"bos_token_id": "248044", "eos_token_id": "248046", "metadata_model": "gpt2", "representation": "embedded_gguf"}, "window_index": 1, "window_sha256": "sha256:c4ee88569038611e5ef10cba8f253de7dce32e886b6bfd14cf43430a8dba73f2", "window_version": "carnot-balanced-contiguous-v1"}, {"actual_last_evaluated_position": 505, "archived_pilot_reuse": false, "arm": "focused_window", "attempted": true, "byte_end": 849, "byte_start": 585, "call_id": "sha256:75e65b2508d42cb9db28638a", "disposition": "complete", "eligible": true, "error": null, "generated_tokens": 0, "gold_label": null, "group_id": "group-3b67d3bfc240d517bf7d7c15", "kv_state_id": "reset-epoch-344", "label_to_option_id": {" A": "supported", " B": "contains_unsupported"}, "log_odds_contains_unsupported": 1.0335721969604492, "marked_response": "Based on the given passages, wintergreen essential oil has the following uses and benefits:\n\n* As a soothing massage oil to relieve muscular and rheumatic pain\n* To improve logical thinking and stimulate mental power\n* As a flavoring agent in food and personal care products such as candies, root beer, chewing gums, smokeless tobacco, mouth fresheners, mouthwash, toothpaste, and oral care products.\n\nIt is important to note that the passages do not provide any clinical data or scientific evidence to support the effectiveness of wintergreen essential oil for any medical condition. <<CARNOT_FOCUS_START:585:849>>It is recommended to use it sparingly and dilute it with fractionated coconut oil to minimize skin sensitivity. Additionally, a little amount of