ool hall; it offers a different feel compared to others. It is associated with SB Brew Co., but Fig & Haley is the place to go for drinking. They have a wide selection of TV channels, making it one of the best places in Santa Barbara to watch sports. The food is also mentioned as being good, and the drinks are a great complement to the experience.\n\nOverall, Fig & Haley is highly regarded by customers as a well-managed establishment with a great atmosphere. It is a popular spot for those who enjoy sports, beer, and a lively environment.", "role": "training", "sealed_prompt_sha256": "sha256:43cedad0c9cbf5dd5be354f0d73df9a865d44585f38308447373307f3bb1f632", "sealed_prompt_token_count": 717, "sentence_count": 4, "sentence_version": "carnot-utf8-sentence-v1", "source_group_id": "group-3eca0153f0af6c120bb2e556", "source_sha256": "sha256:9825e67c39ed08238e5a81a239e97517dfab40cb99edad6d2c6432d20f3e8606", "source_text": "{\"address\":\"8 W Haley St\",\"attributes\":{\"Ambience\":null,\"BusinessParking\":null,\"Music\":null,\"OutdoorSeating\":false,\"RestaurantsGoodForGroups\":null,\"RestaurantsReservations\":null,\"RestaurantsTakeOut\":null,\"WiFi\":null},\"business_stars\":4.0,\"categories\":\"Pool Halls, Nightlife\",\"city\":\"Santa Barbara\",\"hours\":null,\"name\":\"Fig & Haley\",\"review_info\":[{\"review_date\":\"2012-09-05 01:14:02\",\"review_stars\":5.0,\"review_text\":\"Lived a block away and frequented daily.  Awesome and clean establishment.  Equipment was always in the best condition and had Lacey as a bartender which was the best in Santa Barbara.  Not a typical pool hall, but a well maintained, well managed establishment that is always a pleasure to frequent.\"},{\"review_date\":\"2012-02-18 17:31:55\",\"review_stars\":3.0,\"review_text\":\"Great place if you like watching sports and drinking beer!  Food was good, beer was great, but a little too noisy for me.\"},{\"review_date\":\"2008-06-19 06:42:56\",\"review_stars\":4.0,\"review_text\":\"Fig & Haley may b