fad02f3154206e40c3d60f9eceb3e", "response_text": "Based on the given passages, here is a brief history of Gulf Oil Company:\n\nGulf Oil was founded in 1901 during the discovery of oil at Spindletop, Texas. It was one of the original seven sisters oil companies and became a major global oil company from the 1900s to the 1980s. In 1985, the Canadian exploration, production, and distribution arm of Gulf Oil was sold to Olympia and York. The company continued as an independent oil company called Gulf Canada Resources until its acquisition by Conoco in 2002. Throughout its history, Gulf Oil has been known for its high-quality products and services and its iconic Orange Disk logo.", "role": "training", "sealed_prompt_sha256": "sha256:fd72e5e2f6adbad33592517cf00a1dcabe76207a5f07a6c6f9c9c1163a249c08", "sealed_prompt_token_count": 469, "sentence_count": 2, "sentence_version": "carnot-utf8-sentence-v1", "source_group_id": "group-41e7435963841e05fa0b41f7", "source_sha256": "sha256:b99898e51b7d09d6a96e1b0745a4442a2e42892ba1bf8b7da51884a7ebe55f17", "source_text": "{\"passages\":\"passage 1:Gulf Oil was a major global oil company from the 1900s to the 1980s. The eighth-largest American manufacturing company in 1941 and the ninth-largest in 1979, Gulf Oil was one of the so-called Seven Sisters oil companies.\\n\\npassage 2:The Canadian exploration, production, and distribution arm of Gulf Oil was sold to Olympia and York in 1985. From 1992 it continued as an independent oil company (Gulf Canada Resources) until its acquisition by Conoco in 2002.\\n\\npassage 3:Company History. Gulf Oil in famous for being one of the original members of the seven sisters, the original American oil companies and continues to provide high quality products and services throughout the world. Gulf Oil was founded in 1901 at the time of the discovery of oil at Spindle top, Texas. Gulf promoted the idea of branded product sales by selling gasoline in containers and from pumps marked with the distinctive Orange Disk logo.\\n\\n\",\"question\":\"gulf oil company history\"}", "source_version": {"corpus": "ragtruth", "license": "MIT", "release_revision": "c103204b9ce28d6bbad859304bf30de72b8ed8fe"}, "state_reset": true, "token_boundary_receipts": {" A": true, " B": true}, "tokenize_s": 0.0009736500005601556, "tokenizer_identity": {"bos_token_id": "248044", "eos_token_id": "248046", "metadata_model": "gpt2", "representation": "embedded_gguf"}, "window_index": 2, "window_sha256": "sha256:c4b21767f0318541b49412d51e56a06a655edf0f1dc255c2ff24b8a20566f9a2", "window_version": "carnot-balanced-contiguous-v1"}, {"actual_last_evaluated_position": 446, "archived_pilot_reuse": false, "arm": "whole_response", "attempted": true, "byte_end": null, "byte_start": null, "call_id": "sha256:cbeee13625c8b1ec3c265832", "disposition": "complete", "eligible": true, "error": null, "generated_tokens": 0, "gold_label": null, "group_id": "group-41e7435963841e05fa0b41f7", "kv_state_id": "reset-epoch-369", "label_to_option_id": {" A": "contains_unsupported", " B": "supported"}, "log_odds_contains_unsupported": -0.3809728622436523, "marked_response": null, "model_sha256": "sha256:7e78da5d7e3ae28d178121f58646953305f3e5bd3cb46f4a75584e8b6c6fe169", "native_option_token_ids": {" A": 357, " B": 417}, "normalization": "two_option_softmax_float64", "option_order": ["contains_unsupported", "supported"], "order_remapping": {" A": "contains_unsupported", " B": "supported"}, "prefill_s": 0.5335319159994469, "probabilities_by_option_id": {"contains_unsupported": 0.4058922759675795, "supported": 0.5941077240324205}, "prompt_sha256": "sha256:ff07df4db3326541a787cec6e469908b9f31b89931f6e7b1b815068c2f7f6089", "prompt_token_count": 447, "prompt_token_ids": [1890, 1386, 1761, 364, 279, 4434, 1965, 1608, 1132, 279, 16713, 2450, 13, 271, 41578, 198, 4754, 6184, 1098, 3147, 6184, 416, 220, 16, 25, 38, 13898, 15070, 557, 264, 3478, 3521, 5415, 2724, 494, 279, 220, 16, 24, 15, 15, 82, 310, 279, 220, 16, 24, 23, 15, 82, 13, 