s expressing disappointment with their meals, particularly in terms of cooking consistency and flavor. However, many patrons have praised the service, citing friendly and attentive staff. The restaurant also offers outdoor seating and has free Wi-Fi, making it a popular spot for both casual and special occasion dining. Despite some negative feedback, Restaurant Mimosa maintains a 3.5-star rating and has received several positive reviews in recent years.", "role": "training", "sealed_prompt_sha256": "sha256:cdf99b6dabe23effcce30cd8d7e475768429d7007f19b108d04ed4b982f5665a", "sealed_prompt_token_count": 598, "sentence_count": null, "sentence_version": null, "source_group_id": "group-43b277da5ea934674295b0ad", "source_sha256": "sha256:1d67b0cc774ceb10849200d8cea553f414efcbfc900193b215561a04885655f3", "source_text": "{\"address\":\"714 State St\",\"attributes\":{\"Ambience\":{\"casual\":false,\"classy\":false,\"divey\":false,\"hipster\":false,\"intimate\":false,\"romantic\":true,\"touristy\":false,\"trendy\":false,\"upscale\":false},\"BusinessParking\":{\"garage\":false,\"lot\":false,\"street\":false,\"valet\":false,\"validated\":false},\"Music\":null,\"OutdoorSeating\":true,\"RestaurantsGoodForGroups\":true,\"RestaurantsReservations\":true,\"RestaurantsTakeOut\":false,\"WiFi\":null},\"business_stars\":3.5,\"categories\":\"Restaurants, French, American (New)\",\"city\":\"Santa Barbara\",\"hours\":null,\"name\":\"Restaurant Mimosa\",\"review_info\":[{\"review_date\":\"2014-11-17 23:18:37\",\"review_stars\":1.0,\"review_text\":\"Horrible experience. Service was a 3 out of 10. When my meal arrived I noticed it wasn't cooked all the way through. Pest control might be needed.\"},{\"review_date\":\"2012-09-28 17:03:57\",\"review_stars\":2.0,\"review_text\":\"Very good service but food only ok.  My steak was mostly peppercorns with very little flavor.  My wife's salmon was fine but nothing exceptional.  Prices are quite high - we will not return.\"},{\"review_date\":\"2012-08-20 18:46:55\",\"review_stars\":5.0,\"review_text\":\"I had the Roasted Duck Breast, and it was incredibly tasty.  Fresh vegetables.  Mayan Chocolate Cheesecake for desert and it was very unique.  The service was excellent as well.  It was a very enjoyable experience and I left feeling satisfied.  I'll be returning for sure next time I'm in the area.\"}],\"state\":\"CA\"}", "source_version": {"corpus": "ragtruth", "license": "MIT", "release_revision": "c103204b9ce28d6bbad859304bf30de72b8ed8fe"}, "state_reset": true, "token_boundary_receipts": {" A": true, " B": true}, "tokenize_s": 0.0013323749999472057, "tokenizer_identity": {"bos_token_id": "248044", "eos_token_id": "248046", "metadata_model": "gpt2", "representation": "embedded_gguf"}, "window_index": null, "window_sha256": null, "window_version": null}, {"actual_last_evaluated_position": 617, "archived_pilot_reuse": false, "arm": "focused_window", "attempted": true, "byte_end": 127, "byte_start": 0, "call_id": "sha256:d04388dd55fe0e7c4693ea57", "disposition": "complete", "eligible": true, "error": null, "generated_tokens": 0, "gold_label": null, "group_id": "group-43b277da5ea934674295b0ad", "kv_state_id": "reset-epoch-382", "label_to_option_id": {" A": "supported", " B": "contains_unsupported"}, "log_odds_contains_unsupported": 4.096116065979004, "marked_response": "<<CARNOT_FOCUS_START:0:127>>Restaurant Mimosa is a moderately rated restaurant located in Santa Barbara, California, offering French and American cuisine. <<CARNOT_FOCUS_END>>According to customer reviews, the restaurant has a mixed reputation when it comes to food quality, with some reviewers expressing disappointment with their meals, particularly in terms of cooking consistency and flavor. However, many patrons have praised the service, citing friendly and attentive staff. The restaurant also offers outdoor seating and has free Wi-Fi, making it a popular spot for both casual and special occasion dining. Despite some negative feedback, Restaurant Mim