,{\"review_date\":\"2020-06-13 07:23:57\",\"review_stars\":4.0,\"review_text\":\"Cashier on duty was super vigilant about keeping masks on which could be viewed many ways.  Found the wine selection to be pretty limited, bit they did have a rarer Amarone della Valpolicella wine from Italy.  We eventually won the girl over at the end when my dad tipped her for keeping us COVID safe -- this location was semi #declawed on cold White Claw, but they did have plenty on the back wall.  One of the smallest BEVMO's I've ever visited.\"},{\"review_date\":\"2020-06-13 02:34:04\",\"review_stars\":1.0,\"review_text\":\"Although, the lady in charge was nice and sweet, Adam has horrible service which is why I gave 1 star. Not very helpful at all, questioning the price of the items in the store as if I was lying, boxed my own items because I felt like he didn't want to, I should've just rung myself up to relieve him of his misery\"}],\"state\":\"CA\"}", "source_version": {"corpus": "ragtruth", "license": "MIT", "release_revision": "c103204b9ce28d6bbad859304bf30de72b8ed8fe"}, "state_reset": true, "token_boundary_receipts": {" A": true, " B": true}, "tokenize_s": 0.0017942230006156024, "tokenizer_identity": {"bos_token_id": "248044", "eos_token_id": "248046", "metadata_model": "gpt2", "representation": "embedded_gguf"}, "window_index": 0, "window_sha256": "sha256:7b21b211dc2e7f3fe0512fcb393b6541732227e3c8bc3f129f75e621ddf4ded4", "window_version": "carnot-balanced-contiguous-v1"}, {"actual_last_evaluated_position": 934, "archived_pilot_reuse": false, "arm": "focused_window", "attempted": true, "byte_end": 652, "byte_start": 289, "call_id": "sha256:0e8a8a0082ea94539b4ef345", "disposition": "complete", "eligible": true, "error": null, "generated_tokens": 0, "gold_label": null, "group_id": "group-44a5b8c1c8c886d70d124107", "kv_state_id": "reset-epoch-391", "label_to_option_id": {" A": "supported", " B": "contains_unsupported"}, "log_odds_contains_unsupported": 3.7943038940429688, "marked_