.  One of the smallest BEVMO's I've ever visited.\"},{\"review_date\":\"2020-06-13 02:34:04\",\"review_stars\":1.0,\"review_text\":\"Although, the lady in charge was nice and sweet, Adam has horrible service which is why I gave 1 star. Not very helpful at all, questioning the price of the items in the store as if I was lying, boxed my own items because I felt like he didn't want to, I should've just rung myself up to relieve him of his misery\"}],\"state\":\"CA\"}", "source_version": {"corpus": "ragtruth", "license": "MIT", "release_revision": "c103204b9ce28d6bbad859304bf30de72b8ed8fe"}, "state_reset": true, "token_boundary_receipts": {" A": true, " B": true}, "tokenize_s": 0.001750731000356609, "tokenizer_identity": {"bos_token_id": "248044", "eos_token_id": "248046", "metadata_model": "gpt2", "representation": "embedded_gguf"}, "window_index": null, "window_sha256": null, "window_version": null}, {"actual_last_evaluated_position": 932, "archived_pilot_reuse": false, "arm": "focused_window", "attempted": true, "byte_end": 289, "byte_start": 0, "call_id": "sha256:330cb66185cfa5552c15211a", "disposition": "complete", "eligible": true, "error": null, "generated_tokens": 0, "gold_label": null, "group_id": "group-44a5b8c1c8c886d70d124107", "kv_state_id": "reset-epoch-394", "label_to_option_id": {" A": "contains_unsupported", " B": "supported"}, "log_odds_contains_unsupported": 4.393333435058594, "marked_response": "<<CARNOT_FOCUS_START:0:289>>Sure! Here's an objective overview of Bevmo based on the provided structured data in JSON format:\n\nBevmo is a Restaurants and Food business located in Goleta, CA, offering a wide selection of American (New) cuisine, beer, wine, and spirits. The business has a rating of 4.0 stars out of 5.<<CARNOT_FOCUS_END>>0 based on 3 reviews, with reviewers praising its extensive selection and knowledgeable staff. One reviewer noted that the store is \"consistently in awe over just how much of a selection this place offers,\" while another app