r's door then press the 3/4 control. 4  Press 7/8 and 9/0 controls at the same time.\\n\\n\",\"question\":\"how to reprogram the ford number pad\"}", "source_version": {"corpus": "ragtruth", "license": "MIT", "release_revision": "c103204b9ce28d6bbad859304bf30de72b8ed8fe"}, "state_reset": true, "token_boundary_receipts": {" A": true, " B": true}, "tokenize_s": 0.0012853159996666363, "tokenizer_identity": {"bos_token_id": "248044", "eos_token_id": "248046", "metadata_model": "gpt2", "representation": "embedded_gguf"}, "window_index": 0, "window_sha256": "sha256:72b26cabbb866ceeacc83afbc48164746f4611e4230621fc497833af078d9f5f", "window_version": "carnot-balanced-contiguous-v1"}, {"actual_last_evaluated_position": 627, "archived_pilot_reuse": false, "arm": "focused_window", "attempted": true, "byte_end": 506, "byte_start": 262, "call_id": "sha256:4f1af70668e38352d7e0dee5", "disposition": "complete", "eligible": true, "error": null, "generated_tokens": 0, "gold_label": null, "group_id": "group-451d78d93bfd75ac88a959d4", "kv_state_id": "reset-epoch-399", "label_to_option_id": {" A": "supported", " B": "contains_unsupported"}, "log_odds_contains_unsupported": 1.7026443481445312, "marked_response": "Based on the given passages, here are the steps to reprogram the Ford number pad:\n\n1. Open the vehicle door and put the key into the ignition.\n2. Turn the key from the Off position to the On or Run position (the position located right before Start) eight times. <<CARNOT_FOCUS_START:262:506>>End this set of repetitions with the key in the On position.\n3. Press any button on the key fob within 20 seconds of completing the previous step.\n4. Enter either the factory-set code or the personal code using the number pad on the dashboard.\n<<CARNOT_FOCUS_END>>5. Unlock the driver's door using the unlock button.\n6. Press the 3/4 control while holding the 7/8 and 9/0 controls simultaneously.\n\nPlease note that these steps are specific to Ford vehicles and may not apply to other make