to a boil; cook and stir 4-5 minutes or until sauce is thickened. Return shrimp mixture to pan; heat through, stirring to combine. Sprinkle with coconut; serve with rice. Yield: 4 servings.\\n\\npassage 3:Shrimp and Pineapple Stir-fry. 1  4 teaspoons sesame oil divided. 2  1 tablespoon vegetable oil divided. 3  1 1/2 cups chopped fresh pineapple. 4  1 lb. peeled and deveined shrimp. 5  4 cloves garlic minced. 6  1/2 large bell pepper sliced. 7  2 stalks bok choy chopped into 1-inch pieces. 8  4-5 stalks asparagus chopped into 1-inch pieces.\\n\\n\",\"question\":\"spicy pineapple shrimp stir fry\"}", "source_version": {"corpus": "ragtruth", "license": "MIT", "release_revision": "c103204b9ce28d6bbad859304bf30de72b8ed8fe"}, "state_reset": true, "token_boundary_receipts": {" A": true, " B": true}, "tokenize_s": 0.0012661309992836323, "tokenizer_identity": {"bos_token_id": "248044", "eos_token_id": "248046", "metadata_model": "gpt2", "representation": "embedded_gguf"}, "window_index": null, "window_sha256": null, "window_version": null}, {"actual_last_evaluated_position": 842, "archived_pilot_reuse": false, "arm": "focused_window", "attempted": true, "byte_end": 434, "byte_start": 0, "call_id": "sha256:7401782e2e1c91498142a0b2", "disposition": "complete", "eligible": true, "error": null, "generated_tokens": 0, "gold_label": null, "group_id": "group-4651d6036d7a81745d98755b", "kv_state_id": "reset-epoch-418", "label_to_option_id": {" A": "contains_unsupported", " B": "supported"}, "log_odds_contains_unsupported": 4.911707878112793, "marked_response": "<<CARNOT_FOCUS_START:0:434>>Based on the given passages, here is a brief answer to the question \"spicy pineapple shrimp stir fry\":\n\nTo make a spicy pineapple shrimp stir fry, you will need 1 1/2 cups of chopped fresh pineapple, 1 lb. of peeled and deveined shrimp, 4 cloves of garlic minced, 1/2 large bell pepper sliced, 2 stalks of bok choy chopped into 1-inch pieces, 4-5 stalks of asparagus chopped into 1-inch pieces, a