omers also mention the store's diverse selection of products, including unique gifts, candles, soaps, jewelry, and grab-and-go meals. Overall, Santa Barbara Hives seems like a charming and well-regarded local business that offers a one-of-a-kind shopping experience.", "role": "training", "sealed_prompt_sha256": "sha256:abc1e7fb06ba224e85feaf4b08f9b70152bfaa03e303b14c0e0da73b508aa7e7", "sealed_prompt_token_count": 692, "sentence_count": null, "sentence_version": null, "source_group_id": "group-4893317f66038ab7b437916f", "source_sha256": "sha256:0570248fc176a5ffda65362fb841e4de660f2a67d48a8113c9bb57a5051fd4e6", "source_text": "{\"address\":\"516 Palm Ave, Unit C\",\"attributes\":{\"Ambience\":null,\"BusinessParking\":null,\"Music\":null,\"OutdoorSeating\":null,\"RestaurantsGoodForGroups\":null,\"RestaurantsReservations\":null,\"RestaurantsTakeOut\":null,\"WiFi\":null},\"business_stars\":5.0,\"categories\":\"Cheese Shops, Food, Arts & Crafts, Home Decor, Vegan, Honey, Restaurants, Souvenir Shops, Specialty Food, Wildlife Control, Home & Garden, Shopping, Local Services, Pest Control\",\"city\":\"Carpinteria\",\"hours\":{\"Friday\":\"10:0-18:0\",\"Saturday\":\"10:0-18:0\",\"Sunday\":\"10:0-16:0\",\"Thursday\":\"10:0-18:0\",\"Wednesday\":\"10:0-18:0\"},\"name\":\"Santa Barbara Hives\",\"review_info\":[{\"review_date\":\"2021-09-25 21:55:29\",\"review_stars\":5.0,\"review_text\":\"Great store! Delicious honey as well as other gifts, goods, and exotic condiments. Reasonable prices. Friendly staff and great vibe.\"},{\"review_date\":\"2021-07-04 22:58:54\",\"review_stars\":5.0,\"review_text\":\"What a great place! Stumbled on this store while camping at Carpinteria State Park campground. I love patronizing small businesses and this place does not disappoint. Delicious honey, candles, soaps, jewelry and more. They even have a chef in house for grab n go meals. The staff was so helpful and friendly. I'll definitely be back!\"},{\"review_date\":\"2021-06-27 19:35:10\",\"review_stars\":5.0,\"review_text\":\"We found this little gem and were beyond impressed!! We went in to browse around and walked out with half the store. From cheese to candles to cutting boards to wind chimes and chocolate this store has a little bit of everything. Definitely worth your time to pop in and check it out...\"}],\"state\":\"CA\"}", "source_version": {"corpus": "ragtruth", "license": "MIT", "release_revision": "c103204b9ce28d6bbad859304bf30de72b8ed8fe"}, "state_reset": true, "token_boundary_receipts": {" A": true, " B": true}, "tokenize_s": 0.002325170999938564, "tokenizer_identity": {"bos_token_id": "248044", "eos_token_id": "248046", "metadata_model": "gpt2", "representation": "embedded_gguf"}, "window_index": null, "window_sha256": null, "window_version": null}, {"actual_last_evaluated_position": 711, "archived_pilot_reuse": false, "arm": "focused_window", "attempted": true, "byte_end": 336, "byte_start": 0, "call_id": "sha256:00fd3e0cd6de4a9abc83522e", "disposition": "complete", "eligible": true, "error": null, "generated_tokens": 0, "gold_label": null, "group_id": "group-4893317f66038ab7b437916f", "kv_state_id": "reset-epoch-430", "label_to_option_id": {" A": "supported", " B": "contains_unsupported"}, "log_odds_contains_unsupported": 0.7177095413208007, "marked_response": "<<CARNOT_FOCUS_START:0:336>>Sure, here is an objective overview of Santa Barbara Hives based on the provided structured data in JSON format:\n\nSanta Barbara Hives is a local business located in Carpinteria, California that offers a wide range of products including cheese, food, arts & crafts, home decor, vegan options, honey, souvenirs, specialty food, and more. <<CARNOT_FOCUS_END>>The business is open Wednesday through Sunday, from 10am to 6pm, and closed on Mondays and Tuesdays. The business has received excellent reviews from customers who appreciate the delicious honey, reasonable prices, friendly staff, and great ambiance. Customers also mention the store's diverse selection of 