tate St in Santa Barbara, California. The business offers various services such as dance clubs, karaoke, nightlife, restaurants, bars, American (New), and Mexican cuisines. La Rumba Bar and Grill is open from 12:00 pm to 1:30 am every day except Sunday. The business provides free Wi-Fi and allows takeout orders. Customers have rated the business with an average of 3.0 out of 5.0 stars. Some reviews have praised the full bar service, the sweet bartenders, and the island bar design, which allows for easy service from all sides. Others have expressed disappointment with the business being closed on certain days and the lack of outdoor seating options. Overall, La Rumba Bar and Grill appears to be a casual and trendy bar with a focus on providing entertainment and good food.", "role": "training", "sealed_prompt_sha256": "sha256:6ed56e6bf088b0b6cdca9fb7dd6bf15f7eefbf02d4483a507b83f225a3f10b9f", "sealed_prompt_token_count": 692, "sentence_count": null, "sentence_version": null, "source_group_id": "group-4c30782586d6514474ecf752", "source_sha256": "sha256:d2a2e483ad16f9f11cd00dd413cb8ea83b3814f5604bde6643c4ddcf6280317c", "source_text": "{\"address\":\"3435 State St\",\"attributes\":{\"Ambience\":{\"casual\":true,\"classy\":false,\"divey\":false,\"hipster\":false,\"intimate\":false,\"romantic\":false,\"touristy\":false,\"trendy\":false,\"upscale\":false},\"BusinessParking\":{\"garage\":false,\"lot\":true,\"street\":false,\"valet\":false,\"validated\":false},\"Music\":true,\"OutdoorSeating\":false,\"RestaurantsGoodForGroups\":true,\"RestaurantsReservations\":true,\"RestaurantsTakeOut\":true,\"WiFi\":\"free\"},\"business_stars\":3.0,\"categories\":\"Dance Clubs, Karaoke, Nightlife, Restaurants, Bars, American (New), Mexican\",\"city\":\"Santa Barbara\",\"hours\":{\"Friday\":\"12:0-1:30\",\"Saturday\":\"12:0-1:30\",\"Sunday\":\"12:0-1:30\",\"Thursday\":\"12:0-1:30\"},\"name\":\"La Rumba Bar and Grill\",\"review_info\":[{\"review_date\":\"2018-02-09 20:43:03\",\"review_stars\":