 on the primary ballot in the state.\nExpected to be a longshot in the race, Phillips will have to tackle not only facing an incumbent president, something that has been historically difficult to overcome but also fairly low national name recognition, especially in comparison to Biden.\nNevertheless, the challenge will undoubtedly frustrate the Democratic Party leadership, who have tried to discourage people within the party from running primary campaigns against Biden, believing the president is the party's best chance at retaining the White House in 2024.\nAt DailyNewsNow we bring you the latest news from the West Coast and around the country, covering a wide range of topics from politics and campaign news to entertainment and local interest stories. Please feel free to share the story with friends and join the conversation in the comments below!", "source_version": {"corpus": "ragtruth", "license": "MIT", "release_revision": "c103204b9ce28d6bbad859304bf30de72b8ed8fe"}, "state_reset": true, "token_boundary_receipts": {" A": true, " B": true}, "tokenize_s": 0.0020274819999031024, "tokenizer_identity": {"bos_token_id": "248044", "eos_token_id": "248046", "metadata_model": "gpt2", "representation": "embedded_gguf"}, "window_index": 1, "window_sha256": "sha256:e5c58ff5b2602c911b250426c45e4d68a1b42c437805cbdbb5440b6e6c45a784", "window_version": "carnot-balanced-contiguous-v1"}, {"actual_last_evaluated_position": 531, "archived_pilot_reuse": false, "arm": "focused_window", "attempted": true, "byte_end": 490, "byte_start": 387, "call_id": "sha256:9709aabf348db1f28ae3c8ab", "disposition": "complete", "eligible": true, "error": null, "generated_tokens": 0, "gold_label": null, "group_id": "group-59b18ecfe86a556b2d89e42a", "kv_state_id": "reset-epoch-532", "label_to_option_id": {" A": "contains_unsupported", " B": "supported"}, "log_odds_contains_unsupported": -0.7286252975463867, "marked_response": "House Democrat Dean Phillips is expected to launch his own campaign for the