ver, there were also some negative reviews. One customer mentioned encountering an unfriendly employee at the sandwich area and expressed their desire for better customer service.\n\nThe business parking at Vons includes a parking lot, but not a garage, street parking, or valet service. Other attributes such as restaurant reservations, outdoor seating, WiFi, and good for groups were not specified in the provided data.\n\nOverall, Vons seems to be a convenient local business in Santa Barbara, offering a range of products and services. However, improvements in customer service and employee friendliness may be necessary to enhance the overall customer experience.", "role": "training", "sealed_prompt_sha256": "sha256:b44ff2b4c39ad6d6aa902632e651c9dfd7098a22f9e78dfe3f93f92d578573b3", "sealed_prompt_token_count": 885, "sentence_count": 5, "sentence_version": "carnot-utf8-sentence-v1", "source_group_id": "group-5e94d53ddc6c6f73c6d56b4a", "source_sha256": "sha256:b38c5ff3234346821368995f1994cc4a0dbe3e0b5990dfedecf89022687ddfa8", "source_text": "{\"address\":\"3855 State St\",\"attributes\":{\"Ambience\":null,\"BusinessParking\":{\"garage\":false,\"lot\":true,\"street\":false,\"valet\":false,\"validated\":false},\"Music\":null,\"OutdoorSeating\":null,\"RestaurantsGoodForGroups\":null,\"RestaurantsReservations\":null,\"RestaurantsTakeOut\":true,\"WiFi\":null},\"business_stars\":2.5,\"categories\":\"Flowers & Gifts, Restaurants, Grocery, Food, Bakeries, Shopping, Florists\",\"city\":\"Santa Barbara\",\"hours\":{\"Friday\":\"6:0-0:0\",\"Monday\":\"6:0-0:0\",\"Saturday\":\"6:0-0:0\",\"Sunday\":\"6:0-0:0\",\"Thursday\":\"6:0-0:0\",\"Tuesday\":\"6:0-0:0\",\"Wednesday\":\"6:0-0:0\"},\"name\":\"Vons\",\"review_info\":[{\"review_date\":\"2018-07-26 14:22:26\",\"review_stars\":4.0,\"review_text\":\"Staying in Santa Barbara for the night, we decided to stop by here to pick up some grub to cook for dinner - albeit a little late (around 9-9:30).\\n\\nThe first thing I looked for was a tri tip.  They only had 3, and they were absolutely massive.  Something that you would buy for a huge party you would host.  But because there weren't any other options, we had to settle with 1/2 a cow.\\n\\nWe got some fresh corn, which was super sweet, and some potatoes, ranch beans and misc other items.  \\n\\nThe store was very clean, and the check out attendants were very pleasant and accommodating for when we were running back and grabbing things during checkout.\"},{\"review_date\":\"2018-07-24 04:32:54\",\"review_stars\":5.0,\"review_text\":\"Best apple fritter I've ever had. I'm not joking. Yes I know it's Vons. \\nThis fritter was lit.\\nGot it around 830 am\"},{\"review_date\":\"2018-06-15 21:39:21\",\"review_stars\":2.0,\"review_text\":\"Strange visit. Employee is not very friendly at the sandwich area. We like the sandwiches here so I'll keep coming back but I never have a great experience here. Upgrade the cheerfulness please.\"}],\"state\":\"CA\"}", "source_version": {"corpus": "ragtruth", "license": "MIT", "release_revision": "c103204b9ce28d6bbad859304bf30de72b8ed8fe"}, "state_reset": true, "token_boundary_receipts": {" A": true, " B": true}, "tokenize_s": 0.001620286999241216, "tokenizer_identity": {"bos_token_id": "248044", "eos_token_id": "248046", "metadata_model": "gpt2", "representation": "embedded_gguf"}, "window_index": 1, "window_sha256": "sha256:36eccbe3cf842f12c5afb3fcb0ee1c54c62f4c89bf07efd8d9d024773d401dd8", "window_version": "carnot-balanced-contiguous-v1"}, {"actual_last_evaluated_position": 885, "archived_pilot_reuse": false, "arm": "focused_window", "attempted": true, "byte_end": 1303, "byte_start": 925, "call_id": "sha256:75c33b900ec3151541fe0e4c", "disposition": "complete", "eligible": true, "error": null, "generated_tokens": 0, "gold_label": null, "group_id": "group-5e94d53ddc6c6f73c6d56b4a", "kv_state_id": "reset-epoch-552", "label_to_option_id": {" A": "supported", " B": "contains_unsupported"}, "log_odds_contains_unsupported": 0.20131969451904297, "marked_response": "Vons is a local business located at 3855 State St in Santa Barbara, CA. It offers a variety of products and services including flowers & gifts, restaurants, grocery items, food, bakeries, shopping, and florists. The store is open from 6:00 am to 12:00 am every day of the week.\n\nAccording to customer reviews, Vons has received mixed feedback. One customer mentioned that the store was very clean and the checkout attendants were pleasant and accommodating. They also appreciated the quality of the fresh corn and other items they purchased. Another customer praised the apple fritter, stating that it was the best they had ever had.\n\nHowever, there were also some negative reviews. One customer mentioned encountering an unfriendly employee at the sandwich area and expressed their desire for better customer service.\n\nThe business parking at Vons includes a parking lot, but not a garage, street parking, or valet service. <<CARNOT_FOCUS_START:925:1303>>Other attributes such as restaurant reservations, outdoor seating, WiFi, and good for groups were not specified in the provided data.\n\nOverall, Vons seems to be a convenient local business in Santa Barbara, offering a range of products and services. However, improvements in customer service and employee friendliness may be necessary to enhance the overall customer experience.<<CARNOT_FOCUS_END>>", "model_sha256": "sha256:7e78da5d7e3ae28d178121f58646953305f3e5bd3cb46f4a75584e8b6c6fe169", "native_option_token_ids": {" A": 357, " B": 417}, "normalization": "two_option_softmax_float64", "option_order": ["supported", "contains_unsupported"], "order_remapping": {" A": "supported", " B": "contains_unsupported"}, "prefill_s": 1.049942514999202, "probabilities_by_option_id": {"contains_unsupported": 0.550160622048765, "supported": 0.449839377951235}, "prompt_sha256": "sha256:9660be956f00cf991d59028c85371d2420b2122d648f1daf415f631e2728ef83", "prompt_token_count": 886, "prompt_token_ids": [189