ause there weren't any other options, we had to settle with 1/2 a cow.\\n\\nWe got some fresh corn, which was super sweet, and some potatoes, ranch beans and misc other items.  \\n\\nThe store was very clean, and the check out attendants were very pleasant and accommodating for when we were running back and grabbing things during checkout.\"},{\"review_date\":\"2018-07-24 04:32:54\",\"review_stars\":5.0,\"review_text\":\"Best apple fritter I've ever had. I'm not joking. Yes I know it's Vons. \\nThis fritter was lit.\\nGot it around 830 am\"},{\"review_date\":\"2018-06-15 21:39:21\",\"review_stars\":2.0,\"review_text\":\"Strange visit. Employee is not very friendly at the sandwich area. We like the sandwiches here so I'll keep coming back but I never have a great experience here. Upgrade the cheerfulness please.\"}],\"state\":\"CA\"}", "source_version": {"corpus": "ragtruth", "license": "MIT", "release_revision": "c103204b9ce28d6bbad859304bf30de72b8ed8fe"}, "state_reset": true, "token_boundary_receipts": {" A": true, " B": true}, "tokenize_s": 0.0016091560000859317, "tokenizer_identity": {"bos_token_id": "248044", "eos_token_id": "248046", "metadata_model": "gpt2", "representation": "embedded_gguf"}, "window_index": 2, "window_sha256": "sha256:0714f8049bc1eda99cacd377c524f5b614b49c1c9a70c2509b47a686c19dc5f2", "window_version": "carnot-balanced-contiguous-v1"}, {"actual_last_evaluated_position": 862, "archived_pilot_reuse": false, "arm": "whole_response", "attempted": true, "byte_end": null, "byte_start": null, "call_id": "sha256:06918b0e7d85822065b49eca", "disposition": "complete", "eligible": true, "error": null, "generated_tokens": 0, "gold_label": null, "group_id": "group-5e94d53ddc6c6f73c6d56b4a", "kv_state_id": "reset-epoch-553", "label_to_option_id": {" A": "contains_unsupported", " B": "supported"}, "log_odds_contains_unsupported": 0.917917251586914, "marked_response": null, "model_sha256": "sha256:7e78da5d7e3ae28d178121f58646953305f3e5bd3cb46f4a75584e8b6c6fe1