 has declined in recent months. One reviewer described the food as \"tasteless starches\" and another stated that the restaurant is overpriced. Despite these negative reviews, the overall rating for El Sitio is 4.0 out of 5 stars based on the review information provided. The restaurant offers outdoor seating and takes reservations, but does not offer WiFi or validate parking.", "role": "training", "sealed_prompt_sha256": "sha256:0a7676e79a87a14e6e9fbf310eeb6347958de3dd181dfd22303fe1b6142543c4", "sealed_prompt_token_count": 733, "sentence_count": 4, "sentence_version": "carnot-utf8-sentence-v1", "source_group_id": "group-6ec04eaf570979b696f2231a", "source_sha256": "sha256:a1f87ba48eb768de04f078dbc1c0284b234b5092214959a61631c1f3b6811c3c", "source_text": "{\"address\":\"138 S Salinas St\",\"attributes\":{\"Ambience\":{\"casual\":null,\"classy\":false,\"divey\":null,\"hipster\":false,\"intimate\":null,\"romantic\":false,\"touristy\":false,\"trendy\":false,\"upscale\":null},\"BusinessParking\":{\"garage\":false,\"lot\":true,\"street\":true,\"valet\":false,\"validated\":false},\"Music\":null,\"OutdoorSeating\":true,\"RestaurantsGoodForGroups\":false,\"RestaurantsReservations\":false,\"RestaurantsTakeOut\":true,\"WiFi\":\"no\"},\"business_stars\":4.0,\"categories\":\"Ethnic Food, Restaurants, Mexican, Specialty Food, Imported Food, Food\",\"city\":\"Santa Barbara\",\"hours\":null,\"name\":\"El Sitio\",\"review_info\":[{\"review_date\":\"2021-08-24 19:43:52\",\"review_stars\":5.0,\"review_text\":\"Can't go wrong here. Sounds boring but I actually think the chicken quesadilla with onion is pretty standout. The chicken is super peppery - would also recommend just chicken and onion tacos. Burritos are always a big hit too.\"},{\"review_date\":\"2021-07-29 02:20:20\",\"review_stars\":1.0,\"review_text\":\"This used to be one of our favorite little take-out places pre-COVID. It's just gone downhill on food plus higher prices.  Gave it a few tries to be fair but not going back.\"},{\"review_date\":\"2021-03-14 17:50:58\",\"review_stars\":1.0,\"review_text\":\"If you enjoy over paying for burritos and eating tastes tasteless starches..this will be your go to. I live around the corner as always try to give this family shop The benefit of the doubt. But the truth is this food fucking sucks. Sorry excuse for anyone trying to reach Mexican food and don't need their call themselves authentic. Horrible anyone who truly enjoys his spot a has never been south of the border and B must have the tongue amputated because I can't take the damn thing every time I've eaten here\"}],\"state\":\"CA\"}", "source_version": {"corpus": "ragtruth", "license": "MIT", "release_revision": "c103204b9ce28d6bbad859304bf30de72b8ed8fe"}, "state_reset": true, "token_boundary_receipts": {" A": true, " B": true}, "tokenize_s": 0.001467929999307671, "tokenizer_identity": {"bos_token_id": "248044", "eos_token_id": "248046", "metadata_model": "gpt2", "representation": "embedded_gguf"}, "window_index": 2, "window_sha256": "sha256:4820f56b1826b2685aef271716ed924a4c62a0bba4115a5e1c08cab205f95514", "window_version": "carnot-balanced-contiguous-v1"}, {"actual_last_evaluated_position": 1119, "archived_pilot_reuse": false, "arm": "whole_response", "attempted": true, "byte_end": null, "byte_start": null, "call_id": "sha256:8a2c415643122a17663d6b06", "disposition": "complete", "eligible": true, "error": null, "generated_tokens": 0, "gold_label": null, "group_id": "group-6ec27959c1c7718c4802b4fa", "kv_state_id": "reset-epoch-621", "label_to_option_id": {" A": "supported", " B": "contains_unsupported"}, "log_odds_contains_unsupported": 0.6322994232177735, "marked_response": null, "model_sha256": "sha256:7e78da5d7e3ae28d178121f58646953305f3e5bd3cb46f4a75584e8b6c6fe169", "native_option_token_ids": {" A": 357, " B": 417}, "normalization": "two_option_softmax_float64", "option_order": ["supported", "contains_unsupported"], "order_remapping": {" A": "supported", " B": "contains_unsupported"},