e_sha256": "sha256:447e8f03c8ff5acafd59f20e2b46a7ef0172bcd2ed8c2c89c24996020018986c", "response_text": "Montecito Gourmet by Village Cheese & Wine is a local business located at 1485 E Valley Rd, Ste 14 in Santa Barbara, CA. It offers a variety of services and amenities, including delis, nightlife, bars, food, wine bars, restaurants, coffee & tea, sandwiches, wineries, specialty food, arts & entertainment, and cheese shops. The business operates from 9:00 AM to 4:00 PM from Monday to Thursday, and from 9:00 AM to 4:00 PM on Fridays. On Saturdays, it opens from 10:00 AM to 3:00 PM.\n\nThe establishment has received positive customer reviews, with an average rating of 4.5 stars. Customers have praised the quality of the food and beverages, particularly the sandwiches, which are described as unparalleled. The selection of cheese and meats is impressive. The staff members are friendly and engaging, creating a pleasant atmosphere for customers to enjoy their meals. The owner, Patrick, is highly regarded for his exceptional service and dedication to the business.\n\nMontecito Gourmet has a welcoming ambiance, although it is not described as trendy, upscale, or casual. The business provides free WiFi and offers takeout services. It is also suitable for group gatherings. The parking lot is available for customers' convenience.\n\nOverall, Montecito Gourmet is a hidden gem in the Montecito area, with a long-standing presence since 1973. It is known for its high-quality products and excellent customer service. Visitors can expect a memorable dining experience and may also learn about the inspiring story behind the establishment.", "role": "training", "sealed_prompt_sha256": "sha256:854790960c7d7ab00e551661c00cc15093dc7900a44bc153abba6adc5b823206", "sealed_prompt_token_count": 1142, "sentence_count": 6, "sentence_version": "carnot-utf8-sentence-v1", "source_group_id": "group-6ec27959c1c7718c4802b4fa", "source_sha256": "sha256:5520f4bfb831f0b3708ce6dc937feed239b22a2f28cffd3059d4d67bfba0f7db", "source_text": "{\"address\":\"1485 E Valley Rd, Ste 14\",\"attributes\":{\"Ambience\":{\"casual\":false,\"classy\":false,\"divey\":false,\"hipster\":false,\"intimate\":false,\"romantic\":false,\"touristy\":false,\"trendy\":false,\"upscale\":false},\"BusinessParking\":{\"garage\":false,\"lot\":true,\"street\":false,\"valet\":false,\"validated\":false},\"Music\":null,\"OutdoorSeating\":null,\"RestaurantsGoodForGroups\":true,\"RestaurantsReservations\":false,\"RestaurantsTakeOut\":true,\"WiFi\":\"free\"},\"business_stars\":4.5,\"categories\":\"Delis, Nightlife, Bars, Food, Wine Bars, Restaurants, Coffee & Tea, Sandwiches, Wineries, Specialty Food, Arts & Entertainment, Cheese Shops\",\"city\":\"Santa Barbara\",\"hours\":{\"Friday\":\"9:0-16:0\",\"Monday\":\"9:0-16:0\",\"Saturday\":\"10:0-15:0\",\"Thursday\":\"9:0-16:0\",\"Tuesday\":\"9:0-16:0\",\"Wednesday\":\"9:0-16:0\"},\"name\":\"Montecito Gourmet by Village Cheese & Wine\",\"review_info\":[{\"review_date\":\"2021-09-29 19:02:16\",\"review_stars\":5.0,\"review_text\":\"Best sandwhich ever in my life and the people who work there are super cool people to talk to awesome place i'll be back tomarrow\"},{\"review_date\":\"2021-09-20 04:59:33\",\"review_stars\":5.0,\"review_text\":\"Patrick was absolutely incredible, and the food and coffee were above and beyond.\\nIn addition to that, the place itself has the most inspiring story - highly recommended to come and hear the story, enioy the fresh coffee, and last but not least - unparalleled sandwiches (with mind boggling selection of cheese and meats).\"},{\"review_date\":\"2021-08-31 16:13:17\",\"review_stars\":5.0,\"review_text\":\"Tucked away in the back corner of a modest looking shopping center in Montecito, this place was jammin! Owner Patrick was working alone and kicking ass! I was wondering why the sandwiches were taking longer than I expected, but then I realized that the few single people before us were ordering multiple Sammys. No doubt the take out orders were rolling in too. Patrick still made time to chat with customers and hand out free samples of delicious charcuterie. While we were eating outside, he kept bringing us more samples. The meats and cheeses and bread were of the highest quality and my \\\"Italian style\\\" sub on a heavenly soft French roll was the best I've ever had. This coming from a private chef/food fanatic. Charming side note: this place has been here since 1973 and was handed down from father to son.  From what I've read, Patrick's father John was beloved in the community. Well known to Montecito locals but new to this Venturan, I will definitely be back to this hidden gem. Seating is limited but there's a pretty, grassy area in the shopping center that would make for a lovely picnic. Keep up the good work and good works Patrick, of charity and community involvement.\"}],\"state\":\"CA\"}", "source_version": {"corpus": "ragtruth", "license": "MIT", "release_revision": "c103204b9ce28d6bbad859304bf30de72b8ed8fe"}, "state_reset": true, "token_boundary_receipts": {" A": true, " B": true}, "tokenize_s": 0.0021286430001055123, "tokenizer_identity": {"bos_token_id": "248044", "eos_token_id": "248046", "metadata_model": "gpt2", "representation": "embedded_gguf"}, "window_index": 1, "window_sha256": "sha256:1b1eca6bdd93b416c960767d7e3bc1c8016007a2f3b9278fe0db23c034ab5bb7", "window_version": "carnot-balanced-contiguous-v1"}, {"actual_last_evaluated_position": 1142, "archived_pilot_reuse": false, "arm": "focused_window", "attempted": true, "byte_end": 1536, "byte_start": 969, "call_id": "sha256:b7711ad5c8c9e5181d4ed73d", "disposition": "complete", "eligible": true, "error": null, "generated_tokens": 0, "gold_label": null, "group_id": "group-6ec27959c1c7718c4802b4fa", "kv_state_id": "reset-epoch-624", "label_to_option_id": {" A": "supported", " B": "contains_unsupported"}, "log_odds_contains_unsupported": 0.6789703369140623, "marked_response": "Montecito Gourmet by Village Cheese & Wine is a