aurants, coffee & tea, sandwiches, wineries, specialty food, arts & entertainment, and cheese shops. The business operates from 9:00 AM to 4:00 PM from Monday to Thursday, and from 9:00 AM to 4:00 PM on Fridays. On Saturdays, it opens from 10:00 AM to 3:00 PM.\n\nThe establishment has received positive customer reviews, with an average rating of 4.5 stars. Customers have praised the quality of the food and beverages, particularly the sandwiches, which are described as unparalleled. The selection of cheese and meats is impressive. The staff members are friendly and engaging, creating a pleasant atmosphere for customers to enjoy their meals. The owner, Patrick, is highly regarded for his exceptional service and dedication to the business.\n\nMontecito Gourmet has a welcoming ambiance, although it is not described as trendy, upscale, or casual. The business provides free WiFi and offers takeout services. It is also suitable for group gatherings. The parking lot is available for customers' convenience.\n\nOverall, Montecito Gourmet is a hidden gem in the Montecito area, with a long-standing presence since 1973. It is known for its high-quality products and excellent customer service. Visitors can expect a memorable dining experience and may also learn about the inspiring story behind the establishment.", "role": "training", "sealed_prompt_sha256": "sha256:ca0313b9586ad39bb22e0ba7896dd8304efce15dc11d46ccf0842bc8c37ffb14", "sealed_prompt_token_count": 1143, "sentence_count": 7, "sentence_version": "carnot-utf8-sentence-v1", "source_group_id": "group-6ec27959c1c7718c4802b4fa", "source_sha256": "sha256:5520f4bfb831f0b3708ce6dc937feed239b22a2f28cffd3059d4d67bfba0f7db", "source_text": "{\"address\":\"1485 E Valley Rd, Ste 14\",\"attributes\":{\"Ambience\":{\"casual\":false,\"classy\":false,\"divey\":false,\"hipster\":false,\"intimate\":false,\"romantic\":false,\"touristy\":false,\"trendy\":false,\"upscale\":false},\"BusinessParking\":{\"garage\":false,\"lot\":true,\"street\":