 - it also came with an excellent Focaccia. Broccolini, which was tangy, charred to perfection and just delish.  And two pizzas, the mushroom and pepperoni, which may have been the best I've had. Great little spot in SB, highly recommend.\"}],\"state\":\"CA\"}", "source_version": {"corpus": "ragtruth", "license": "MIT", "release_revision": "c103204b9ce28d6bbad859304bf30de72b8ed8fe"}, "state_reset": true, "token_boundary_receipts": {" A": true, " B": true}, "tokenize_s": 0.0017761199997039512, "tokenizer_identity": {"bos_token_id": "248044", "eos_token_id": "248046", "metadata_model": "gpt2", "representation": "embedded_gguf"}, "window_index": null, "window_sha256": null, "window_version": null}, {"actual_last_evaluated_position": 990, "archived_pilot_reuse": false, "arm": "focused_window", "attempted": true, "byte_end": 302, "byte_start": 0, "call_id": "sha256:ad7145cd3626ac1cd7e3e93c", "disposition": "complete", "eligible": true, "error": null, "generated_tokens": 0, "gold_label": null, "group_id": "group-749869b78483b77e80fd464a", "kv_state_id": "reset-epoch-634", "label_to_option_id": {" A": "contains_unsupported", " B": "supported"}, "log_odds_contains_unsupported": 0.999746322631836, "marked_response": "<<CARNOT_FOCUS_START:0:302>>Bettina is a restaurant located at 1014 Coast Village Road in Santa Barbara, California. The restaurant serves Italian cuisine and specializes in pizza. It is open Monday through Sunday from 4:00 PM to 8:30 PM. The restaurant offers outdoor seating, Wi-Fi, takeout options, and is suitable for groups. <<CARNOT_FOCUS_END>>The restaurant has four and a half stars on Google and has received several positive reviews. One customer noted that the food was not the issue but the staff was flat, unengaging, and had a stuffy awkward energy. Another customer loved the pizza and the service, and appreciated the easy parking and charming ambiance. A third customer praised the restaurant's delicious food and charming atmosphere. Overall, Bettina app