d time here so i was giving them a second chance.\"}],\"state\":\"CA\"}", "source_version": {"corpus": "ragtruth", "license": "MIT", "release_revision": "c103204b9ce28d6bbad859304bf30de72b8ed8fe"}, "state_reset": true, "token_boundary_receipts": {" A": true, " B": true}, "tokenize_s": 0.0014668179992440855, "tokenizer_identity": {"bos_token_id": "248044", "eos_token_id": "248046", "metadata_model": "gpt2", "representation": "embedded_gguf"}, "window_index": null, "window_sha256": null, "window_version": null}, {"actual_last_evaluated_position": 766, "archived_pilot_reuse": false, "arm": "focused_window", "attempted": true, "byte_end": 314, "byte_start": 0, "call_id": "sha256:555ea31585d8f70f11673386", "disposition": "complete", "eligible": true, "error": null, "generated_tokens": 0, "gold_label": null, "group_id": "group-7641d12f39baad67a40739a3", "kv_state_id": "reset-epoch-642", "label_to_option_id": {" A": "contains_unsupported", " B": "supported"}, "log_odds_contains_unsupported": 4.895448684692383, "marked_response": "<<CARNOT_FOCUS_START:0:314>>Sure! Here's an objective overview of Woody's Roundup Bar & Grill based on the provided structured data:\n\nWoody's Roundup Bar & Grill is a restaurant located at Earl Warren Showgrounds in Santa Barbara, California. The bar and grill serves barbecue, has outdoor seating, and offers takeout and group reservations. <<CARNOT_FOCUS_END>>According to reviews, the restaurant has garnered mixed ratings, with some patrons expressing disappointment with the quality of food and service. One reviewer noted that they waited over 45 minutes for service without seeing a waiter, while another reviewer found the food to be overcooked and not up to their standards. A third reviewer expressed frustration with the menu items being described as \"meh\" and the pulled pork sandwich being over-sauced. However, the restaurant does offer WiFi and has outdoor seating, which may appeal to some patrons. Overall, Woody's Roundup Bar & Grill seems