05dfa51c123f87d86a9af0d0a0f64bfc544e2d5bb9471a2f160bbcf56e9f23", "sealed_prompt_token_count": 584, "sentence_count": null, "sentence_version": null, "source_group_id": "group-777ef9106bab296e052c7319", "source_sha256": "sha256:615329563a67c29568946a9d202cdab5c63f25f88b794caf9a811db36cbf7f65", "source_text": "'Bold and the Beautiful' Spoilers: Lauren Visits LA, Will She Finally Learn Sheila Carter Is Alive?\nThe Bold and the Beautiful (B&B) spoilers tease that Lauren Fenmore (Tracey E Bregman) will stop by Los Angeles for a visit on Friday, October 27. Soap Opera Digest reports Lauren will only be in LA for one episode and head back to Genoa City.\nLauren plans to attend the fashion showdown between Eric Forrester (John McCook) and Ridge Forrester (Thorsten Kaye). Being a fashion designer based in Genoa City, she wants to support her friends in the battle for the best designs.\nWith Sheila Carter (Kimberlin Brown) alive and well, surely someone will mention Lauren's former nemesis to her. Until now, no one has called Lauren to deliver the crushing news that Sheila was never attacked by a bear and is alive. Not only that, Lauren could learn Deacon is in a relationship with the monster. Considering all the years Sheila was obsessed with Lauren and her then-husband, Scott, you would think someone would give her the heads up.\nIt's possible that the whole purpose of Lauren's crossover to The Bold and the Beautiful is to learn the scoop about Sheila. Perhaps she can talk some sense into Deacon Sharpe (Sean Kanan) and get him to leave her in the dust.\nThe Bold and the Beautiful spoilers say Lauren's crossover to B&B will be action-packed, ending in the designer learning shocking news. It points to Lauren learning Sheila is alive. It's possible the upsetting news could be related to Eric's health crisis.\nB&B fans, do you think Lauren will learn that Sheila's alive? Keep watching The Bold and the Beautiful, airing weekdays on CBS and streaming on Paramount Plus. Please share your thoughts with me in the comments section below. Remember to follow me to read more of my content.\n.", "source_version": {"corpus": "ragtruth", "license": "MIT", "release_revision": "c103204b9ce28d6bbad859304bf30de72b8ed8fe"}, "state_reset": true, "token_boundary_receipts": {" A": true, " B": true}, "tokenize_s": 0.0013398089995462215, "tokenizer_identity": {"bos_token_id": "248044", "eos_token_id": "248046", "metadata_model": "gpt2", "representation": "embedded_gguf"}, "window_index": null, "window_sha256": null, "window_version": null}, {"actual_last_evaluated_position": 603, "archived_pilot_reuse": false, "arm": "focused_window", "attempted": true, "byte_end": 209, "byte_start": 0, "call_id": "sha256:095168807f2ada2f44e408cc", "disposition": "complete", "eligible": true, "error": null, "generated_tokens": 0, "gold_label": null, "group_id": "group-777ef9106bab296e052c7319", "kv_state_id": "reset-epoch-646", "label_to_option_id": {" A": "supported", " B": "contains_unsupported"}, "log_odds_contains_unsupported": 0.7997016906738282, "marked_response": "<<CARNOT_FOCUS_START:0:209>>Lauren Fenmore from \"The Young and the Restless\" will visit Los Angeles on Friday, October 27, for one episode. During her visit, she will attend a fashion showdown between Eric Forrester and Ridge Forrester. <<CARNOT_FOCUS_END>>While in LA, it is possible that she will learn that Sheila Carter, her former nemesis, is alive. Sheila was once obsessed with Lauren and her husband, Scott, so it's likely that someone will mention her to Lauren during her trip. The Bold and the Beautiful spoilers suggest that Lauren's crossover to B&B will end in a shocking revelation that relates to Eric's health crisis.", "model_sha256": "sha256:7e78da5d7e3ae28d178121f58646953305f3e5bd3cb46f4a75584e8b6c6fe169", "native_option_token_ids": {" A": 357, " B": 417}, "normalization": "two_option_softmax_float64", "option_order": ["supported", "contains_unsupported"], "order_remapping": {" A": "supported", "