u reported a median personal income of $30,240 for all workers over age 15 with income, and a mean personal income of $44,510 based on the Current Population Survey for 2015.\\n\\npassage 3:Among different demographics (gender, marital status, ethnicity) for those over the age of 18, median personal income ranged from $3,317 for an unemployed, married Asian American female to $55,935 for a full-time, year-round employed Asian American male.\\n\\n\",\"question\":\"age vs income data\"}", "source_version": {"corpus": "ragtruth", "license": "MIT", "release_revision": "c103204b9ce28d6bbad859304bf30de72b8ed8fe"}, "state_reset": true, "token_boundary_receipts": {" A": true, " B": true}, "tokenize_s": 0.001029116000609065, "tokenizer_identity": {"bos_token_id": "248044", "eos_token_id": "248046", "metadata_model": "gpt2", "representation": "embedded_gguf"}, "window_index": null, "window_sha256": null, "window_version": null}, {"actual_last_evaluated_position": 517, "archived_pilot_reuse": false, "arm": "focused_window", "attempted": true, "byte_end": 267, "byte_start": 0, "call_id": "sha256:af43a8c41425011d2c543a3f", "disposition": "complete", "eligible": true, "error": null, "generated_tokens": 0, "gold_label": null, "group_id": "group-78ad632af02b4964a65d4fba", "kv_state_id": "reset-epoch-654", "label_to_option_id": {" A": "supported", " B": "contains_unsupported"}, "log_odds_contains_unsupported": -1.4956703186035156, "marked_response": "<<CARNOT_FOCUS_START:0:267>>Based on the given passages, there is no direct information about the relationship between age and income data. Passage 1 provides information about median weekly earnings by age group, but does not provide information about personal income or overall income levels. <<CARNOT_FOCUS_END>>Passage 2 provides information about median personal income and mean personal income, but does not break down income by age group. Passage 3 provides information about median personal income for different demographics, but only