cause it was during a very busy Saturday night service. Even though it was busy, it wasn't super loud, IMO. The outdoor seating patio area is very nice and on this most recent visit I sat inside and the atmosphere was very pleasant (and all staff were masked and I felt perfectly fine in that regard).  Most importantly the food is YUM *and* they have several vegetarian friendly options.  I look forward to my next visit.\"}],\"state\":\"CA\"}", "source_version": {"corpus": "ragtruth", "license": "MIT", "release_revision": "c103204b9ce28d6bbad859304bf30de72b8ed8fe"}, "state_reset": true, "token_boundary_receipts": {" A": true, " B": true}, "tokenize_s": 0.001693745000011404, "tokenizer_identity": {"bos_token_id": "248044", "eos_token_id": "248046", "metadata_model": "gpt2", "representation": "embedded_gguf"}, "window_index": 0, "window_sha256": "sha256:aefc739481268bb7909dd4df0df5ceeb25e2603d690f07d387650b7b42954e85", "window_version": "carnot-balanced-contiguous-v1"}, {"actual_last_evaluated_position": 912, "archived_pilot_reuse": false, "arm": "focused_window", "attempted": true, "byte_end": 468, "byte_start": 248, "call_id": "sha256:ce2929188f209f58734c54b2", "disposition": "complete", "eligible": true, "error": null, "generated_tokens": 0, "gold_label": null, "group_id": "group-7a7c5676117cb8e03905eec5", "kv_state_id": "reset-epoch-663", "label_to_option_id": {" A": "supported", " B": "contains_unsupported"}, "log_odds_contains_unsupported": 2.1597537994384766, "marked_response": "La Playa Azul Cafe is a Mexican restaurant located at 914 Santa Barbara St in Santa Barbara, CA. They offer outdoor seating and take reservations. Their menu includes tacos, burritos, and other Mexican dishes, as well as drinks such as margaritas. <<CARNOT_FOCUS_START:248:468>>Reviewers have praised the quality of the food and the friendly service. Some have also noted that the restaurant can get busy during peak hours, but the outdoor seating area provides a peaceful and romantic atmosph