 has been praised for its breakfast dishes. However, it appears that the cafe has since closed down according to one review.", "role": "training", "sealed_prompt_sha256": "sha256:71dcd23a687bd5fbac5f3e2092b60967e149be247181794be6868064cd0f2206", "sealed_prompt_token_count": 825, "sentence_count": null, "sentence_version": null, "source_group_id": "group-7aaded429bb96b64c5b1bc2d", "source_sha256": "sha256:f78c0af8cb35fc210068e58a84b2c29d71ed6528ff6b47f6cb38b4eeb6c19ffd", "source_text": "{\"address\":\"1218 State St\",\"attributes\":{\"Ambience\":{\"casual\":true,\"classy\":false,\"divey\":false,\"hipster\":false,\"intimate\":false,\"romantic\":false,\"touristy\":false,\"trendy\":false,\"upscale\":false},\"BusinessParking\":{\"garage\":true,\"lot\":false,\"street\":true,\"valet\":false,\"validated\":false},\"Music\":null,\"OutdoorSeating\":true,\"RestaurantsGoodForGroups\":true,\"RestaurantsReservations\":true,\"RestaurantsTakeOut\":true,\"WiFi\":\"no\"},\"business_stars\":4.0,\"categories\":\"Restaurants, Breakfast & Brunch, American (Traditional), American (New), Southern\",\"city\":\"Santa Barbara\",\"hours\":{\"Friday\":\"17:0-20:0\",\"Monday\":\"8:0-14:0\",\"Saturday\":\"17:0-20:0\",\"Sunday\":\"17:0-20:0\",\"Thursday\":\"17:0-20:0\",\"Tuesday\":\"17:0-20:0\",\"Wednesday\":\"17:0-20:0\"},\"name\":\"Tupelo Junction Cafe\",\"review_info\":[{\"review_date\":\"2019-12-13 18:24:08\",\"review_stars\":4.0,\"review_text\":\"The food was great!  We brought our kids and they were pretty accommodating given that they didn't have a kids' menu.  The scrambles were pretty good, the cinnamon apple beignets were excellent.  The crab bloody Mary was a little watery but still spicy.  I could have rated this 5 stars but we've never spent $80 on a brunch so it's just 4 stars.\"},{\"review_date\":\"2018-01-27 18:12:42\",\"review_stars\":5.0,\"review_text\":\"This place has incredible breakfast. They just moved to Newport Beach California. There are no longer in Santa Barbara :(\"},{\