 Monday to Sunday. While there is no information about services like business parking, reservations, outdoor seating, WiFi, takeaway, and group suitability, it holds an average star rating of 3.5. Some customers have had mixed experiences, with one describing their food as dry and flavorless. However, others praised the authenticity of the food, the rotation of dishes, and the affordability, with special mentions of the chow mein and fried rice. The restaurant is particularly popular among college students.", "role": "training", "sealed_prompt_sha256": "sha256:6112a1d7fe33a7b496d31fe25ad28da4d578849a96f6493188d002c9e27a4ddc", "sealed_prompt_token_count": 744, "sentence_count": null, "sentence_version": null, "source_group_id": "group-7b401a190dd4011f137b2194", "source_sha256": "sha256:1d63e5ab387c022d4f3ad45ef728e13331e80af5cd4cb3046e678427084f38a4", "source_text": "{\"address\":\"966 Embarcadero Del Mar, Apt C\",\"attributes\":{\"Ambience\":null,\"BusinessParking\":null,\"Music\":null,\"OutdoorSeating\":null,\"RestaurantsGoodForGroups\":null,\"RestaurantsReservations\":null,\"RestaurantsTakeOut\":null,\"WiFi\":null},\"business_stars\":3.5,\"categories\":\"Restaurants, Fast Food, Chinese\",\"city\":\"Isla Vista\",\"hours\":{\"Friday\":\"11:0-21:0\",\"Monday\":\"11:0-21:0\",\"Saturday\":\"11:0-21:0\",\"Sunday\":\"11:0-21:0\",\"Thursday\":\"11:0-21:0\",\"Tuesday\":\"11:0-21:0\",\"Wednesday\":\"11:0-21:0\"},\"name\":\"Red Pepper Chinese Food Express\",\"review_info\":[{\"review_date\":\"2021-12-09 06:27:06\",\"review_stars\":1.0,\"review_text\":\"Honestly some of the worst food I've ever eaten. I know that sounds like an exaggeration, but it was dry and flavorless (MC), and there were a bunch of bones and non-gelatinzed pieces of fat (SC). One of the few times I've ever had to throw out my dinner instead of just bearing it. I'm not sure what the dishes were called, since there are no name plates, but one looked like mandarin chicken (MC), and the other was referred to 