ing and free WiFi, making it a great spot to relax and enjoy a drink or two. Overall, Armada Wine & Beer Merchant appears to be a well-regarded local business with a focus on providing excellent customer service and a wide range of beverages.", "role": "training", "sealed_prompt_sha256": "sha256:435c808770bf73d71ea38059f7ec508bfcefd7fbde4adf6db32237c6969f9a57", "sealed_prompt_token_count": 773, "sentence_count": null, "sentence_version": null, "source_group_id": "group-81244fd3496e48e50afccd3d", "source_sha256": "sha256:771f26e896d3283aec6deb6b3167b5187d1330299bbe4af18cde4533424b4c83", "source_text": "{\"address\":\"1129 A State St\",\"attributes\":{\"Ambience\":null,\"BusinessParking\":{\"garage\":true,\"lot\":false,\"street\":false,\"valet\":false,\"validated\":false},\"Music\":null,\"OutdoorSeating\":true,\"RestaurantsGoodForGroups\":true,\"RestaurantsReservations\":true,\"RestaurantsTakeOut\":false,\"WiFi\":\"free\"},\"business_stars\":4.5,\"categories\":\"Local Flavor, Bars, Food, Nightlife, Beer Bar, Lounges, Wine Bars, Beer, Wine & Spirits\",\"city\":\"Santa Barbara\",\"hours\":{\"Friday\":\"13:0-23:0\",\"Monday\":\"0:0-0:0\",\"Saturday\":\"13:0-23:0\",\"Sunday\":\"13:0-19:0\",\"Thursday\":\"13:0-21:0\",\"Tuesday\":\"13:0-21:0\",\"Wednesday\":\"13:0-21:0\"},\"name\":\"Armada Wine & Beer Merchant\",\"review_info\":[{\"review_date\":\"2020-10-15 06:05:38\",\"review_stars\":2.0,\"review_text\":\"I love armada but tonight was a disappointment. I ordered a bottle of rose. Without mentioning anything, the girl working grabbed a bottle off the shelf and poured me 2 glasses of warm rose. I definitely would have picked something else if she would've mentioned that she didn't have any chilled. I proceeded to ask her if she even had any ice (she didn't) then she handed me the warm bottle to take outside, rather than offering to chill it. Will come back to see if this was a fluke or if they just have poorly trained staff in general :(\"},{\"review_date\":\"2020-10-03 16:47:28\",\"review_stars\":5.0,\"review_text\":\"Wine selection is great. It is hidden but its a must stop. Carlos is the best and he knows so much about wine. Highly recommend you stop in grab some wine or a drink and sit in the beautiful courtyard.\"},{\"review_date\":\"2020-03-15 03:14:54\",\"review_stars\":5.0,\"review_text\":\"This place is an absolute haven. Amir  attends to his customers with care and compassion. Definitely worth the drop in and the wine club is a steal for what it's worth\"}],\"state\":\"CA\"}", "source_version": {"corpus": "ragtruth", "license": "MIT", "release_revision": "c103204b9ce28d6bbad859304bf30de72b8ed8fe"}, "state_reset": true, "token_boundary_receipts": {" A": true, " B": true}, "tokenize_s": 0.0017152849995909492, "tokenizer_identity": {"bos_token_id": "248044", "eos_token_id": "248046", "metadata_model": "gpt2", "representation": "embedded_gguf"}, "window_index": null, "window_sha256": null, "window_version": null}, {"actual_last_evaluated_position": 792, "archived_pilot_reuse": false, "arm": "focused_window", "attempted": true, "byte_end": 363, "byte_start": 0, "call_id": "sha256:2f24a9538272c8e1bdbbf3b8", "disposition": "complete", "eligible": true, "error": null, "generated_tokens": 0, "gold_label": null, "group_id": "group-81244fd3496e48e50afccd3d", "kv_state_id": "reset-epoch-726", "label_to_option_id": {" A": "supported", " B": "contains_unsupported"}, "log_odds_contains_unsupported": 3.6665353775024414, "marked_response": "<<CARNOT_FOCUS_START:0:363>>Here is an objective overview of Armada Wine & Beer Merchant based on the provided structured data:\n\nLocated in Santa Barbara, California, Armada Wine & Beer Merchant is a popular destination for locals and visitors alike. With a diverse selection of wines and beers, including craft beers and natural wines, this establishment offers something for every palate. <<CARNOT_FOCUS_END>>The business has a rating of 4.5 stars, indicating a high level of customer satisfaction. However