 warm and welcoming, creating a comfortable environment for patrons. Though the ambiance may not be particularly stylish or upscale, the quality of the food and service makes up for it.\n\nHugo's is open seven days a week from 7:00 AM to 2:00 PM, making it an excellent choice for breakfast or brunch. The restaurant offers free Wi-Fi, outdoor seating, and takeout options, further enhancing the overall dining experience. Regulars and visitors alike can enjoy a satisfying meal at Hugo's, which has been in operation for over 20 years.\n\nIn summary, Hugo's Restaurant is a must-visit for anyone in the Carpinteria area looking for a delicious, casual dining experience with a welcoming atmosphere. Its diverse menu, friendly service, and reasonable prices make it an ideal spot for families, couples, and solo diners alike.", "role": "training", "sealed_prompt_sha256": "sha256:2b75103379c2c0fec6b8a1450ef50948d079947e04a5750358cd1ff4da4c31d0", "sealed_prompt_token_count": 1130, "sentence_count": 5, "sentence_version": "carnot-utf8-sentence-v1", "source_group_id": "group-820f90d9ae0e6a80bb2c3e79", "source_sha256": "sha256:c6cfa50f58d9a4428da4b8c078e0e7dd3048029974ac1f950e102d714f60c053", "source_text": "{\"address\":\"1049 Casitas Pass Rd\",\"attributes\":{\"Ambience\":{\"casual\":true,\"classy\":false,\"divey\":null,\"hipster\":false,\"intimate\":false,\"romantic\":false,\"touristy\":false,\"trendy\":false,\"upscale\":false},\"BusinessParking\":{\"garage\":false,\"lot\":true,\"street\":false,\"valet\":false,\"validated\":false},\"Music\":null,\"OutdoorSeating\":true,\"RestaurantsGoodForGroups\":true,\"RestaurantsReservations\":false,\"RestaurantsTakeOut\":true,\"WiFi\":\"free\"},\"business_stars\":4.5,\"categories\":\"Restaurants, Asian Fusion, Breakfast & Brunch, American (Traditional)\",\"city\":\"Carpinteria\",\"hours\":{\"Friday\":\"7:0-14:0\",\"Saturday\":\"7:0-14:0\",\"Sunday\":\"7:0-14:0\",\"Thursday\":\"7:0-14:0\",\"Tuesday\":\"7:0-14:0\",\"Wednesday\":\"7:0-14:0\"},\"