nd welcoming, creating a comfortable environment for patrons. Though the ambiance may not be particularly stylish or upscale, the quality of the food and service makes up for it.\n\nHugo's is open seven days a week from 7:00 AM to 2:00 PM, making it an excellent choice for breakfast or brunch. The restaurant offers free Wi-Fi, outdoor seating, and takeout options, further enhancing the overall dining experience. Regulars and visitors alike can enjoy a satisfying meal at Hugo's, which has been in operation for over 20 years.\n\nIn summary, Hugo's Restaurant is a must-visit for anyone in the Carpinteria area looking for a delicious, casual dining experience with a welcoming atmosphere. Its diverse menu, friendly service, and reasonable prices make it an ideal spot for families, couples, and solo diners alike.", "role": "training", "sealed_prompt_sha256": "sha256:444069af1602c8aed44f8a02d15f48db031730a0310a5fa93730a77bc3669dd8", "sealed_prompt_token_count": 1130, "sentence_count": 5, "sentence_version": "carnot-utf8-sentence-v1", "source_group_id": "group-820f90d9ae0e6a80bb2c3e79", "source_sha256": "sha256:c6cfa50f58d9a4428da4b8c078e0e7dd3048029974ac1f950e102d714f60c053", "source_text": "{\"address\":\"1049 Casitas Pass Rd\",\"attributes\":{\"Ambience\":{\"casual\":true,\"classy\":false,\"divey\":null,\"hipster\":false,\"intimate\":false,\"romantic\":false,\"touristy\":false,\"trendy\":false,\"upscale\":false},\"BusinessParking\":{\"garage\":false,\"lot\":true,\"street\":false,\"valet\":false,\"validated\":false},\"Music\":null,\"OutdoorSeating\":true,\"RestaurantsGoodForGroups\":true,\"RestaurantsReservations\":false,\"RestaurantsTakeOut\":true,\"WiFi\":\"free\"},\"business_stars\":4.5,\"categories\":\"Restaurants, Asian Fusion, Breakfast & Brunch, American (Traditional)\",\"city\":\"Carpinteria\",\"hours\":{\"Friday\":\"7:0-14:0\",\"Saturday\":\"7:0-14:0\",\"Sunday\":\"7:0-14:0\",\"Thursday\":\"7:0-14:0\",\"Tuesday\":\"7:0-14:0\",\"Wednesday\":\"7:0-14:0\"},\"name\":\"Hugos Restaurant\",\"review_info\":[{\"review_date\":\"2021-12-15 18:08:24\",\"review_stars\":4.0,\"review_text\":\"We almost gave this place a pass - not a lot of upfront charm. But the Yelp reviews were good so we gave it a try. Glad we did! Friendly service as soon as we walked in. Basic breakfast was hot and delicious. I had scrambled eggs (fresh and yummy) with crispy hash browns and sourdough toast. My husband had the veggie scramble (zucchini, red peppers, onion, mushrooms) all fresh and delicious, with the same sides I had. Good cup of coffee, also! We appreciate a hard-working local restaurant and will definitely come back. Four stars just because the ambiance isn't really there. Don't let that stop you from giving this place a try!\"},{\"review_date\":\"2021-11-27 01:28:40\",\"review_stars\":5.0,\"review_text\":\"We were coming home from a college visit trip to SLO and UCSB and wanted to hit Carp for breakfast. My kid typed in breakfast and this was one of the first that popped up - thank you Yelp!! Mom and pop-type small strip-mall cafe and we loved it. My wife and kids had pancakes (wife added blueberries) with eggs and I had the French toast. A side of hash browns to share (although we probably didn't need it) - just what the road trip ordered. Super friendly and when the people in front of us didn't need menus because the locals know what they want, it is a good sign. Hard working family, but open from 7am-2pm so it might not be a bad gig.... We will stop there again I am sure.\"},{\"review_date\":\"2021-10-09 16:17:22\",\"review_stars\":5.0,\"review_text\":\"Hugo's Restaurant in Carpinteria is THE best breakfast/brunch spot. I especially love their pancakes, stir fried noodles, and chilaquiles! Their menu is so diverse and anyone can find something to their liking. \\n\\nThe owners are so welcoming and joyful every time I visit. They have been operating for 20+ years! The service is phenomenal; you never have to wait long for your food. \\n\\nIf you're ever in the area, this is the spot.\"}],\"state\":\"CA\"}", "source_version": {"corpus": "ragtruth", "license": "MIT", "release_revision": "c103204b9ce28d6bbad859304bf30de72b8ed8fe"}, "state_reset": true, "token_boundary_receipts": {" A": true, " B": true}, "tokenize_s": 0.002161374000024807, "tokenizer_identity": {"bos_token_id": "248044", "eos_token_id": "248046", "metadata_model": "gpt2", "representation": "embedded_gguf"}, "window_index": 0, "window_sha256": "sha256:cfa80105e186d5196da300ec1b1251c66898d88036849b6a3f607abe2558b1d2", "window_version": "carnot-balanced-contiguous-v1"}, {"actual_last_evaluated_position": 1131, "archived_pilot_reuse": false, "arm": "focused_window", "attempted": true, "byte_end": 885, "byte_start": 483, "call_id": "sha256:5faf118d16767b1796e6b5c2", "disposition": "complete", "eligible": true, "error": null, "generated_tokens": 0, "gold_label": null, "group_id": "group-820f90d9ae0e6a80bb2c3e79", "kv_state_id": "reset-epoch-739", "label_to_option_id": {" A": "contains_unsupported", " B": "supported"}, "log_odds_contains_unsupported": 4.045122146606445, "marked_response": "Hugo's Restaurant is a locally owned and operated eatery located in Carpinteria, CA, specializing in Asian fusion, breakfast, and brunch cuisine. With a 4.5-star rating and overwhelmingly positive reviews, Hugo's is a hidden gem in the area. The restaurant is known for its fresh and delicious food, including scrambled eggs, crispy hash browns, sourdough toast, and veggie scrambles. The menu offers a variety of options, catering to diverse tastes, and the portions are generous.\n\n<<CARNOT_FOCUS_START:483:885>>The restaurant has a cozy atmosphere, with friendly and attentive service. The owners are described as warm and welcoming, creating a comfortable environment for patrons. Though the ambiance may not be particularly stylish or upscale, the quality of the food and service makes up for it.\n\nHugo's is open seven days a week from 7:00 AM to 2:00 PM, making it an excellent choice for breakfast or brunch. <<CARNOT_FOCUS_END>>The restaurant offers free Wi-Fi, outdoor seating, and takeout options, further enhancing the overall dining experience. Regulars and visitors alike can enjoy a satisfying meal at Hugo's, which has been in operation for over 20 years.\n\nIn summary, Hugo's Restaurant is a must-visit for anyone in the Carpinteria area looking for a delicious, casual dining experience with a welcoming atmosphere. Its diverse menu, friendly service, and reasonable prices make it an ideal spot for families, couples, and solo diners alike.", "model_sha256": "sha256:7e78da5d7e3ae28d178121f58646953305f3e5bd3cb46f4a75584e8b6c6fe169", "native_option_token_ids": {" A": 357, " B": 417}, "normalization": "two_option_softmax_float64", "option_order": ["contains_unsupported", "supported"], "order_remapping": {" A": "contains_unsupported", " B": "supported"}, "prefill_s": 1.3453390419999778, "probabilities_by_option_id": {"contains_unsupported": 0.9827936748385842, "supported": 0.017206325161415823}, "prompt_sha256": "sha256:930ff61a78c96b3a1d6b6288c809adb74f8b9e138787e2aa62ac1085c64a221f", "prompt_token_count": 1132, "prompt_token_ids": [1890, 1386, 1761, 364, 279, 4434, 1965, 1608, 1132, 279, 16713, 2450, 13, 271, 41578, 198, 4754, 4834, 3147, 16, 15, 19, 24, 10731, 20575, 9675, 26577, 2129, 11987, 21624, 52218, 1772, 21624, 23543, 899, 763, 1802, 1288, 1005, 88, 763, 3721, 1288, 67, 520, 88, 763, 2827, 1288, 92670, 763, 3721, 1288, 390, 3316, 763, 3721, 1288, 433, 7902, 763, 3721, 1288, 49612, 84507, 763, 3721, 1288, 237419, 88, 763, 3721, 1288, 8339, 2174, 763, 3721, 49471, 22020, 91061, 21624, 11816, 416, 763, 3721, 1288, 8911, 763, 1802, 1288, 26466, 763, 3721, 1288, 6378, 1112, 763, 3721, 1288, 57576, 763, 3721, 49471, 23373, 763, 2827, 1288, 95130, 1460, 1060, 763, 1802, 1288, 12060, 32858, 14773, 2381, 21485, 763, 1802, 1288, 12060, 32858, 1026, 44294, 763, 3721, 1288, 12060, 32858, 17283, 2575, 763, 1802, 1288, 92247, 3147, 1