68fce850972a19013c3", "response_text": "Sure! Here's an objective overview of The Palace Grill based on the provided structured data in JSON format:\n\nThe Palace Grill is a highly-recommended restaurant in Santa Barbara, CA that serves Seafood, Cajun/Creole, and American cuisine. With an average rating of 4.5 stars and a 97% recommendation rate, it's clear that this restaurant has impressed many of its patrons. The menu offers a variety of dishes, including crawfish pasta and chocolate souffl\u00e9, which have received rave reviews from customers. One reviewer even called it their \"new favorite restaurant.\"\n\nIn addition to its delectable food, The Palace Grill also provides excellent customer service. One customer recounted how the server, Mondo, went above and beyond to accommodate their needs on a busy night. The restaurant's atmosphere is cozy and intimate, with outdoor seating and free WiFi available. While some reviewers noted that the prices are a bit high, most agreed that the quality of the food and service justifies the cost. Overall, The Palace Grill is a great choice for anyone looking for a unique and satisfying dining experience in Santa Barbara.", "role": "training", "sealed_prompt_sha256": "sha256:8f242c919be2c47713a9018b756abea7e55f963dd385ec6ebb8476a2b4ba6988", "sealed_prompt_token_count": 878, "sentence_count": 3, "sentence_version": "carnot-utf8-sentence-v1", "source_group_id": "group-899e8db45427340dc41a9096", "source_sha256": "sha256:eed59a177401afdf432a41e1ce9fa975e60f71f10b563f35af0fec6daf9c20ba", "source_text": "{\"address\":\"8 E Cota St\",\"attributes\":{\"Ambience\":{\"casual\":true,\"classy\":true,\"divey\":false,\"hipster\":false,\"intimate\":false,\"romantic\":null,\"touristy\":null,\"trendy\":null,\"upscale\":false},\"BusinessParking\":{\"garage\":true,\"lot\":false,\"street\":true,\"valet\":false,\"validated\":false},\"Music\":null,\"OutdoorSeating\":true,\"RestaurantsGoodForGroups\":true,\"RestaurantsReservations\":true,\"Restau