and then announced to us that they were closing in FOUR MINUTES! She then proceeded to box up our food and hand us a bill. \\n\\nThere was another person besides our table, and that guy told the server he would be done soon but she started hustling him out too.\\n\\nFor the record the posted hours say they close at 10:00 PM. If some emergency came up, they should have warned us when we first came in. But there was no notice, no warning whatsoever. How can a business be run like that? Still smh.\\n\\nHey, owner, if you're reading this, I'd like an explanation please. You can't build a reputation on shoddy service, no matter how good your food is (it had become cold and soggy by the time we got home to \\\"enjoy\\\" it, so I can only rate you based on that quality and the terrible service we received).\"}],\"state\":\"CA\"}", "source_version": {"corpus": "ragtruth", "license": "MIT", "release_revision": "c103204b9ce28d6bbad859304bf30de72b8ed8fe"}, "state_reset": true, "token_boundary_receipts": {" A": true, " B": true}, "tokenize_s": 0.0020593630006260355, "tokenizer_identity": {"bos_token_id": "248044", "eos_token_id": "248046", "metadata_model": "gpt2", "representation": "embedded_gguf"}, "window_index": 0, "window_sha256": "sha256:0f9945a43adfa26a401c2fc59d332d61dfe06ee9f18b9daf6c4f785dbe738c08", "window_version": "carnot-balanced-contiguous-v1"}, {"actual_last_evaluated_position": 1134, "archived_pilot_reuse": false, "arm": "focused_window", "attempted": true, "byte_end": 839, "byte_start": 387, "call_id": "sha256:5564a0c15fe940e5431749df", "disposition": "complete", "eligible": true, "error": null, "generated_tokens": 0, "gold_label": null, "group_id": "group-95e8dbe64415434f50477184", "kv_state_id": "reset-epoch-809", "label_to_option_id": {" A": "contains_unsupported", " B": "supported"}, "log_odds_contains_unsupported": 4.58598518371582, "marked_response": "Sure! Here's an objective overview of Hanamura Cantonese Dim Sum based on the provided structured data:\