, 33037, 321, 4517, 13, 271, 55025, 198, 32, 25, 5435, 4748, 17675, 1892, 561, 1965, 5435, 39072, 2144, 13, 198, 33, 25, 7021, 1892, 561, 2400, 1965, 369, 7021, 539, 279, 16713, 2450, 13, 271, 5423, 1132, 279, 2904, 2306, 13, 198, 15666, 25], "raw_logits_by_display_label": {" A": 15.943719863891602, " B": 14.251879692077637}, "raw_logits_by_option_id": {"contains_unsupported": 15.943719863891602, "supported": 14.251879692077637}, "readout_s": 3.627799924288411e-05, "request_id": "sha256:9162eb8ec1b4d1f24bbd7ee6", "requested_score_position": 399, "response_sha256": "sha256:eb73e4c41b4f265ca30db4e0371c77868e6cc0c702b381d389d8680771f2895a", "response_text": "To eat a sweet baked potato, first split the baked sweet potatoes in half while they are still hot. Then, whip butter until fluffy and slowly pour in 1/2 cup of real maple syrup, while continuously whisking. Stir in 1/4 cup of chopped pecans into the mixture. Finally, pour this sweet butter and pecan mixture over the split sweet potatoes and enjoy.", "role": "training", "sealed_prompt_sha256": "sha256:9a88895076908f6bc632561ee900cd89fcca3529fbe23dfab0f1243a399d76ea", "sealed_prompt_token_count": 400, "sentence_count": null, "sentence_version": null, "source_group_id": "group-994dd56cfba6dea8c08fb377", "source_sha256": "sha256:1321ea12c461a3b0eda3efdb129e081cab28213294776668c976aebf3ccb6c18", "source_text": "{\"passages\":\"passage 1:Whip the butter with a whisk until it is fluffy. Slowly pour in 1/2 cup of real maple syrup, whipping the whole time you are pouring. When the syrup is completely mixed in with the butter, stir in 1/4 cup of chopped pecans. Split your baked sweet potatoes in half while they are still hot.\\n\\npassage 2:1 Don't preheat the oven. 2  Prick your sweet potatoes each 2-3 time with a fork, then place them directly on the oven rack in the middle of the oven, above the foil. 3  Turn the oven on to 425. 4  Bake for 45 minutes for sweet potatoes/yams that are 2-3 inches in diameter.\\n\\npassage 