o, told the newspaper. \"It's a first draft of the screenplay by John Hughes,\" Wallace said. The manuscript sports the approval signature of the district's then-superintendent and reveals that Molly Ringwald's character, Claire Standish, was originally to be named Cathy Douglas, according to the Tribune. The movie was filmed at the Maine North High School building, which was auctioned off by the district years ago and is now occupied by the Illinois State Police, according to the Tribune. The file was discovered at Maine South High School as district officials prepared to move to a newly acquired building next door. Wallace told the Tribune that he would like to find a way to display the script as a piece of film -- and district -- history. \"The odds of having such an iconic movie filmed and associated with your district are astronomical,\" he told the newspaper. \"The Breakfast Club\" returns to theaters 30 years later.\n", "source_version": {"corpus": "ragtruth", "license": "MIT", "release_revision": "c103204b9ce28d6bbad859304bf30de72b8ed8fe"}, "state_reset": true, "token_boundary_receipts": {" A": true, " B": true}, "tokenize_s": 0.001149271000031149, "tokenizer_identity": {"bos_token_id": "248044", "eos_token_id": "248046", "metadata_model": "gpt2", "representation": "embedded_gguf"}, "window_index": 0, "window_sha256": "sha256:38e99375b77b4d1d9952269b9afbee56b9cb3a6e256296de5fa9704d6762c856", "window_version": "carnot-balanced-contiguous-v1"}, {"actual_last_evaluated_position": 480, "archived_pilot_reuse": false, "arm": "focused_window", "attempted": true, "byte_end": 368, "byte_start": 222, "call_id": "sha256:86d173cc2064215139a65469", "disposition": "complete", "eligible": true, "error": null, "generated_tokens": 0, "gold_label": null, "group_id": "group-a88eb808bcc756ac840e3cde", "kv_state_id": "reset-epoch-901", "label_to_option_id": {" A": "supported", " B": "contains_unsupported"}, "log_odds_contains_unsupported": -2.9514245986938477, "marked_response":