ifornia. They are open from Tuesday to Sunday, with operating hours varying from 7 pm to 10 pm on weekdays and until 10 pm on weekends. The restaurant offers outdoor seating and takeout services. They also accept reservations for groups. Trattoria Vittoria has a rating of 4 stars on Google and has received several positive reviews. One customer praised the restaurant for their delicious homemade pasta dishes and the friendly service provided by the staff. Another customer enjoyed their meal and the atmosphere at the restaurant, while another appreciated the early dinner option and the opportunity to make reservations. Overall, Trattoria Vittoria seems to be a popular choice for Italian cuisine in Santa Barbara.", "role": "training", "sealed_prompt_sha256": "sha256:ab2c6d682d2961a5b0a5ca4478f1f31acda38e062c4b75a4f3fb1279dcb9bee4", "sealed_prompt_token_count": 706, "sentence_count": null, "sentence_version": null, "source_group_id": "group-b1e02f405b78049947bae584", "source_sha256": "sha256:92adbb0f5243fb4ce7c31ad3203a4ec7e6a0f808c5c21b2c176451f26f2e9bd8", "source_text": "{\"address\":\"30 E Victoria St\",\"attributes\":{\"Ambience\":{\"casual\":null,\"classy\":null,\"divey\":false,\"hipster\":false,\"intimate\":null,\"romantic\":null,\"touristy\":false,\"trendy\":false,\"upscale\":false},\"BusinessParking\":{\"garage\":null,\"lot\":false,\"street\":true,\"valet\":false,\"validated\":false},\"Music\":null,\"OutdoorSeating\":null,\"RestaurantsGoodForGroups\":true,\"RestaurantsReservations\":true,\"RestaurantsTakeOut\":true,\"WiFi\":\"no\"},\"business_stars\":4.0,\"categories\":\"Italian, Restaurants\",\"city\":\"Santa Barbara\",\"hours\":{\"Friday\":\"17:0-22:0\",\"Saturday\":\"17:0-22:0\",\"Sunday\":\"17:0-21:0\",\"Thursday\":\"17:0-21:0\",\"Tuesday\":\"17:0-21:0\",\"Wednesday\":\"17:0-21:0\"},\"name\":\"Trattoria Vittoria\",\"review_info\":[{\"review_date\":\"2022-01-09 04:55:39\",\"review_stars\":5.0,\"review_text\":\"Great italian food. came here on a whim and thor