enjoyed their meal and the atmosphere at the restaurant, while another appreciated the early dinner option and the opportunity to make reservations. Overall, Trattoria Vittoria seems to be a popular choice for Italian cuisine in Santa Barbara.", "role": "training", "sealed_prompt_sha256": "sha256:881b509903dd5ec96e0573055e181f87b2a38b6891f592a1403c368f20e0d4fc", "sealed_prompt_token_count": 728, "sentence_count": 2, "sentence_version": "carnot-utf8-sentence-v1", "source_group_id": "group-b1e02f405b78049947bae584", "source_sha256": "sha256:92adbb0f5243fb4ce7c31ad3203a4ec7e6a0f808c5c21b2c176451f26f2e9bd8", "source_text": "{\"address\":\"30 E Victoria St\",\"attributes\":{\"Ambience\":{\"casual\":null,\"classy\":null,\"divey\":false,\"hipster\":false,\"intimate\":null,\"romantic\":null,\"touristy\":false,\"trendy\":false,\"upscale\":false},\"BusinessParking\":{\"garage\":null,\"lot\":false,\"street\":true,\"valet\":false,\"validated\":false},\"Music\":null,\"OutdoorSeating\":null,\"RestaurantsGoodForGroups\":true,\"RestaurantsReservations\":true,\"RestaurantsTakeOut\":true,\"WiFi\":\"no\"},\"business_stars\":4.0,\"categories\":\"Italian, Restaurants\",\"city\":\"Santa Barbara\",\"hours\":{\"Friday\":\"17:0-22:0\",\"Saturday\":\"17:0-22:0\",\"Sunday\":\"17:0-21:0\",\"Thursday\":\"17:0-21:0\",\"Tuesday\":\"17:0-21:0\",\"Wednesday\":\"17:0-21:0\"},\"name\":\"Trattoria Vittoria\",\"review_info\":[{\"review_date\":\"2022-01-09 04:55:39\",\"review_stars\":5.0,\"review_text\":\"Great italian food. came here on a whim and thorough enjoyed it. will return next time i'm visiting santa barbara.\"},{\"review_date\":\"2021-12-11 08:50:25\",\"review_stars\":5.0,\"review_text\":\"Their homemade pasta dishes, lasagna, tortellini and ravioli with a heavenly tomato sauce was definitely one of the most delicious dishes I've tried (and then I've been to Italy). The servers where so funny and genuine, too. We'll be back in SB when we get the chance!\"},{\"review_date\":\"2021-12-08 17:23:35\",\"review_stars\":4.0,\"review_text\":\"We had an early dinner here. It filled up fast so if you can make reservations you should. \\n\\nWe had an awesome dinner. Atmosphere was perfect.  Wine was delicious and the service was great. \\n\\nNext time I will come early and have a drink at the bar. Looked like a fun crowd. Enjoy!\"}],\"state\":\"CA\"}", "source_version": {"corpus": "ragtruth", "license": "MIT", "release_revision": "c103204b9ce28d6bbad859304bf30de72b8ed8fe"}, "state_reset": true, "token_boundary_receipts": {" A": true, " B": true}, "tokenize_s": 0.001371663000099943, "tokenizer_identity": {"bos_token_id": "248044", "eos_token_id": "248046", "metadata_model": "gpt2", "representation": "embedded_gguf"}, "window_index": 2, "window_sha256": "sha256:283a466ee3193dbddba23b1349b710e09a595f55665d23d0876727494683ad55", "window_version": "carnot-balanced-contiguous-v1"}, {"actual_last_evaluated_position": 431, "archived_pilot_reuse": false, "arm": "whole_response", "attempted": true, "byte_end": null, "byte_start": null, "call_id": "sha256:39835fd53530f42200a71714", "disposition": "complete", "eligible": true, "error": null, "generated_tokens": 0, "gold_label": null, "group_id": "group-b3150118f42c60f5005f252f", "kv_state_id": "reset-epoch-977", "label_to_option_id": {" A": "supported", " B": "contains_unsupported"}, "log_odds_contains_unsupported": -1.0091495513916018, "marked_response": null, "model_sha256": "sha256:7e78da5d7e3ae28d178121f58646953305f3e5bd3cb46f4a75584e8b6c6fe169", "native_option_token_ids": {" A": 357, " B": 417}, "normalization": "two_option_softmax_float64", "option_order": ["supported", "contains_unsupported"], "order_remapping": {" A": "supported", " B": "contains_unsupported"}, "prefill_s": 0.5244666309999957, "probabilities_by_option_id": {"contains_unsupported": 0.2671463179021063, "supported": 0.7328536820978937}, "prompt_sha256": "sha256:efc3d510face48784efa1f893e6996e586ec02159108b348ed5d22aa9e8293df", "prompt_token_count": 432, "