at until fragrant, 3 to 5 minutes. 3  Whisk in vinegar, lime juice, a 1/4 cup of the sugar and salt. 4  Bring to a simmer and cook until sugar and salt have dissolved, 1 to 2 minutes.\\n\\npassage 3:1 Count to 10 then drain. 2  Add onions to glass jars or a bowl. 3  Toast cinnamon, cloves and the red pepper flakes in a small saucepan over medium heat until fragrant, 3 to 5 minutes. 4  Whisk in vinegar, lime juice, a 1/4 cup of the sugar and salt. 5  Bring to a simmer and cook until sugar and salt have dissolved, 1 to 2 minutes.\\n\\n\",\"question\":\"how do you pickle onions\"}", "source_version": {"corpus": "ragtruth", "license": "MIT", "release_revision": "c103204b9ce28d6bbad859304bf30de72b8ed8fe"}, "state_reset": true, "token_boundary_receipts": {" A": true, " B": true}, "tokenize_s": 0.0012772280006174697, "tokenizer_identity": {"bos_token_id": "248044", "eos_token_id": "248046", "metadata_model": "gpt2", "representation": "embedded_gguf"}, "window_index": null, "window_sha256": null, "window_version": null}, {"actual_last_evaluated_position": 564, "archived_pilot_reuse": false, "arm": "focused_window", "attempted": true, "byte_end": 248, "byte_start": 0, "call_id": "sha256:eebcdff868a5e46c37778192", "disposition": "complete", "eligible": true, "error": null, "generated_tokens": 0, "gold_label": null, "group_id": "group-c76b15b332d587a0ed7a1a2b", "kv_state_id": "reset-epoch-1074", "label_to_option_id": {" A": "supported", " B": "contains_unsupported"}, "log_odds_contains_unsupported": -0.49594306945800776, "marked_response": "<<CARNOT_FOCUS_START:0:248>>Based on the given passages, here is how you can pickle onions:\n\n1. Slice the onions and add them to a medium bowl.\n2. Pour boiling water over the onions to cover them, and count to 10 before draining.\n3. Add the onions to glass jars or a bowl.\n4. <<CARNOT_FOCUS_END>>Toast cinnamon, cloves, and red pepper flakes in a small saucepan over medium heat until fragrant (3-5 minutes).\n5. Whisk in vinegar, lime jui