are all better off for knowing Amanda.\"\nPEOPLE's request for a response was not immediately answered by the school or its district.\n\"There are hundreds if not thousands of lives she directly impacted,\" Rickson said to NBC station WTHR.\nAccording to Rickson, \"a lot of people are going to be feeling this loss,\"\nSource: people.com", "source_version": {"corpus": "ragtruth", "license": "MIT", "release_revision": "c103204b9ce28d6bbad859304bf30de72b8ed8fe"}, "state_reset": true, "token_boundary_receipts": {" A": true, " B": true}, "tokenize_s": 0.00195870500010642, "tokenizer_identity": {"bos_token_id": "248044", "eos_token_id": "248046", "metadata_model": "gpt2", "representation": "embedded_gguf"}, "window_index": 0, "window_sha256": "sha256:3a59310aa921babb1f3e45468049ecc31516056bcc43b0169ea51859fe1179dc", "window_version": "carnot-balanced-contiguous-v1"}, {"actual_last_evaluated_position": 597, "archived_pilot_reuse": false, "arm": "focused_window", "attempted": true, "byte_end": 311, "byte_start": 187, "call_id": "sha256:bb0e1b72b9ccc24aeeedb85a", "disposition": "complete", "eligible": true, "error": null, "generated_tokens": 0, "gold_label": null, "group_id": "group-d1a6b825fdbfadc28c37c076", "kv_state_id": "reset-epoch-1123", "label_to_option_id": {" A": "supported", " B": "contains_unsupported"}, "log_odds_contains_unsupported": 0.22684478759765625, "marked_response": "An unidentified body was found in a river in Puerto Rico, leading authorities to believe it may be that of Amanda Lynn Webster, an Indiana art teacher who went missing while on vacation. <<CARNOT_FOCUS_START:187:311>>Friends and family have confirmed that Webster, 44, was last seen on October 11 at a rental property where she was staying. <<CARNOT_FOCUS_END>>The cause of death is currently unknown, but friends have expressed their condolences and shared how much Webster touched their lives as a teacher and person.", "model_sha256": "sha256:7e78da5d7e3ae28d178121f58646953305f3e5bd3cb46f4a7558