t thousands of lives she directly impacted,\" Rickson said to NBC station WTHR.\nAccording to Rickson, \"a lot of people are going to be feeling this loss,\"\nSource: people.com", "source_version": {"corpus": "ragtruth", "license": "MIT", "release_revision": "c103204b9ce28d6bbad859304bf30de72b8ed8fe"}, "state_reset": true, "token_boundary_receipts": {" A": true, " B": true}, "tokenize_s": 0.0015337790000558016, "tokenizer_identity": {"bos_token_id": "248044", "eos_token_id": "248046", "metadata_model": "gpt2", "representation": "embedded_gguf"}, "window_index": 2, "window_sha256": "sha256:6ab3161a133c0b40a40475a08fb80463e519866f0a3ca35361eed13eda46b905", "window_version": "carnot-balanced-contiguous-v1"}, {"actual_last_evaluated_position": 575, "archived_pilot_reuse": false, "arm": "whole_response", "attempted": true, "byte_end": null, "byte_start": null, "call_id": "sha256:48ea90977b8ea89b11319dda", "disposition": "complete", "eligible": true, "error": null, "generated_tokens": 0, "gold_label": null, "group_id": "group-d1a6b825fdbfadc28c37c076", "kv_state_id": "reset-epoch-1125", "label_to_option_id": {" A": "contains_unsupported", " B": "supported"}, "log_odds_contains_unsupported": 2.1563072204589844, "marked_response": null, "model_sha256": "sha256:7e78da5d7e3ae28d178121f58646953305f3e5bd3cb46f4a75584e8b6c6fe169", "native_option_token_ids": {" A": 357, " B": 417}, "normalization": "two_option_softmax_float64", "option_order": ["contains_unsupported", "supported"], "order_remapping": {" A": "contains_unsupported", " B": "supported"}, "prefill_s": 0.6915430060007566, "probabilities_by_option_id": {"contains_unsupported": 0.8962566936487381, "supported": 0.10374330635126189}, "prompt_sha256": "sha256:ac4b5d162fff8527bca597ab20f15adf7ecb8d09bf724813e1be34f08731a952", "prompt_token_count": 576, "prompt_token_ids": [1890, 1386, 1761, 364, 279, 4434, 1965, 1608, 1132, 279, 16713, 2450, 13, 271, 41578, 198, 85695, 5001, 28120, 10166, 12345, 3195, 5788, 383, 66810, 11658