ung and the Restless spoilers say that Jack opposes Ashley's plan. He doesn't want his sister anywhere near Tucker, as he is unpredictable and unstable. Ashley informs Jack that she's not asking; she's telling him her plan. She can handle Tucker as long as she can earn his trust.\nAshley shares that Tucker is why she's back. He called her and asked to reunite. She agreed to talk to him about it. She believes this is their best shot at defeating him and protecting their father's legacy.\nMeanwhile, at Audra Charles' (Zuleyka Silver) suite, Tucker asks her if she's managed to bring Kyle Abbott (Michael Mealor) into the fold. She confirms Kyle is on board with the idea and will help them get control of Jabot.\nThe Young and the Restless spoilers say Kyle wants to succeed at Jabot. He doesn't believe his father will ever give him a chance at the top spot. He agrees to work with Audra and Tucker, only to take his family's company from Jack's grasp.\nY&R fans, do you think Ashley is working with Tucker? Do you think Jack will discover Kyle's betrayal? Keep watching The Young and the Restless, airing weekdays on CBS and streaming on Paramount Plus. Please share your thoughts with me in the comments section below. Remember to follow me to read more of my content.", "source_version": {"corpus": "ragtruth", "license": "MIT", "release_revision": "c103204b9ce28d6bbad859304bf30de72b8ed8fe"}, "state_reset": true, "token_boundary_receipts": {" A": true, " B": true}, "tokenize_s": 0.0014243850000639213, "tokenizer_identity": {"bos_token_id": "248044", "eos_token_id": "248046", "metadata_model": "gpt2", "representation": "embedded_gguf"}, "window_index": 2, "window_sha256": "sha256:6eebd1d90d079f7a96bb17c4429125d49d8d9df838aeef8227a77c566a1564d3", "window_version": "carnot-balanced-contiguous-v1"}, {"actual_last_evaluated_position": 691, "archived_pilot_reuse": false, "arm": "whole_response", "attempted": true, "byte_end": null, "byte_start": null, "call_id": "sha256:adae3d9089b193c