tions belonged to the same victim, identified Monday as Jonathan Camilien, 26. Camilien and Colina knew each other, according to authorities. \"This was a gruesome discovery,\" District Attorney Marian Ryan said. CNN's Kevin Conlon contributed to this report.\n", "source_version": {"corpus": "ragtruth", "license": "MIT", "release_revision": "c103204b9ce28d6bbad859304bf30de72b8ed8fe"}, "state_reset": true, "token_boundary_receipts": {" A": true, " B": true}, "tokenize_s": 0.0010539520008023828, "tokenizer_identity": {"bos_token_id": "248044", "eos_token_id": "248046", "metadata_model": "gpt2", "representation": "embedded_gguf"}, "window_index": 0, "window_sha256": "sha256:9d70fffcc50fd6276abd47d80afea4294b0437c198d4aa7ba1a11f8bbcecca21", "window_version": "carnot-balanced-contiguous-v1"}, {"actual_last_evaluated_position": 422, "archived_pilot_reuse": false, "arm": "focused_window", "attempted": true, "byte_end": 237, "byte_start": 122, "call_id": "sha256:dc95b7ca5d4ca6722fc5065e", "disposition": "complete", "eligible": true, "error": null, "generated_tokens": 0, "gold_label": null, "group_id": "group-d32b4859632f5ddaa9646ee8", "kv_state_id": "reset-epoch-1159", "label_to_option_id": {" A": "contains_unsupported", " B": "supported"}, "log_odds_contains_unsupported": -1.0414466857910158, "marked_response": "Carlos Colina, 32, is facing murder charges after a man's remains were found in a duffel bag in Cambridge, Massachusetts. <<CARNOT_FOCUS_START:122:237>>Colina was earlier charged with assault and battery causing serious bodily injury and improper disposal of a body. <<CARNOT_FOCUS_END>>The victim was identified as 26-year-old Jonathan Camilien, who Colina reportedly knew.", "model_sha256": "sha256:7e78da5d7e3ae28d178121f58646953305f3e5bd3cb46f4a75584e8b6c6fe169", "native_option_token_ids": {" A": 357, " B": 417}, "normalization": "two_option_softmax_float64", "option_order": ["contains_unsupported", "supported"], "order_remapping": {" A": "contains_unsupported", " 