s no information provided about the presence of music or specific ambience features.\n\nOverall, El Sitio is a Mexican restaurant in Goleta that offers affordable and tasty food. While there have been mixed reviews, many customers appreciate the value they receive for their Mexican food purchases at El Sitio.", "role": "training", "sealed_prompt_sha256": "sha256:538680e2491b71e26bdc3b25de55e70eb4b770d72a83ad73fa06e16d23e1930a", "sealed_prompt_token_count": 784, "sentence_count": null, "sentence_version": null, "source_group_id": "group-d8bbcf979a89c23c4c8894c2", "source_sha256": "sha256:da1101b188a9223405170891d0a7338e74d6c917b1e13cc388e74b56f9da1952", "source_text": "{\"address\":\"102 S Fairview Ave\",\"attributes\":{\"Ambience\":{\"casual\":true,\"classy\":false,\"divey\":null,\"hipster\":false,\"intimate\":false,\"romantic\":false,\"touristy\":false,\"trendy\":false,\"upscale\":false},\"BusinessParking\":{\"garage\":false,\"lot\":true,\"street\":false,\"valet\":false,\"validated\":false},\"Music\":null,\"OutdoorSeating\":false,\"RestaurantsGoodForGroups\":true,\"RestaurantsReservations\":false,\"RestaurantsTakeOut\":true,\"WiFi\":\"no\"},\"business_stars\":3.5,\"categories\":\"Restaurants, Mexican\",\"city\":\"Goleta\",\"hours\":{\"Friday\":\"8:0-20:30\",\"Monday\":\"8:0-20:30\",\"Saturday\":\"8:0-20:30\",\"Sunday\":\"8:0-15:30\",\"Thursday\":\"8:0-20:30\",\"Tuesday\":\"8:0-20:30\",\"Wednesday\":\"8:0-20:30\"},\"name\":\"El Sitio\",\"review_info\":[{\"review_date\":\"2021-10-24 21:46:12\",\"review_stars\":5.0,\"review_text\":\"Bomb and cheap. El Sitio over Super Cucas over Freebirds. Quesaritto is so good and their green salsa is prime. El Sitio supremacy.\"},{\"review_date\":\"2021-07-30 23:15:46\",\"review_stars\":1.0,\"review_text\":\"Better off going to Taco Bell. $15 for a quesadilla with no cheese, soggy tortilla and stale chips. Daylight robbery\"},{\"review_date\":\"2021-05-05 03:42:42\",\"review_stars\":5.0,\"review_text\":\"This is possibly the best value in the entire area for your Mexican food dollar. We love the #1, #12...and usually get rajas tacos to spread them around! Tonight we went with the shrimp- Brocheta y Quesadilla de Cameron and were blown away. VIVA EL SITIO!\"}],\"state\":\"CA\"}", "source_version": {"corpus": "ragtruth", "license": "MIT", "release_revision": "c103204b9ce28d6bbad859304bf30de72b8ed8fe"}, "state_reset": true, "token_boundary_receipts": {" A": true, " B": true}, "tokenize_s": 0.001417933999618981, "tokenizer_identity": {"bos_token_id": "248044", "eos_token_id": "248046", "metadata_model": "gpt2", "representation": "embedded_gguf"}, "window_index": null, "window_sha256": null, "window_version": null}, {"actual_last_evaluated_position": 803, "archived_pilot_reuse": false, "arm": "focused_window", "attempted": true, "byte_end": 417, "byte_start": 0, "call_id": "sha256:ed0fca87ed20e29dee2eabd8", "disposition": "complete", "eligible": true, "error": null, "generated_tokens": 0, "gold_label": null, "group_id": "group-d8bbcf979a89c23c4c8894c2", "kv_state_id": "reset-epoch-1170", "label_to_option_id": {" A": "supported", " B": "contains_unsupported"}, "log_odds_contains_unsupported": 0.7050743103027344, "marked_response": "<<CARNOT_FOCUS_START:0:417>>El Sitio is a Mexican restaurant located at 102 S Fairview Ave in Goleta, CA. The restaurant has a 3.5-star rating based on customer reviews. Customers have mentioned that El Sitio offers affordable and delicious food. One customer specifically mentioned enjoying the Quesaritto and the green salsa. Another customer, however, had a negative experience, stating that their quesadilla was overpriced and poorly made.\n\n<<CARNOT_FOCUS_END>>El Sitio is open from 8:00 AM to 8:30 PM from Monday to Friday and from 8:00 AM to 3:30 PM on Sundays. The restaurant does not offer outdoor seating or WiFi, but it does provide takeout services and is suitable for groups. The ambience of the restaurant is described as casual.\n\nBased on the structured data, it c