972168}, "readout_s": 4.423299924383173e-05, "request_id": "sha256:22310c00a2e4626d0c40c14a", "requested_score_position": 520, "response_sha256": "sha256:8b12280976940b461136ad139df18d20a4c8ab973d03c00b383ce7a8cebcb115", "response_text": "Based on the provided passages, here is how you can automatically send out a text message to alert you of an event that you have signed up for:\n\n1. Open the Ohdontforget app on your device.\n2. Tap on \"Add\" at the bottom of the SMS Scheduler screen to create a new automatic text message (passage 2).\n3. Enter the message you want to send, the phone number of the recipient(s), and the desired send date and time (passages 1 and 2).\n4. Tap \"OK\" or press the \"Back\" button on your smartphone to save the details (passage 3).\n5. The SMS message will be sent using a background service, so you won't need to keep the program running (passage 2).\n\nTherefore, to automatically send out a text message to alert you of an event that you have signed up for using Ohdontforget, follow the steps outlined above.", "role": "training", "sealed_prompt_sha256": "sha256:38e24bdd1fec223db7f4c3b8b65c805e49c0336c53eef4f8a5f6979b2fe14ce7", "sealed_prompt_token_count": 521, "sentence_count": null, "sentence_version": null, "source_group_id": "group-d9bacdf81130a01428c714c4", "source_sha256": "sha256:f08ab5546d5950a6281ebfcb590f0bd54641cfd47953e2e9b0bd243933e8a559", "source_text": "{\"passages\":\"passage 1:Hi, I'm a reminder scheduled with Ohdontforget! It's simple. You can send a message now or schedule it for a later date, to one person or many at once. You can have it repeat every week, month or year - or every second Tuesday or third day of the month if you\u2019d like.\\n\\npassage 2:Tap \u201cAdd\u201d at the bottom of the SMS Scheduler screen to create a new automatic text message. Tap \u201cSchedule\u201d if you're using Auto SMS or, if you're using Tasker, tap \u201cPhone\u201d and then \u201cSend SMS.\u201d You will go to a page where you can enter the message, cell number and the time you would like to send the message.\\n\\npassage 3:Tap the \u201cphone number\u201d text field, and enter the number. Tap the \u201cmessage date\u201d and enter the month, day and time to send the message. 4. Tap \u201cOK\u201d or press the \u201cBack\u201d button on your smartphone to save the details. The SMS message will be sent using a background service, so you won't need to keep the program running.\\n\\n\",\"question\":\"how to automatically send out text message to alert you of an event that you signed up for\"}", "source_version": {"corpus": "ragtruth", "license": "MIT", "release_revision": "c103204b9ce28d6bbad859304bf30de72b8ed8fe"}, "state_reset": true, "token_boundary_receipts": {" A": true, " B": true}, "tokenize_s": 0.0016854450004757382, "tokenizer_identity": {"bos_token_id": "248044", "eos_token_id": "248046", "metadata_model": "gpt2", "representation": "embedded_gguf"}, "window_index": null, "window_sha256": null, "window_version": null}, {"actual_last_evaluated_position": 540, "archived_pilot_reuse": false, "arm": "focused_window", "attempted": true, "byte_end": 300, "byte_start": 0, "call_id": "sha256:7d570bf19a2b9cfc5c9cabe5", "disposition": "complete", "eligible": true, "error": null, "generated_tokens": 0, "gold_label": null, "group_id": "group-d9bacdf81130a01428c714c4", "kv_state_id": "reset-epoch-1202", "label_to_option_id": {" A": "supported", " B": "contains_unsupported"}, "log_odds_contains_unsupported": 1.8209877014160156, "marked_response": "<<CARNOT_FOCUS_START:0:300>>Based on the provided passages, here is how you can automatically send out a text message to alert you of an event that you have signed up for:\n\n1. Open the Ohdontforget app on your device.\n2. Tap on \"Add\" at the bottom of the SMS Scheduler screen to create a new automatic text message (passage 2).\n<<CARNOT_FOCUS_END>>3. Enter the message you want to send, the phone number of the recipient(s), and the desired send date a