matized the family. \"When I saw that video for the first time, my family was deeply hurt that someone would gun down a human being in that way,\" the brother said. \"We just couldn't believe it.\" The last time the family got together with Walter Scott was when the siblings threw a surprise wedding anniversary party for their parents. \"It was a great celebration,\" Anthony Scott said. \"My dad and brothers planned it, and (my mother) was totally surprised. \"Now this happens,\" Scott said, referring to his brother's shooting. \"It's so tragic.\" CNN's Greg Botelho contributed to this report.\n", "source_version": {"corpus": "ragtruth", "license": "MIT", "release_revision": "c103204b9ce28d6bbad859304bf30de72b8ed8fe"}, "state_reset": true, "token_boundary_receipts": {" A": true, " B": true}, "tokenize_s": 0.0015166789999057073, "tokenizer_identity": {"bos_token_id": "248044", "eos_token_id": "248046", "metadata_model": "gpt2", "representation": "embedded_gguf"}, "window_index": 1, "window_sha256": "sha256:e1519fd2ce2415bb767de4258510c1eddcaefd5135b060fc0f196cc4c284c8c9", "window_version": "carnot-balanced-contiguous-v1"}, {"actual_last_evaluated_position": 727, "archived_pilot_reuse": false, "arm": "focused_window", "attempted": true, "byte_end": 475, "byte_start": 295, "call_id": "sha256:50a98813e363bedcb5020be9", "disposition": "complete", "eligible": true, "error": null, "generated_tokens": 0, "gold_label": null, "group_id": "group-df9874c31fb1b93094a95f11", "kv_state_id": "reset-epoch-1240", "label_to_option_id": {" A": "contains_unsupported", " B": "supported"}, "log_odds_contains_unsupported": 1.6732444763183594, "marked_response": "Here is a summary of the article in 107 words:\n\nWalter Scott, a 50-year-old man who was killed by a South Carolina police officer, was a loving father of four and a veteran of the Coast Guard. He was stopped by police for a faulty brake light and ran from the officer, who shot him eight times. <<CARNOT_FOCUS_START:295:475>>The fa