es eggs live through winter\"}", "source_version": {"corpus": "ragtruth", "license": "MIT", "release_revision": "c103204b9ce28d6bbad859304bf30de72b8ed8fe"}, "state_reset": true, "token_boundary_receipts": {" A": true, " B": true}, "tokenize_s": 0.0008941339992816211, "tokenizer_identity": {"bos_token_id": "248044", "eos_token_id": "248046", "metadata_model": "gpt2", "representation": "embedded_gguf"}, "window_index": 0, "window_sha256": "sha256:49d0f30b94820223d5a72c40840bb922c30713dab4e18e65247baac1e468669d", "window_version": "carnot-balanced-contiguous-v1"}, {"actual_last_evaluated_position": 386, "archived_pilot_reuse": false, "arm": "focused_window", "attempted": true, "byte_end": 247, "byte_start": 110, "call_id": "sha256:a6063e4bd746763b39b25fd2", "disposition": "complete", "eligible": true, "error": null, "generated_tokens": 0, "gold_label": null, "group_id": "group-e109feadea1d5d5f19b30a87", "kv_state_id": "reset-epoch-1251", "label_to_option_id": {" A": "supported", " B": "contains_unsupported"}, "log_odds_contains_unsupported": 0.6332292556762694, "marked_response": "Butterflies do not lay their eggs in the winter because the eggs would not survive the freezing temperatures. <<CARNOT_FOCUS_START:110:247>>Some species of butterflies can enter a state called diapause during which they slow down their metabolism and can freeze without dying. <<CARNOT_FOCUS_END>>However, most butterflies either spend the winter as caterpillars or pupas.", "model_sha256": "sha256:7e78da5d7e3ae28d178121f58646953305f3e5bd3cb46f4a75584e8b6c6fe169", "native_option_token_ids": {" A": 357, " B": 417}, "normalization": "two_option_softmax_float64", "option_order": ["supported", "contains_unsupported"], "order_remapping": {" A": "supported", " B": "contains_unsupported"}, "prefill_s": 0.4968124489996626, "probabilities_by_option_id": {"contains_unsupported": 0.6532213250876787, "supported": 0.3467786749123212}, "prompt_sha256": "sha256:33dd0d250aace4ae724bc1c0cb5120b8649f115f46bdd5ff0