 has good ambiance and is suitable for groups. The business offers free Wi-Fi and valet parking is not available. Customers have left mixed reviews about the restaurant. Some customers have praised the food, particularly the sopes and salsa, while others have criticized the quality of the food, specifically the aguachiles. Overall, the restaurant appears to be a decent option for those looking for authentic Mexican food in Goleta.", "role": "training", "sealed_prompt_sha256": "sha256:7654c66e728dc642e2c001b68b10f2d44b551030bb0a53d7777b3fee3e46b626", "sealed_prompt_token_count": 709, "sentence_count": null, "sentence_version": null, "source_group_id": "group-e2923173b920ba3e8a77c5c4", "source_sha256": "sha256:f2150603f2314a6b70cde4e8b4f348cab1aed99aecb8f562d8b8e4fb5a058ca8", "source_text": "{\"address\":\"298 Pine Ave\",\"attributes\":{\"Ambience\":{\"casual\":true,\"classy\":false,\"divey\":false,\"hipster\":false,\"intimate\":false,\"romantic\":false,\"touristy\":false,\"trendy\":false,\"upscale\":false},\"BusinessParking\":{\"garage\":false,\"lot\":true,\"street\":false,\"valet\":false,\"validated\":false},\"Music\":null,\"OutdoorSeating\":true,\"RestaurantsGoodForGroups\":true,\"RestaurantsReservations\":true,\"RestaurantsTakeOut\":true,\"WiFi\":\"free\"},\"business_stars\":4.0,\"categories\":\"Restaurants, Mexican\",\"city\":\"Goleta\",\"hours\":{\"Friday\":\"11:0-22:0\",\"Monday\":\"11:0-21:0\",\"Saturday\":\"9:0-21:0\",\"Sunday\":\"9:0-21:0\",\"Thursday\":\"11:0-21:0\",\"Tuesday\":\"11:0-21:0\",\"Wednesday\":\"11:0-21:0\"},\"name\":\"La Hacienda\",\"review_info\":[{\"review_date\":\"2016-05-16 06:05:32\",\"review_stars\":3.0,\"review_text\":\"This place has good mexican food ive tried their sopes and their great last time i went i ordered aguachiles and it was horrible I recommend this place although dont order aguachiles\"},{\"review_date\":\"2016-02-02 22:30:44\",\"review_stars\":4.0,\"review_text\":\"I've enjoyed a good mexican meal and margarita here. The 