 restaurant. Some customers have praised the food, particularly the sopes and salsa, while others have criticized the quality of the food, specifically the aguachiles. Overall, the restaurant appears to be a decent option for those looking for authentic Mexican food in Goleta.", "role": "training", "sealed_prompt_sha256": "sha256:dae27d6e809b762617a8a8935936a89cdd3a589f03609eb43ed73cc0c8448daa", "sealed_prompt_token_count": 709, "sentence_count": null, "sentence_version": null, "source_group_id": "group-e2923173b920ba3e8a77c5c4", "source_sha256": "sha256:f2150603f2314a6b70cde4e8b4f348cab1aed99aecb8f562d8b8e4fb5a058ca8", "source_text": "{\"address\":\"298 Pine Ave\",\"attributes\":{\"Ambience\":{\"casual\":true,\"classy\":false,\"divey\":false,\"hipster\":false,\"intimate\":false,\"romantic\":false,\"touristy\":false,\"trendy\":false,\"upscale\":false},\"BusinessParking\":{\"garage\":false,\"lot\":true,\"street\":false,\"valet\":false,\"validated\":false},\"Music\":null,\"OutdoorSeating\":true,\"RestaurantsGoodForGroups\":true,\"RestaurantsReservations\":true,\"RestaurantsTakeOut\":true,\"WiFi\":\"free\"},\"business_stars\":4.0,\"categories\":\"Restaurants, Mexican\",\"city\":\"Goleta\",\"hours\":{\"Friday\":\"11:0-22:0\",\"Monday\":\"11:0-21:0\",\"Saturday\":\"9:0-21:0\",\"Sunday\":\"9:0-21:0\",\"Thursday\":\"11:0-21:0\",\"Tuesday\":\"11:0-21:0\",\"Wednesday\":\"11:0-21:0\"},\"name\":\"La Hacienda\",\"review_info\":[{\"review_date\":\"2016-05-16 06:05:32\",\"review_stars\":3.0,\"review_text\":\"This place has good mexican food ive tried their sopes and their great last time i went i ordered aguachiles and it was horrible I recommend this place although dont order aguachiles\"},{\"review_date\":\"2016-02-02 22:30:44\",\"review_stars\":4.0,\"review_text\":\"I've enjoyed a good mexican meal and margarita here. The place was hopping on a Saturday evening with Karaoke for the Goleta locals. I brought my daughter and she was able to sing, too. Brian has a great selection 