 are reasonable. However, some customers have had negative experiences with the restaurant, complaining about the quality of the food and service. Overall, Taqueria El Pastorcito appears to be a popular and affordable option for Mexican cuisine in Santa Barbara, but may vary depending on individual preferences and experiences.", "role": "training", "sealed_prompt_sha256": "sha256:5ee9e9bbcf717fc18f69e7e79abab0cd355da907e9deec94ec850f863acb97ce", "sealed_prompt_token_count": 715, "sentence_count": null, "sentence_version": null, "source_group_id": "group-e4ecba57253902feef36cac8", "source_sha256": "sha256:4f160ebe72503f425b0881d24f754889df8ba65dc9b7eb3443ad7ed3e8604e8a", "source_text": "{\"address\":\"2009 De La Vina St\",\"attributes\":{\"Ambience\":{\"casual\":false,\"classy\":false,\"divey\":true,\"hipster\":false,\"intimate\":false,\"romantic\":false,\"touristy\":false,\"trendy\":false,\"upscale\":false},\"BusinessParking\":{\"garage\":false,\"lot\":true,\"street\":true,\"valet\":false,\"validated\":false},\"Music\":null,\"OutdoorSeating\":true,\"RestaurantsGoodForGroups\":true,\"RestaurantsReservations\":false,\"RestaurantsTakeOut\":true,\"WiFi\":\"no\"},\"business_stars\":4.0,\"categories\":\"Mexican, Food, Restaurants\",\"city\":\"Santa Barbara\",\"hours\":{\"Friday\":\"10:0-22:0\",\"Monday\":\"10:0-21:0\",\"Saturday\":\"10:0-22:0\",\"Thursday\":\"10:0-22:0\",\"Tuesday\":\"10:0-21:0\",\"Wednesday\":\"10:0-21:0\"},\"name\":\"Taqueria El Pastorcito\",\"review_info\":[{\"review_date\":\"2016-04-25 05:55:08\",\"review_stars\":5.0,\"review_text\":\"It's an average priced taco place in this high priced town! I live right around the corner and constantly find myself craving their amazing carne asada tacos. Probably the best tacos in Santa Barbara.\"},{\"review_date\":\"2016-03-15 05:11:38\",\"review_stars\":5.0,\"review_text\":\"This is for their Noleta location.Muy delicioso.The people were friendly,the homemade tortillas  were fresh and on the thicker side with a good texture.I got the vegetarian alambres and a side of beans and a burrito.It all had good flavor .The salsas were tasty and am I super excited that they are there.\"},{\"review_date\":\"2016-03-09 23:42:56\",\"review_stars\":1.0,\"review_text\":\"Let's start by saying no one mexican was in here. If a Mexican came here they would say,\\\"cagada.\\\" Not once but eight times did I believe this. Horrible tortillas, and beans were from a can. Last but not least they gave me food poisoning.\"}],\"state\":\"CA\"}", "source_version": {"corpus": "ragtruth", "license": "MIT", "release_revision": "c103204b9ce28d6bbad859304bf30de72b8ed8fe"}, "state_reset": true, "token_boundary_receipts": {" A": true, " B": true}, "tokenize_s": 0.0013941710003564367, "tokenizer_identity": {"bos_token_id": "248044", "eos_token_id": "248046", "metadata_model": "gpt2", "representation": "embedded_gguf"}, "window_index": null, "window_sha256": null, "window_version": null}, {"actual_last_evaluated_position": 734, "archived_pilot_reuse": false, "arm": "focused_window", "attempted": true, "byte_end": 194, "byte_start": 0, "call_id": "sha256:abb456d8d8f0cdfd135f2d69", "disposition": "complete", "eligible": true, "error": null, "generated_tokens": 0, "gold_label": null, "group_id": "group-e4ecba57253902feef36cac8", "kv_state_id": "reset-epoch-1266", "label_to_option_id": {" A": "supported", " B": "contains_unsupported"}, "log_odds_contains_unsupported": 1.3864994049072268, "marked_response": "<<CARNOT_FOCUS_START:0:194>>Taqueria El Pastorcito is a Mexican restaurant located at 2009 De La Vina St in Santa Barbara, CA. They offer a variety of Mexican dishes, including tacos, and are open from Monday to Saturday. <<CARNOT_FOCUS_END>>The restaurant has outdoor seating and takeout options. Customers have praised the quality of the carne asada tacos and the freshness of the homemade tortillas. Some reviews also mention that the staff is friendly and the prices are reasonable. However, some customers have 