 unpleasant taste of the water.\n\nOverall, Petrini's Restaurant has received an average rating of 3.0 stars. While some customers have had positive experiences with the food and atmosphere, others have been disappointed with the quality and price.", "model_sha256": "sha256:7e78da5d7e3ae28d178121f58646953305f3e5bd3cb46f4a75584e8b6c6fe169", "native_option_token_ids": {" A": 357, " B": 417}, "normalization": "two_option_softmax_float64", "option_order": ["contains_unsupported", "supported"], "order_remapping": {" A": "contains_unsupported", " B": "supported"}, "prefill_s": 1.4429194169997572, "probabilities_by_option_id": {"contains_unsupported": 0.3519918399176665, "supported": 0.6480081600823334}, "prompt_sha256": "sha256:d94489f767cdfb75282c4de6df625d34488a8dad1b663d0740f5a1c63ce4e1fc", "prompt_token_count": 1212, "prompt_token_ids": [1890, 1386, 1761, 364, 279, 4434, 1965, 1608, 1132, 279, 16713, 2450, 13, 271, 41578, 198, 4754, 4834, 3147, 20, 22, 16, 16, 188471, 8535, 2129, 11987, 21624, 52218, 1772, 21624, 23543, 899, 763, 1802, 1288, 1005, 88, 763, 3721, 1288, 67, 520, 88, 763, 3721, 1288, 92670, 763, 3721, 1288, 390, 3316, 763, 3721, 1288, 433, 7902, 763, 3721, 1288, 49612, 84507, 763, 3721, 1288, 237419, 88, 763, 3721, 1288, 8339, 2174, 763, 3721, 49471, 22020, 91061, 21624, 11816, 416, 763, 3721, 1288, 8911, 763, 1802, 1288, 26466, 763, 3721, 1288, 6378, 1112, 763, 3721, 1288, 57576, 763, 3721, 49471, 23373, 763, 2827, 1288, 95130, 1460, 1060, 763, 1802, 1288, 12060, 32858, 14773, 2381, 21485, 763, 1802, 1288, 12060, 32858, 1026, 44294, 763, 1802, 1288, 12060, 32858, 17283, 2575, 763, 1802, 1288, 92247, 3147, 10279, 56658, 25316, 1217, 1506, 763, 18, 13, 15, 1288, 15042, 3147, 27490, 318, 3446, 681, 14382, 11, 56143, 11, 33665, 2129, 8656, 3147, 10533, 46544, 2129, 29393, 21624, 33475, 3147, 16, 21, 25, 18, 15, 12, 17, 16, 25, 18, 15, 2129, 34072, 3147, 16, 21, 25, 18, 15, 12, 17, 16, 25, 15, 2129, 32558, 3147, 16, 21, 25, 18, 15, 12, 17, 16, 25, 15, 2129, 