16.506370544433594, "supported": 10.61664867401123}, "readout_s": 3.254100010963157e-05, "request_id": "sha256:fe7b0b3f865c550cac0d6401", "requested_score_position": 795, "response_sha256": "sha256:ab86d6ec74c297f0895e2fc4fe4b3cfe9c81351487dc54e03c5c3593fc91ddd4", "response_text": "Located in the heart of Santa Barbara, Corner Tap Room is a popular gathering spot that offers a diverse selection of delicious food and drinks. With its cozy atmosphere and friendly staff, this establishment is perfect for a night out with friends or a romantic evening. The menu features a variety of mouth-watering options, including their famous Teriyaki Sliders and tasty flatbreads. Beer enthusiasts will appreciate the extensive selection of craft beers available, while those looking for a lighter option can enjoy a refreshing cocktail or glass of wine. Outdoor seating is also available, providing the perfect spot to relax and enjoy the surrounding scenery.\n\nCorner Tap Room is well-known for its exceptional service, with friendly and attentive staff always ready to assist with any need. The atmosphere is inviting and welcoming, making it an excellent choice for groups or special occasions. While the prices may be a bit steep for some, the quality of the food and drinks more than makes up for it. Overall, Corner Tap Room is an excellent choice for anyone looking for a great dining experience in Santa Barbara.", "role": "training", "sealed_prompt_sha256": "sha256:24ba51ca6c3dac9ef4e76aa86b83c35f99ce74ecdd27e520709c60eed1e2c6ee", "sealed_prompt_token_count": 796, "sentence_count": null, "sentence_version": null, "source_group_id": "group-e93f8befd7a0818b79230bba", "source_sha256": "sha256:b4ac629bcb1d5b8132011942543876956b288f0435d0cbc11e2b17c69fc9429c", "source_text": "{\"address\":\"1905 Cliff Dr\",\"attributes\":{\"Ambience\":null,\"BusinessParking\":{\"garage\":false,\"lot\":true,\"street\":false,\"valet\":false,\"validated\":false},\"Music\":null,\"OutdoorSeating\":true,\"Restauran