oes not charge an upcharge for non-dairy milk, which is a popular feature among those who are lactose intolerant or prefer not to contribute to the dairy industry. However, some customers have had negative experiences with the restaurant, including long wait times and poor customer service. One customer reported finding a hair in their pastries, which was disappointing. Overall, Goleta Coffee Co and Loca Vivant Kitchen appears to be a popular and convenient option for those looking for plant-based, vegan, and gluten-free meals, as well as coffee and tea.", "role": "training", "sealed_prompt_sha256": "sha256:27b59fda586469516c184633943d064f3b4bb73800ea6edf11e6e96d337ac339", "sealed_prompt_token_count": 1125, "sentence_count": 3, "sentence_version": "carnot-utf8-sentence-v1", "source_group_id": "group-ed91216e725220f112506ebb", "source_sha256": "sha256:569394cfe571cb7883e10c2b094db5fd295dfd447d710b6d6dd52e96a1e1c9f2", "source_text": "{\"address\":\"177 S Turnpike Rd\",\"attributes\":{\"Ambience\":{\"casual\":true,\"classy\":false,\"divey\":false,\"hipster\":false,\"intimate\":false,\"romantic\":false,\"touristy\":false,\"trendy\":false,\"upscale\":false},\"BusinessParking\":{\"garage\":false,\"lot\":true,\"street\":false,\"valet\":false,\"validated\":false},\"Music\":null,\"OutdoorSeating\":true,\"RestaurantsGoodForGroups\":true,\"RestaurantsReservations\":false,\"RestaurantsTakeOut\":true,\"WiFi\":\"free\"},\"business_stars\":4.0,\"categories\":\"Restaurants, Coffee & Tea, Breakfast & Brunch, Gluten-Free, Food, Sandwiches, Bagels\",\"city\":\"Santa Barbara\",\"hours\":{\"Friday\":\"7:0-15:0\",\"Monday\":\"0:0-0:0\",\"Saturday\":\"7:0-15:0\",\"Sunday\":\"7:0-15:0\",\"Thursday\":\"7:0-13:0\",\"Tuesday\":\"7:0-15:0\",\"Wednesday\":\"7:0-15:0\"},\"name\":\"Goleta Coffee Co and Loca Vivant Kitchen\",\"review_info\":[{\"review_date\":\"2022-01-09 17:45:28\",\"review_stars\":5.0,\"review_text\":\"Warm inviting locals cafe.  Especially great if you want plant-based, vegan, g