ely good for health including vitamins A, C, folic acid, fiber and calcium. This cruciferous vegetable has also become popular because of its ability to offer the following health benefits: 1. Prevents cancer. Broccoli is rich in glucoraphanin which can be processed by the human body into a kind of compound capable of preventing cancer.\\n\\npassage 3:The vegetable is also rich in indole-3-carbinol which is an extremely powerful antioxidant. Anti-carcinogen properties are also present in broccoli and these are effective in hindering the development of prostate, cervical and breast cancer while also improving liver health. 2.\\n\\n\",\"question\":\"benefits of broccoli\"}", "source_version": {"corpus": "ragtruth", "license": "MIT", "release_revision": "c103204b9ce28d6bbad859304bf30de72b8ed8fe"}, "state_reset": true, "token_boundary_receipts": {" A": true, " B": true}, "tokenize_s": 0.0010635529997671256, "tokenizer_identity": {"bos_token_id": "248044", "eos_token_id": "248046", "metadata_model": "gpt2", "representation": "embedded_gguf"}, "window_index": null, "window_sha256": null, "window_version": null}, {"actual_last_evaluated_position": 413, "archived_pilot_reuse": false, "arm": "focused_window", "attempted": true, "byte_end": 395, "byte_start": 0, "call_id": "sha256:c8abe6954c316e138c5d27ec", "disposition": "complete", "eligible": true, "error": null, "generated_tokens": 0, "gold_label": null, "group_id": "group-f7698bd83e406bc09970a7cd", "kv_state_id": "reset-epoch-1380", "label_to_option_id": {" A": "contains_unsupported", " B": "supported"}, "log_odds_contains_unsupported": -3.3378353118896484, "marked_response": "<<CARNOT_FOCUS_START:0:395>>Based on the given passages, the benefits of broccoli include supporting a healthy nervous system and optimal brain function through its potassium content, regulating blood pressure due to its high potassium, magnesium, and calcium levels, providing the recommended daily amount of vitamin C, and potentially preventing ca