y with oil.\\n\\npassage 3:1 Place in a bowl and coat lightly with oil. 2  Sprinkle with kosher salt and place potato directly on rack in middle of oven. 3  Place a baking sheet (I put a piece of aluminum foil) on the lower rack to catch any drippings. 4  Bake 1 hour or until skin feels crisp but flesh beneath feels soft.\\n\\n\",\"question\":\"how to bake the best potato\"}", "source_version": {"corpus": "ragtruth", "license": "MIT", "release_revision": "c103204b9ce28d6bbad859304bf30de72b8ed8fe"}, "state_reset": true, "token_boundary_receipts": {" A": true, " B": true}, "tokenize_s": 0.0008195059999707155, "tokenizer_identity": {"bos_token_id": "248044", "eos_token_id": "248046", "metadata_model": "gpt2", "representation": "embedded_gguf"}, "window_index": 0, "window_sha256": "sha256:5a7c2bd5eb24b255f2f0bb79b4fba766d1f3457f7d16c66fc2518c9d9f80597d", "window_version": "carnot-balanced-contiguous-v1"}, {"actual_last_evaluated_position": 452, "archived_pilot_reuse": false, "arm": "focused_window", "attempted": true, "byte_end": 353, "byte_start": 196, "call_id": "sha256:d248477f35bf8fab3045b25b", "disposition": "complete", "eligible": true, "error": null, "generated_tokens": 0, "gold_label": null, "group_id": "group-0b17757f52736a704fe80ca5", "kv_state_id": "reset-epoch-1425", "label_to_option_id": {" A": "contains_unsupported", " B": "supported"}, "log_odds_contains_unsupported": -1.1089649200439453, "marked_response": "To bake the best potato, heat the oven to 350\u00b0F and position racks in the top and bottom thirds. Wash the potato thoroughly and dry it. Use a fork to poke 8 to 12 deep holes all over the potato. <<CARNOT_FOCUS_START:196:353>>Place the potato in a bowl and lightly coat it with oil. Sprinkle with kosher salt and place the potato directly on the oven rack in the middle of the oven. <<CARNOT_FOCUS_END>>Place a baking sheet on the lower rack to catch any drippings. Bake for 1 hour or until the skin feels crisp but the flesh beneath feels soft.", "mode