oom or bedroom throw, and a fun topper for a toddler mattress.\nPURA D'OR Apple Cider Vinegar Thin2Thick Set: $29.99 (25% off)\nThin hair is no match for the impressive PURA D'OR Apple Cider Vinegar Thin2Thick Set. It harnesses the power of real apple cider vinegar, biotin, keratin and caffeine to invigorate the scalp and encourage a thick, vibrant appearance.\nIt's ideal for adults with all hair types and leaves a great shine behind after use.\nLove these deals or have your ideas to share? Leave a comment below!", "source_version": {"corpus": "ragtruth", "license": "MIT", "release_revision": "c103204b9ce28d6bbad859304bf30de72b8ed8fe"}, "state_reset": true, "token_boundary_receipts": {" A": true, " B": true}, "tokenize_s": 0.0020064239997736877, "tokenizer_identity": {"bos_token_id": "248044", "eos_token_id": "248046", "metadata_model": "gpt2", "representation": "embedded_gguf"}, "window_index": null, "window_sha256": null, "window_version": null}, {"actual_last_evaluated_position": 824, "archived_pilot_reuse": false, "arm": "focused_window", "attempted": true, "byte_end": 75, "byte_start": 0, "call_id": "sha256:68c840f4778fa39ef3fbf55c", "disposition": "complete", "eligible": true, "error": null, "generated_tokens": 0, "gold_label": null, "group_id": "group-599a64186778a4d46224aa2f", "kv_state_id": "reset-epoch-1570", "label_to_option_id": {" A": "supported", " B": "contains_unsupported"}, "log_odds_contains_unsupported": -0.36663722991943354, "marked_response": "<<CARNOT_FOCUS_START:0:75>>Amazon has begun early sales for its Prime Big Deal Days on October 10-11. <<CARNOT_FOCUS_END>>Some of the best deals include a 50% discount on a Lottabody Curl Mousse, a BISSELL CleanView Upright Bagless Vacuum for $106 (10% off), isotoner Terry Hoodback Clog Slippers for $24 (20% off), an Eddie Bauer Reversible Sherpa Fleece Throw for $15 (55% off), and a PURA D'OR Apple Cider Vinegar Thin2Thick Set for $29.99 (25% off). These deals are expected to sell out quickly due to their