 Food Delivery Services, American (New), Event Planning & Services, Restaurants, Food\",\"city\":\"Santa Barbara\",\"hours\":{\"Friday\":\"11:0-21:0\",\"Monday\":\"11:0-21:0\",\"Saturday\":\"11:0-21:0\",\"Sunday\":\"11:0-21:0\",\"Thursday\":\"11:0-21:0\",\"Tuesday\":\"11:0-21:0\",\"Wednesday\":\"11:0-21:0\"},\"name\":\"California Pasta\",\"review_info\":[{\"review_date\":\"2022-01-04 04:01:42\",\"review_stars\":4.0,\"review_text\":\"New girl working was very nice tonight for our takeout order! Answered phone politely,  gave us appropriate amount of napkins, utensils and condiments. We felt like valued customers! Thanks\"},{\"review_date\":\"2021-12-24 21:48:07\",\"review_stars\":1.0,\"review_text\":\"The minestrone was aweful. I got a bowl of onion and celery and maybe 3 pieces of pasta. I'm going to go try them again next week because I work close by but the minestrone was not good to me. I know it's usually a hit or miss but this was a complete miss and I had to go buy lunch again else where.\"},{\"review_date\":\"2021-11-29 03:38:23\",\"review_stars\":1.0,\"review_text\":\"Very sad to write this review because I used to love this place. I ordered a Cajun pasta and it tasted sour like vinegar, as if they had poured a whole bottle of Tabasco. I double checked and asked to see if it was Cajun sauce and was reassured it was. I asked if I could get something else because it didn't taste like Cajun sauce. The lady went to ask the manager who said I could buy a new meal with a 10% discount off. Not sure who taught them how to fix a meal.... I had barely eaten it. I asked for a side of sauce because they wouldn't take it back. They brought me a side of Alfredo sauce and it tasted worse. It tasted putrid and awful. Will not be returning...\"}],\"state\":\"CA\"}", "source_version": {"corpus": "ragtruth", "license": "MIT", "release_revision": "c103204b9ce28d6bbad859304bf30de72b8ed8fe"}, "state_reset": true, "token_boundary_receipts": {" A": true, " B": true}, "tokenize_s": 