king, outdoor seating, and is also suited for group dining. However, it does not provide WiFi or music, and it maintains a casual ambiance. Despite not accepting reservations, the restaurant still maintains an average rating of 3.5 stars. According to customer reviews, the restaurant is known for its great food, service, and atmosphere. Dishes like shrimp quesadilla, enchilada verde, and chilaquiles are highlighted as favorites. Customers also seem to enjoy the outdoor seating and the friendly staff.", "role": "calibration_tuning", "sealed_prompt_sha256": "sha256:db6d3109c4898cf54b2b6f823ab163e531f14e999900411f936e61876d4ef468", "sealed_prompt_token_count": 726, "sentence_count": null, "sentence_version": null, "source_group_id": "group-6d929f8ae2d83f347689591b", "source_sha256": "sha256:cb72510133cad7b9972a326aac5fe11003b5ecb64fff640c3b6c75870497688e", "source_text": "{\"address\":\"1816 Cliff Dr\",\"attributes\":{\"Ambience\":{\"casual\":true,\"classy\":false,\"divey\":false,\"hipster\":false,\"intimate\":false,\"romantic\":false,\"touristy\":false,\"trendy\":false,\"upscale\":false},\"BusinessParking\":{\"garage\":false,\"lot\":false,\"street\":true,\"valet\":false,\"validated\":false},\"Music\":null,\"OutdoorSeating\":true,\"RestaurantsGoodForGroups\":true,\"RestaurantsReservations\":false,\"RestaurantsTakeOut\":true,\"WiFi\":\"no\"},\"business_stars\":3.5,\"categories\":\"Restaurants, Mexican\",\"city\":\"Santa Barbara\",\"hours\":{\"Friday\":\"9:0-20:30\",\"Saturday\":\"8:0-20:30\",\"Sunday\":\"8:0-14:0\",\"Thursday\":\"9:0-20:0\",\"Tuesday\":\"9:0-20:0\",\"Wednesday\":\"9:0-20:0\"},\"name\":\"Rose Cafe No 2\",\"review_info\":[{\"review_date\":\"2021-10-07 21:48:38\",\"review_stars\":5.0,\"review_text\":\"Our favorite Mexican restaurant.  Great food,  service and atmosphere.  Favorite dishes are shrimp quesadilla and enchilada verde, but everything is delicious!\"},{\"review_date\":\"2021-10-07 01:36:52\",\"review_stars\":5.0,\"review_text\":\"Hands down the b