y system work together is that the heart send blood to the lungs, which is then oxygenated, so the blood can then be sent to the rest of the body (after being pumped back through the heart).\\n\\npassage 2:The respiratory and Digestion system work together by..... The respiratory system and the circulatory system work together by.... The circulatory system and the digestion system wrk together by....all the systams work together by... the circulatory system is the transportation of the blood throughout your bodyy.he respiratory and Digestion system work together by..... The respiratory system and the circulatory system work together by.... The circulatory system and the digestion system wrk together by....\\n\\npassage 3:The main way in which the respiratory and the circulatory system work together is that the heart send blood to the lungs, which is then oxygenated, so the blood can then be sent to the rest of the body (after being pumped back through the heart).he main way in which the respiratory and the circulatory system work together is that the heart send blood to the lungs, which is then oxygenated, so the blood can then be sent to the rest of the body (after being pumped back through the heart).\\n\\n\",\"question\":\"what do the cardiovascular system and the digestive system work together\"}", "source_version": {"corpus": "ragtruth", "license": "MIT", "release_revision": "c103204b9ce28d6bbad859304bf30de72b8ed8fe"}, "state_reset": true, "token_boundary_receipts": {" A": true, " B": true}, "tokenize_s": 0.0015987599999789381, "tokenizer_identity": {"bos_token_id": "248044", "eos_token_id": "248046", "metadata_model": "gpt2", "representation": "embedded_gguf"}, "window_index": null, "window_sha256": null, "window_version": null}, {"actual_last_evaluated_position": 486, "archived_pilot_reuse": false, "arm": "focused_window", "attempted": true, "byte_end": 129, "byte_start": 0, "call_id": "sha256:7855cd433210465ea1cfec09", "disposition": "complete", "eligible": 