hings between Teresa Giudice and Melissa Gorga.\nHowever, it will be interesting to see where she stands regarding what happened between Jennifer Aydin and Danielle Cabral. The ladies were paused from filming after an altercation drew blood from Danielle but went back to work shortly after the incident.\nMost recently, Dolores attended a live taping of Teresa\u2019s podcast alongside Jennifer, Jackie Golschneider, and Jennifer Fessler. The cast seems divided down the middle, with Dolores one of the only women who will attend events from both sides.\nThe RHONJ star has been living her best life with Paulie while sharing her updated weight loss progress. She doesn\u2019t appear concerned that her followers are worried. Dolores has been honest about using Ozempic, admitting it on an episode of Watch What Happens Live.\nDolores hasn\u2019t responded to the concern, and she likely won\u2019t.\nThe Real Housewives of New Jersey is currently on hiatus.", "source_version": {"corpus": "ragtruth", "license": "MIT", "release_revision": "c103204b9ce28d6bbad859304bf30de72b8ed8fe"}, "state_reset": true, "token_boundary_receipts": {" A": true, " B": true}, "tokenize_s": 0.001508250000370026, "tokenizer_identity": {"bos_token_id": "248044", "eos_token_id": "248046", "metadata_model": "gpt2", "representation": "embedded_gguf"}, "window_index": null, "window_sha256": null, "window_version": null}, {"actual_last_evaluated_position": 725, "archived_pilot_reuse": false, "arm": "focused_window", "attempted": true, "byte_end": 172, "byte_start": 0, "call_id": "sha256:c144cc6e4bf40e6da8e0c5fc", "disposition": "complete", "eligible": true, "error": null, "generated_tokens": 0, "gold_label": null, "group_id": "group-c2f7ab1794bd3555df0db212", "kv_state_id": "reset-epoch-1736", "label_to_option_id": {" A": "contains_unsupported", " B": "supported"}, "log_odds_contains_unsupported": 1.2047977447509766, "marked_response": "<<CARNOT_FOCUS_START:0:172>>Real Housewives of New Jersey star Dolores C