ter colors and reds. Separate sheets and towels from clothes and wash them separately. This step is important to ensure that the laundry is washed correctly.\n2. Make a cup of \"soap nut tea\" by soaking four or five bagged soap nuts in a cup of very hot water for three minutes. Pour the soap nuts and liquid into the wash. Remove the soap nuts from the washer at the end of the wash and let them dry. Repeat this process three to five times until the soap nuts are no longer effective. Soap nuts are no longer effective when they become thin, soft, mushy, and very light in color.\n3. Put dirty clothes into a washing machine that is connected to power and water. <<CARNOT_FOCUS_START:841:1241>>Add any liquid laundry detergent. Wash the clothes following the manufacturer's instructions. Once finished, remove the clothes from the washing machine and hang them up to dry or put them in the dryer.\n4. When doing laundry, always check the care label on each piece of clothing to make sure it can be washed safely. Avoid using too much detergent or fabric softener as these can damage the clothes.<<CARNOT_FOCUS_END>>", "model_sha256": "sha256:7e78da5d7e3ae28d178121f58646953305f3e5bd3cb46f4a75584e8b6c6fe169", "native_option_token_ids": {" A": 357, " B": 417}, "normalization": "two_option_softmax_float64", "option_order": ["supported", "contains_unsupported"], "order_remapping": {" A": "supported", " B": "contains_unsupported"}, "prefill_s": 0.7585943419999239, "probabilities_by_option_id": {"contains_unsupported": 0.9666850812584951, "supported": 0.03331491874150493}, "prompt_sha256": "sha256:6e5e6b9d8421480693d872de364a82dc5504b824ec35ea19e0815571e2736e6a", "prompt_token_count": 630, "prompt_token_ids": [1890, 1386, 1761, 364, 279, 4434, 1965, 1608, 1132, 279, 16713, 2450, 13, 271, 41578, 198, 4754, 6184, 1098, 3147, 6184, 416, 220, 16, 25, 8160, 369, 821, 2243, 314, 78817, 364, 414, 47527, 303, 28970, 18048, 38540, 25, 220, 16, 220, 66931, 279, 6623, 310, 8387, 836, 14656, 1083, 2