 561, 1965, 5435, 39072, 2144, 13, 271, 5423, 1132, 279, 2904, 2306, 13, 198, 15666, 25], "raw_logits_by_display_label": {" A": 16.63810157775879, " B": 16.375595092773438}, "raw_logits_by_option_id": {"contains_unsupported": 16.375595092773438, "supported": 16.63810157775879}, "readout_s": 3.680900044855662e-05, "request_id": "sha256:afd6186db8cb3dca81b4e5c8", "requested_score_position": 845, "response_sha256": "sha256:2b84833c02d3d2565f3f1584e19c44a1d13052ce0a179dec85cfc83c8c8cf9f0", "response_text": "Sam's To Go is a local restaurant located at 5979 Hollister Ave in Goleta, CA. It is categorized as an American (New) restaurant. The restaurant is open from 10:00 AM to 9:00 PM from Monday to Thursday, 10:00 AM to 9:00 PM on Friday, 10:00 AM to 8:30 PM on Saturday, and 10:00 AM to 8:00 PM on Sunday.\n\nAccording to the provided review information, there are mixed opinions about the restaurant. One customer had a negative experience, mentioning that the cashier did not wash her hands properly before handling food, which raised concerns about hygiene. On the other hand, two other customers had positive experiences and praised the service and the variety of food options available.\n\nThe restaurant offers free WiFi and outdoor seating. It also provides takeout services, but it is not suitable for larger groups. The music and ambience details were not mentioned in the data. The parking options include a parking lot, but not a garage or street parking.\n\nOverall, Sam's To Go has received a rating of 3.5 stars from customers. It appears to have a diverse menu, serving American (New) cuisine as well as Persian food options. However, it is important to note the negative review regarding food handling and hygiene.", "role": "calibration_tuning", "sealed_prompt_sha256": "sha256:5fb74663883f16628ba79a60158ebaa4fddc4f66a4aa858a9a4fa0549decc55e", "sealed_prompt_token_count": 846, "sentence_count": null, "sentence_version": null, "source_group_id": "group-cafef620130c6c01e063e43e", "source_sha256": "sha256:e4c1e86f77867a778c9a763e1cce2cd0128de82a17de3197725bac2ecb5b3552", "source_text": "{\"address\":\"5979 Hollister Ave\",\"attributes\":{\"Ambience\":null,\"BusinessParking\":{\"garage\":false,\"lot\":true,\"street\":false,\"valet\":false,\"validated\":false},\"Music\":null,\"OutdoorSeating\":true,\"RestaurantsGoodForGroups\":false,\"RestaurantsReservations\":false,\"RestaurantsTakeOut\":true,\"WiFi\":\"free\"},\"business_stars\":3.5,\"categories\":\"Restaurants, American (New)\",\"city\":\"Goleta\",\"hours\":{\"Friday\":\"10:0-21:0\",\"Monday\":\"10:0-21:0\",\"Saturday\":\"10:0-20:30\",\"Sunday\":\"10:0-20:0\",\"Thursday\":\"10:0-21:0\",\"Tuesday\":\"10:0-21:0\",\"Wednesday\":\"10:0-21:0\"},\"name\":\"Sam's To Go\",\"review_info\":[{\"review_date\":\"2013-11-30 23:13:45\",\"review_stars\":1.0,\"review_text\":\"I went here to get lunch, the cashier finished her transaction and then continued to make my sandwich. She had just handled cash, then put her contaminated hands into the meats and cheeses. That was enough for me...walked out and won't go back! Unfortunate because it smelled so good! Wash your hands!!!!! You are going to make people sick!!!!\"},{\"review_date\":\"2013-10-24 23:09:03\",\"review_stars\":5.0,\"review_text\":\"Wonderful service here!  Hal and Azi do a great job running this shop.   I prefer the soups, salads, and great Persian food over the sandwiches, but these are a nice healthy option.\"},{\"review_date\":\"2013-08-14 22:16:51\",\"review_stars\":5.0,\"review_text\":\"Wow - I just had the fecenjon and the shami this afternoon.  You cannot find delicious Persian food like this anywhere else in Santa Barbara.  Yes, it's normally a sandwich place (and the sandwiches are also good) but the Persian food is amazing. \\nThis Sams To Go is now Sams2U, so Yelp needs to update.\"}],\"state\":\"CA\"}", "source_version": {"corpus": "ragtruth", "license": "MIT", "release_revision": "c103204b9ce28d6bbad859304bf30de72b8ed8fe"}, "sta