00 PM on Friday, 10:00 AM to 8:30 PM on Saturday, and 10:00 AM to 8:00 PM on Sunday.\n\nAccording to the provided review information, there are mixed opinions about the restaurant. One customer had a negative experience, mentioning that the cashier did not wash her hands properly before handling food, which raised concerns about hygiene. On the other hand, two other customers had positive experiences and praised the service and the variety of food options available.\n\nThe restaurant offers free WiFi and outdoor seating. It also provides takeout services, but it is not suitable for larger groups. The music and ambience details were not mentioned in the data. The parking options include a parking lot, but not a garage or street parking.\n\nOverall, Sam's To Go has received a rating of 3.5 stars from customers. It appears to have a diverse menu, serving American (New) cuisine as well as Persian food options. However, it is important to note the negative review regarding food handling and hygiene.", "role": "calibration_tuning", "sealed_prompt_sha256": "sha256:112784713ac114ba1f59f93f21cc00f58db6f23a37f6007a6b6f02baa2ad8cf1", "sealed_prompt_token_count": 866, "sentence_count": 4, "sentence_version": "carnot-utf8-sentence-v1", "source_group_id": "group-cafef620130c6c01e063e43e", "source_sha256": "sha256:e4c1e86f77867a778c9a763e1cce2cd0128de82a17de3197725bac2ecb5b3552", "source_text": "{\"address\":\"5979 Hollister Ave\",\"attributes\":{\"Ambience\":null,\"BusinessParking\":{\"garage\":false,\"lot\":true,\"street\":false,\"valet\":false,\"validated\":false},\"Music\":null,\"OutdoorSeating\":true,\"RestaurantsGoodForGroups\":false,\"RestaurantsReservations\":false,\"RestaurantsTakeOut\":true,\"WiFi\":\"free\"},\"business_stars\":3.5,\"categories\":\"Restaurants, American (New)\",\"city\":\"Goleta\",\"hours\":{\"Friday\":\"10:0-21:0\",\"Monday\":\"10:0-21:0\",\"Saturday\":\"10:0-20:30\",\"Sunday\":\"10:0-20:0\",\"Thursday\":\"10:0-21:0\",\"Tuesday\":\"10:0-21:0\",\"Wednesd