329df509ed1d11bf1647", "source_text": "{\"address\":\"226 S Milpas St\",\"attributes\":{\"Ambience\":{\"casual\":false,\"classy\":false,\"divey\":true,\"hipster\":false,\"intimate\":false,\"romantic\":false,\"touristy\":false,\"trendy\":false,\"upscale\":false},\"BusinessParking\":{\"garage\":false,\"lot\":true,\"street\":false,\"valet\":false,\"validated\":false},\"Music\":null,\"OutdoorSeating\":true,\"RestaurantsGoodForGroups\":true,\"RestaurantsReservations\":false,\"RestaurantsTakeOut\":true,\"WiFi\":\"no\"},\"business_stars\":4.0,\"categories\":\"Sandwiches, Food, Delis, Restaurants\",\"city\":\"Santa Barbara\",\"hours\":null,\"name\":\"Norton's Pastrami and Deli\",\"review_info\":[{\"review_date\":\"2015-03-04 04:36:40\",\"review_stars\":5.0,\"review_text\":\"By far my most guilty pleasure when it comes to food. Best pastrami hands down. I will drive clear across town to get one. The shop is so cute too.\"},{\"review_date\":\"2014-11-21 16:59:31\",\"review_stars\":1.0,\"review_text\":\"if you want to get sick, eat their pastrami. 2 hours after ingesting pastrami, I started puking and that didn't stop for 12 hours. Beware\"},{\"review_date\":\"2014-10-29 23:48:25\",\"review_stars\":1.0,\"review_text\":\"One word sums up the Pastrami Dip S-A-L-T-Y!\\n\\nRoll is soft crunchy with a nice chew. The strami is thin cut and piled high.  My first bite screamed overly salted. Second bite screamed no flavor and I mean zero flavor. The \\\"dip\\\" [au jus] was NOT real flavored but from bullion and tasted chemically. And it too was salty. Came with a small one inch high cup of pickles which were olive green in color yet crunchy. These pickles were the most salted of all. \\n\\nOh yeah, $13.68 for the strami and diet Coke. Really?\\n\\nWon't be back unless I want to jack up my blood pressure.\"}],\"state\":\"CA\"}", "source_version": {"corpus": "ragtruth", "license": "MIT", "release_revision": "c103204b9ce28d6bbad859304bf30de72b8ed8fe"}, "state_reset": true, "token_bounda