92, 561, 1965, 5435, 39072, 2144, 13, 198, 33, 25, 7021, 1892, 561, 2400, 1965, 369, 7021, 539, 279, 16713, 2450, 13, 271, 5423, 1132, 279, 2904, 2306, 13, 198, 15666, 25], "raw_logits_by_display_label": {" A": 15.1520357131958, " B": 11.725993156433105}, "raw_logits_by_option_id": {"contains_unsupported": 15.1520357131958, "supported": 11.725993156433105}, "readout_s": 3.2871000257728156e-05, "request_id": "sha256:bfa7a99475bb5f96afb83f55", "requested_score_position": 761, "response_sha256": "sha256:3a50f6fe1ef28ed8c77cccc9280b2b09d069a0fae364f858648ff3b7149df530", "response_text": "Sure! Here's an objective overview of Norton's Pastrami and Deli based on the provided structured data:\n\nNorton's Pastrami and Deli is a delicatessen located in Santa Barbara, California. They offer sandwiches, food, and takeout, and have outdoor seating. Customers can expect to find validated parking and WiFi is not available. According to reviews, the pastrami is a popular item and some customers have reported long-lasting negative side effects after consuming it. One reviewer described the pastrami as \"overly salted\" and lacking in flavor, while another reviewer had a negative experience with food poisoning after eating there. However, another reviewer praised the soft, crunchy rolls and generous portion sizes. Prices are around $13-$14 per meal. Overall, Norton's Pastrami and Deli appears to be a casual dining establishment with mixed reviews.", "role": "calibration_tuning", "sealed_prompt_sha256": "sha256:7af3812664ceaa1f5370c3674d5557e5425e01dd43bc5f6e8c01446a742168ce", "sealed_prompt_token_count": 762, "sentence_count": 4, "sentence_version": "carnot-utf8-sentence-v1", "source_group_id": "group-ce8b5eea8e35900c23923947", "source_sha256": "sha256:c8d45e5950c6134ab2135bb87bf0afbdb1c8e798e616329df509ed1d11bf1647", "source_text": "{\"address\":\"226 S Milpas St\",\"attributes\":{\"Ambience\":{\"casual\":false,\"classy\":false,\"divey\":true,\"hipster\":false,\"intimate\":false,\"romantic\":false,\"touristy\":false,\"trendy\":false,\"upscale\":false},\"BusinessParking\":{\"garage\":false,\"lot\":true,\"street\":false,\"valet\":false,\"validated\":false},\"Music\":null,\"OutdoorSeating\":true,\"RestaurantsGoodForGroups\":true,\"RestaurantsReservations\":false,\"RestaurantsTakeOut\":true,\"WiFi\":\"no\"},\"business_stars\":4.0,\"categories\":\"Sandwiches, Food, Delis, Restaurants\",\"city\":\"Santa Barbara\",\"hours\":null,\"name\":\"Norton's Pastrami and Deli\",\"review_info\":[{\"review_date\":\"2015-03-04 04:36:40\",\"review_stars\":5.0,\"review_text\":\"By far my most guilty pleasure when it comes to food. Best pastrami hands down. I will drive clear across town to get one. The shop is so cute too.\"},{\"review_date\":\"2014-11-21 16:59:31\",\"review_stars\":1.0,\"review_text\":\"if you want to get sick, eat their pastrami. 2 hours after ingesting pastrami, I started puking and that didn't stop for 12 hours. Beware\"},{\"review_date\":\"2014-10-29 23:48:25\",\"review_stars\":1.0,\"review_text\":\"One word sums up the Pastrami Dip S-A-L-T-Y!\\n\\nRoll is soft crunchy with a nice chew. The strami is thin cut and piled high.  My first bite screamed overly salted. Second bite screamed no flavor and I mean zero flavor. The \\\"dip\\\" [au jus] was NOT real flavored but from bullion and tasted chemically. And it too was salty. Came with a small one inch high cup of pickles which were olive green in color yet crunchy. These pickles were the most salted of all. \\n\\nOh yeah, $13.68 for the strami and diet Coke. Really?\\n\\nWon't be back unless I want to jack up my blood pressure.\"}],\"state\":\"CA\"}", "source_version": {"corpus": "ragtruth", "license": "MIT", "release_revision": "c103204b9ce28d6bbad859304bf30de72b8ed8fe"}, "state_reset": true, "token_boundary_receipts": {" A": true, " B": true}, "tokenize_s": 0.0014512340003420832, "tokenizer_identity": {"bos_token_id": "248044", "eos_token_id": "248046", "metadata_model": "gpt2", "representat