 "raw_logits_by_display_label": {" A": 13.149030685424805, " B": 16.6093807220459}, "raw_logits_by_option_id": {"contains_unsupported": 16.6093807220459, "supported": 13.149030685424805}, "readout_s": 3.2951000321190804e-05, "request_id": "sha256:9576a3ba1b785f13171d0ac3", "requested_score_position": 753, "response_sha256": "sha256:0e867b8226a1531f343d8668c8655baf00688e7a6b4c7f6ff3bd11ec7af21733", "response_text": "Gaucho Cafe is a popular local restaurant located in the UCen area of Goleta, California. With a 4.0-star rating and positive reviews from customers, this cafe offers a wide range of delicious sandwiches and salads. The establishment boasts a spacious outdoor seating area, free WiFi, and takes reservations for small groups. While some patrons have expressed concerns about the quality of the eggs and freshness of ingredients, the majority of reviewers have praised the taste and variety of dishes available. Whether you're in the mood for a hearty sandwich or a fresh salad, Gaucho Cafe is sure to satisfy your appetite.", "role": "calibration_tuning", "sealed_prompt_sha256": "sha256:9f8571365fc56620b09b286c9e6ae989edff99468619e149c338a582499fd740", "sealed_prompt_token_count": 754, "sentence_count": null, "sentence_version": null, "source_group_id": "group-d32986b68d92d11dc98c0de1", "source_sha256": "sha256:2a1b401fe8a0ea2b0cc610e41231e5cbf809dbe36b8605b6659c8f18ff0b07e8", "source_text": "{\"address\":\"At the UCen\",\"attributes\":{\"Ambience\":null,\"BusinessParking\":null,\"Music\":null,\"OutdoorSeating\":true,\"RestaurantsGoodForGroups\":null,\"RestaurantsReservations\":false,\"RestaurantsTakeOut\":true,\"WiFi\":null},\"business_stars\":4.0,\"categories\":\"Delis, Restaurants, Sandwiches\",\"city\":\"Goleta\",\"hours\":null,\"name\":\"Gaucho Cafe\",\"review_info\":[{\"review_date\":\"2015-06-24 00:04:42\",\"review_stars\":5.0,\"review_text\":\"Gaucho Cafe had the finest cantaloupe, watermelon, and olive tapenade salad I've ever had. It might be the best salad I've had in my entire life, and this is coming from a self-described salad aficionado. The cantaloupe is just past ripe and it is served over a generous helping of delicious SPROUTS along with the rest of the aforementioned ingredients. I really wish this place wasn't closed as I've tried recreating this salad but haven't had any luck at all.\"},{\"review_date\":\"2010-10-15 01:54:30\",\"review_stars\":3.0,\"review_text\":\"The line is long around the lunch hour, but it's understandable.\\n\\nI really liked the scrambled eggs breakfast combo, although I was disappointed with the eggs were obviously watery (made from instant liquid yolk). The ham I asked for was also straight up sandwich ham. I was expecting a ham steak for some reason.\\n\\nOverall the breakfast was okay though. Very filling\\n\\nI'll likely be coming here, perhaps to try other breakfast options or salads\"},{\"review_date\":\"2010-08-04 22:46:00\",\"review_stars\":4.0,\"review_text\":\"Gaucho Cafe is a no-frills salad and sandwich place with a DEEP menu that doesn't disappoint. The place has a huge selection of hot and cold sandwiches with plenty of options for us vegetarians. I have been here a handful of times, and I have never been unhappy with my food. The sandwiches don't come with anything else, and look plain and lonely on a white paper plate, but throw on a side salad for a buck, and you have a nice happy lunch. The food is definitely tasty, but the portions could be a bit bigger, and the ingredients could be fresher. Besides that (and their cash-only policy) I have no complaints. The service is friendly and pleasant, the food is great, and their options are almost endless. Easily one of the best places to eat on campus.\"}],\"state\":\"CA\"}", "source_version": {"corpus": "ragtruth", "license": "MIT", "release_revision": "c103204b9ce28d6bbad859304bf30de72b8ed8fe"}, "state_reset": true, "token_boundary_receipts": {" A": true, " B": true}, "tokenize_s": 0.0020061650002389797, "tokenizer