andwiches don't come with anything else, and look plain and lonely on a white paper plate, but throw on a side salad for a buck, and you have a nice happy lunch. The food is definitely tasty, but the portions could be a bit bigger, and the ingredients could be fresher. Besides that (and their cash-only policy) I have no complaints. The service is friendly and pleasant, the food is great, and their options are almost endless. Easily one of the best places to eat on campus.\"}],\"state\":\"CA\"}", "source_version": {"corpus": "ragtruth", "license": "MIT", "release_revision": "c103204b9ce28d6bbad859304bf30de72b8ed8fe"}, "state_reset": true, "token_boundary_receipts": {" A": true, " B": true}, "tokenize_s": 0.00158669899974484, "tokenizer_identity": {"bos_token_id": "248044", "eos_token_id": "248046", "metadata_model": "gpt2", "representation": "embedded_gguf"}, "window_index": 1, "window_sha256": "sha256:072a5867330f06865cece18d597a913458c578290c2e28cdabd6657ca96fcb7a", "window_version": "carnot-balanced-contiguous-v1"}, {"actual_last_evaluated_position": 775, "archived_pilot_reuse": false, "arm": "focused_window", "attempted": true, "byte_end": 623, "byte_start": 511, "call_id": "sha256:3460a2bd617eaf90fad08bec", "disposition": "complete", "eligible": true, "error": null, "generated_tokens": 0, "gold_label": null, "group_id": "group-d32986b68d92d11dc98c0de1", "kv_state_id": "reset-epoch-1788", "label_to_option_id": {" A": "supported", " B": "contains_unsupported"}, "log_odds_contains_unsupported": 4.266923904418945, "marked_response": "Gaucho Cafe is a popular local restaurant located in the UCen area of Goleta, California. With a 4.0-star rating and positive reviews from customers, this cafe offers a wide range of delicious sandwiches and salads. The establishment boasts a spacious outdoor seating area, free WiFi, and takes reservations for small groups. While some patrons have expressed concerns about the quality of the eggs and freshness of ingredients, the majorit