ponse_text": "Based on the given passages, here are some uses for soybeans:\n\n1. Food for humans (soybeans can be used to make various food products such as tofu, tempeh, edamame, and soy milk)\n2. Animal feed (ground soybean fiber can be used to create feed products for cattle, chickens, and other farm animals)\n3. Industrial products (soybeans can be used to reduce the petroleum content in commercial and industrial products, such as plastics, fibers, and other materials)\n4. Crude soybean oil (can be extracted from soybeans and used in various applications such as cooking oil, cosmetics, and biofuel)\n5. Soybean meal (a byproduct of soybean processing, it is high in protein and can be used as animal feed or as an ingredient in fertilizers)\n6. Fish food (soy protein can be used to make fish food)\n\nTherefore, the answer to the question \"What are some uses for soybeans?\" is: food, animal feed, industrial products, crude soybean oil, soybean meal, and fish food.", "role": "calibration_tuning", "sealed_prompt_sha256": "sha256:695e181916bf48ed28f49bd407eb0ad91395da3958e061f94769ce2fec1b99e7", "sealed_prompt_token_count": 529, "sentence_count": null, "sentence_version": null, "source_group_id": "group-d755a87e7a78127e75817dfd", "source_sha256": "sha256:e4672040bd9e87166df0cb0cc2a1591fef57d09fee39c900d0823f8296beb479", "source_text": "{\"passages\":\"passage 1:New Uses. Soybeans offer an abundant and renewable supply of ingredients, making it possible for companies to reduce the petroleum content in commercial and industrial products. The soy checkoff partners with manufacturers to commercialize new soy-based products, giving farmers and others even more opportunities to buy products that contain U.S. soy.\\n\\npassage 2:Uses of Soybeans. When the farmer sells soybeans to a grain dealer, the beans may then go to a number of ultimate destinations. When processed, a 60-pound bushel will yield about 11 pounds of crude soybean oil and 47 pounds of soybean meal. Soybeans are about 18% oil and 38% protein.\\n\\npassage 3:Along with being food for humans, the soybean can also be used to create feed products for animals. Ground soybean fiber is separated from the oil and is toasted to create the basis for a number of feeds for cattle, chickens, and other farm animals. Soy protein is also used in many different brands of fish food.\\n\\n\",\"question\":\"what are uses for soybeans\"}", "source_version": {"corpus": "ragtruth", "license": "MIT", "release_revision": "c103204b9ce28d6bbad859304bf30de72b8ed8fe"}, "state_reset": true, "token_boundary_receipts": {" A": true, " B": true}, "tokenize_s": 0.0011056650000682566, "tokenizer_identity": {"bos_token_id": "248044", "eos_token_id": "248046", "metadata_model": "gpt2", "representation": "embedded_gguf"}, "window_index": null, "window_sha256": null, "window_version": null}, {"actual_last_evaluated_position": 548, "archived_pilot_reuse": false, "arm": "focused_window", "attempted": true, "byte_end": 301, "byte_start": 0, "call_id": "sha256:ed818dc5c85eac1e3df719b7", "disposition": "complete", "eligible": true, "error": null, "generated_tokens": 0, "gold_label": null, "group_id": "group-d755a87e7a78127e75817dfd", "kv_state_id": "reset-epoch-1802", "label_to_option_id": {" A": "supported", " B": "contains_unsupported"}, "log_odds_contains_unsupported": 2.3499155044555664, "marked_response": "<<CARNOT_FOCUS_START:0:301>>Based on the given passages, here are some uses for soybeans:\n\n1. Food for humans (soybeans can be used to make various food products such as tofu, tempeh, edamame, and soy milk)\n2. Animal feed (ground soybean fiber can be used to create feed products for cattle, chickens, and other farm animals)\n3. <<CARNOT_FOCUS_END>>Industrial products (soybeans can be used to reduce the petroleum content in commercial and industrial products, such as plastics, fibers, and other materials)\n4. Crude soybean oil (can be extracted from soybeans and used in various applications such as cooking oil, cosmetics, and biofuel)\n5. Soybean meal (a byproduct of soybean processing, it is high in protein and can be used as animal feed or as an ingredient in fertilizers)\n6. Fish food (soy protein can be used to make fish food)\n\nTherefore, the answer to the question \"What are some uses for soybeans?\" is: food, animal feed, industrial products, crude soybean oil, soybean meal, and fish food.", "model_sha256": "sha256:7e78da5d7e3ae28d178121f58646953305f3e5bd3cb46f4a75584e8b6c6fe169", "native_option_token_ids": {" A": 357, " B": 417}, "normalization": "two_option_softmax_float64", "option_order": ["supported", "contains_unsupported"], "order_remapping": {" A": "supported", " B": "contains_unsupported"}, "prefill_s": 0.6696695020000334, "probabilities_by_option_id": {"contains_unsupported": 0.9129275111696891, "supported": 0.08707248883031084}, "prompt_sha256": "sha256:7d425a060eb955b82c5c7718fc1ed5d83698e69e523b9497e1c0e44c1951f54e", "prompt_token_count": 549, "prompt_token_ids": [1890, 1386, 1761, 364, 279, 4434, 1965, 1608, 1132, 279, 16713, 2450, 13, 271, 41578, 198, 4754, 6184, 1098, 3147, 6184, 416, 220, 16, 25, 3446, 37539, 13, 59914, 26455, 2915, 449, 42072, 321, 31108, 7892, 314, 13565, 11, 3154, 424, 3102, 364, 4948, 310, 7698, 279, 56968, 2144, 303, 8094, 321, 12419, 3741, 13, 561, 27798, 1716, 1783, 8287, 440, 16133, 310, 8094, 537, 491, 27798, 5792, 3741, 11, 6866, 19719, 321, 3672, 1442, 777, 10175, 310, 3569, 3741, 421, 6435, 533, 782, 13, 27798, 6889, 77, 1639, 6184, 416, 220, 17, 25, 66631, 314, 59914, 26455, 13, 3095, 279, 35197, 29772, 27798, 26455, 310, 264, 23177, 22596, 11, 279, 26034, 1189, 1179, 708, 310, 264, 1324, 314, 16233, 32007, 13, 3095, 14789, 11, 264, 220, 21, 15, 46042, 28704, 300, 668, 7302, 883, 220, 16, 16, 15823, 314, 33503, 27798, 16959, 5415, 321, 220, 19, 22, 15823, 314, 27798, 16959, 14704, 13, 59914, 26455, 513, 883, 220, 16, 23, 4, 5415, 321, 220, 18, 23, 4, 12465, 6889, 77, 1639, 6184, 416, 220, 18, 25, 48134, 440, 16