ommending the family-owned business for their hard work and dedication to serving good food. However, one reviewer expresses disappointment with the restaurant's refusal to offer curbside service during the pandemic.\n\nOverall, Foster's Freeze appears to be a popular local spot for casual dining and desserts, with friendly service and a cozy atmosphere. However, some customers may have had issues with the restaurant's policy regarding curbside service during the pandemic.", "role": "calibration_tuning", "sealed_prompt_sha256": "sha256:21f2faa2442d76073108293b320d5f8cb91362a8445b04fcd2b2f6d92a1c5e54", "sealed_prompt_token_count": 809, "sentence_count": null, "sentence_version": null, "source_group_id": "group-f42b7476f67a11fece667042", "source_sha256": "sha256:073da202e9fd97632b2bda5e4758b71e778d0b6b272dc48826fd5c72b375180b", "source_text": "{\"address\":\"5205 Carpinteria Ave\",\"attributes\":{\"Ambience\":{\"casual\":false,\"classy\":false,\"divey\":false,\"hipster\":false,\"intimate\":false,\"romantic\":false,\"touristy\":false,\"trendy\":false,\"upscale\":false},\"BusinessParking\":{\"garage\":false,\"lot\":true,\"street\":null,\"valet\":false,\"validated\":false},\"Music\":null,\"OutdoorSeating\":true,\"RestaurantsGoodForGroups\":true,\"RestaurantsReservations\":false,\"RestaurantsTakeOut\":true,\"WiFi\":\"no\"},\"business_stars\":2.5,\"categories\":\"Ice Cream & Frozen Yogurt, Burgers, Restaurants, Food, American (Traditional)\",\"city\":\"Carpinteria\",\"hours\":{\"Friday\":\"11:0-22:0\",\"Monday\":\"10:30-22:0\",\"Saturday\":\"11:0-22:0\",\"Sunday\":\"11:0-22:0\",\"Thursday\":\"10:30-22:0\",\"Tuesday\":\"10:30-22:0\",\"Wednesday\":\"10:30-22:0\"},\"name\":\"Fosters Freeze\",\"review_info\":[{\"review_date\":\"2020-09-13 18:47:42\",\"review_stars\":5.0,\"review_text\":\"This place was always amazing. Went there as a kid, took my kids and Grandkids. Always a good burger, good fries and great Ice Cream. It was a gathering place for Classic Car enthusiasts and B