 variety of menu items including burgers, ice cream, and frozen yogurt. According to customer reviews, the restaurant has a casual and welcoming atmosphere, with outdoor seating available. The restaurant is open seven days a week from 10:30 AM to 10:00 PM, with validated parking available in the lot.\n\nCustomers praise Foster's Freeze for its delicious burgers, fries, and ice cream, with one reviewer calling it \"a gathering place for Classic Car enthusiasts and Bikers\" and another commending the family-owned business for their hard work and dedication to serving good food. However, one reviewer expresses disappointment with the restaurant's refusal to offer curbside service during the pandemic.\n\nOverall, Foster's Freeze appears to be a popular local spot for casual dining and desserts, with friendly service and a cozy atmosphere. However, some customers may have had issues with the restaurant's policy regarding curbside service during the pandemic.", "role": "calibration_tuning", "sealed_prompt_sha256": "sha256:11d28808b77d8c578718311335edccaee98134890376a289fe30e0029f26b9c8", "sealed_prompt_token_count": 829, "sentence_count": 2, "sentence_version": "carnot-utf8-sentence-v1", "source_group_id": "group-f42b7476f67a11fece667042", "source_sha256": "sha256:073da202e9fd97632b2bda5e4758b71e778d0b6b272dc48826fd5c72b375180b", "source_text": "{\"address\":\"5205 Carpinteria Ave\",\"attributes\":{\"Ambience\":{\"casual\":false,\"classy\":false,\"divey\":false,\"hipster\":false,\"intimate\":false,\"romantic\":false,\"touristy\":false,\"trendy\":false,\"upscale\":false},\"BusinessParking\":{\"garage\":false,\"lot\":true,\"street\":null,\"valet\":false,\"validated\":false},\"Music\":null,\"OutdoorSeating\":true,\"RestaurantsGoodForGroups\":true,\"RestaurantsReservations\":false,\"RestaurantsTakeOut\":true,\"WiFi\":\"no\"},\"business_stars\":2.5,\"categories\":\"Ice Cream & Frozen Yogurt, Burgers, Restaurants, Food, American (Traditional)\",\"city\":\"Carpinteria\",\"hours\